asr-000918
01:00:08.980 --> 01:00:10.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But the Senate has a role.

asr-000919
01:00:10.960 --> 01:00:18.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And when we speak on foreign policy issues, we are exercising that role.

asr-000920
01:00:18.820 --> 01:00:33.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So may we be clarified through the sponsor, former chairman of the Committee on Foreign Relations, as a matter of fact.

asr-000921
01:00:33.660 --> 01:00:36.040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Thank you, Senator Kiko.

asr-000922
01:00:36.140 --> 01:00:47.700
