Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: It was directed, according to her, to executive officials of the executive branch.

asr-000926
01:01:05.020 --> 01:01:08.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yun lang nga po, nagkaroon lang po ng misunderstanding and miscommunication.

asr-000927
01:01:08.860 --> 01:01:16.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: But after that po, we have called the attention of the Chinese embassy regarding that matter.

asr-000928
01:01:16.360 --> 01:01:18.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So ngayon po, medyo tumahimik nga po.

asr-000929
01:01:18.820 --> 01:01:23.500
