01:34:59.180 --> 01:34:59.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that correct?

asr-001575
01:34:59.520 --> 01:34:59.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that correct?

asr-001576
01:35:00.860 --> 01:35:02.520
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: It's at 98 billion.

asr-001577
01:35:03.020 --> 01:35:04.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So are you not afraid that we're running out

asr-001578
01:35:04.980 --> 01:35:06.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of all our dollars?

asr-001579
01:35:07.180 --> 01:35:07.860
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: I'm afraid.

asr-001580
01:35:09.940 --> 01:35:11.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What are we going to do?

asr-001581
01:35:11.720 --> 01:35:12.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We're going to be scared.

asr-001582
01:35:13.420 --> 01:35:14.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's Halloween soon.

asr-001583
01:35:14.960 --> 01:35:16.000
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: For now, it's okay.

asr-001584
01:35:17.600 --> 01:35:19.660
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: For now, it's okay, Senator.

asr-001585
01:35:20.500 --> 01:35:21.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You have a promise

asr-001586
01:35:21.360 --> 01:35:23.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: in the committee. I remember.

asr-001587
01:35:23.560 --> 01:35:25.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You said before year ends,

asr-001588
01:35:25.140 --> 01:35:26.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: we'll reach 100,000.

asr-001589
01:35:26.740 --> 01:35:28.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 104 billion US dollars.

asr-001590
01:35:28.720 --> 01:35:31.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We'll be able to jack up to 104 billion.

asr-001591
01:35:32.000 --> 01:35:33.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Na sa pakiwari ninyo,

asr-001592
01:35:33.500 --> 01:35:35.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: sabi po ninyo, mas safe po yun

asr-001593
01:35:35.520 --> 01:35:38.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: kesa sa 98 kung saan tayo ngayon.

asr-001594
01:35:39.220 --> 01:35:39.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tama po ba?

asr-001595
01:35:40.360 --> 01:35:41.540
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Mas safe po ngayon.

asr-001596
01:35:41.960 --> 01:35:43.380
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero medyo safe pa rin.

asr-001597
01:35:43.880 --> 01:35:45.000
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Medyo safe pa rin.

asr-001598
01:35:45.140 --> 01:35:47.700
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Equivalent to six months of imports.

asr-001599
01:35:47.900 --> 01:35:48.820
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung ating reserves.

asr-001600
01:35:48.820 --> 01:35:50.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Six months of imports po. Yung 98 billion.

asr-001601
01:35:51.140 --> 01:35:52.100
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung 98 billion.

asr-001602
01:35:52.100 --> 01:35:53.500
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Saka equivalent to

asr-001603
01:35:53.500 --> 01:35:56.280
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: three times our short-term debt.

asr-001604
01:35:56.740 --> 01:35:58.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero wala nang pag-asa

asr-001605
01:35:58.960 --> 01:36:01.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: umabot doon sa 104 na pinangako po ninyo.

asr-001606
01:36:02.620 --> 01:36:03.680
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: May pag-asa naman.

asr-001607
01:36:03.900 --> 01:36:05.500
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kailangan lang na...

asr-001608
01:36:05.500 --> 01:36:06.180
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Alam nyo po,

asr-001609
01:36:06.760 --> 01:36:08.820
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: ang lakas ng imports natin.

asr-001610
01:36:09.040 --> 01:36:11.580
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang hina ng exports natin.

asr-001611
01:36:11.680 --> 01:36:11.960
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Opo.

asr-001612
01:36:12.960 --> 01:36:15.320
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Sa exports, ang gagaling yung dollars.

asr-001613
01:36:15.660 --> 01:36:17.560
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tapos sa imports, nagagasto.

asr-001614
01:36:18.100 --> 01:36:20.580
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, yun ang underlying issue.

asr-001615
01:36:20.900 --> 01:36:22.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakikita po natin yun.

asr-001616
01:36:22.200 --> 01:36:23.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya ako nagtataka,

asr-001617
01:36:23.080 --> 01:36:24.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: doon sa buong budget natin,

asr-001618
01:36:25.120 --> 01:36:26.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: wala tayong nakikita na,

asr-001619
01:36:26.740 --> 01:36:28.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na export support.

asr-001620
01:36:29.080 --> 01:36:29.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Katulad sa,

asr-001621
01:36:30.260 --> 01:36:31.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: iisang magandang numero.

asr-001622
01:36:32.140 --> 01:36:35.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa buong economic numbers natin,

asr-001623
01:36:35.540 --> 01:36:37.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang iisa na maayos na numero

asr-001624
01:36:37.680 --> 01:36:39.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ay galing sa electronic sector.

asr-001625
01:36:39.820 --> 01:36:40.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Alam po natin,

asr-001626
01:36:40.700 --> 01:36:42.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nasa 26% uptick

asr-001627
01:36:42.660 --> 01:36:43.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang export.

asr-001628
01:36:43.880 --> 01:36:44.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil sa AI,

asr-001629
01:36:44.960 --> 01:36:46.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: at sa data center,

asr-001630
01:36:46.180 --> 01:36:47.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: sa iba't iba pang requirement.

asr-001631
01:36:48.000 --> 01:36:49.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero niisang kusing

asr-001632
01:36:49.420 --> 01:36:50.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: sa buong budget ng 2027,

asr-001633
01:36:51.560 --> 01:36:54.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ibinibigay sa ating number one export.

asr-001634
01:36:54.780 --> 01:36:56.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At yung ating electronic,

asr-001635
01:36:56.740 --> 01:36:57.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: sa electronics industry.

asr-001636
01:36:57.740 --> 01:36:59.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Natatakal lang nga po ako doon.

asr-001637
01:36:59.400 --> 01:37:02.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi, salita tayo ng salita ng export.

asr-001638
01:37:02.060 --> 01:37:04.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh yung iisang export na well performing,

asr-001639
01:37:04.980 --> 01:37:08.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: hindi pa natin bigay yung kanilang wafer fabrication

asr-001640
01:37:08.180 --> 01:37:11.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: at hinihingi na nila for the last 10 years.

asr-001641
01:37:11.180 --> 01:37:12.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala lang, comment lang po.

asr-001642
01:37:12.980 --> 01:37:15.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil na, naawa naman ako sa kanila.

asr-001643
01:37:15.860 --> 01:37:18.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh, tagal-tagal na nilang humihingi dyan.

asr-001644
01:37:18.620 --> 01:37:22.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa pag-ubos po natin ng dollar reserves,

asr-001645
01:37:22.140 --> 01:37:23.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ahm,

asr-001646
01:37:23.540 --> 01:37:26.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: lagi ko nalang tinatanong,

asr-001647
01:37:26.740 --> 01:37:31.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: itong detailed accounting ng gold sales.

asr-001648
01:37:31.240 --> 01:37:32.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maraming nagtaka,

asr-001649
01:37:32.500 --> 01:37:35.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: pataas ng pataas yung ginto sa world market.

asr-001650
01:37:35.740 --> 01:37:37.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang Pilipinas naman,

asr-001651
01:37:37.500 --> 01:37:39.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nagbenta na nagbenta.

asr-001652
01:37:39.500 --> 01:37:41.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang tanong, eh,

asr-001653
01:37:41.500 --> 01:37:44.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: kailan ba ninyo ibibigay yung listahan na yun?

asr-001654
01:37:44.500 --> 01:37:46.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung detailed accounting ng pagbenta ng gold?

asr-001655
01:37:46.980 --> 01:37:48.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At ipaliwanag sa amin,

asr-001656
01:37:48.740 --> 01:37:50.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: bakit nagbenta ng ginto

asr-001657
01:37:50.740 --> 01:37:53.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nung panahon na pataas na pataas ang ginto?

asr-001658
01:37:53.740 --> 01:37:54.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ngayon, alam natin,

asr-001659
01:37:54.740 --> 01:37:56.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: pilak naman ang tumataas yung ginto.

asr-001660
01:37:56.740 --> 01:37:58.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nag-stabilize.

asr-001661
01:37:58.240 --> 01:37:59.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ba't tayo nagbenta?

asr-001662
01:37:59.740 --> 01:38:01.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At magkano?

asr-001663
01:38:01.240 --> 01:38:05.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At saan inilaan yung proceeds nung bentang yun?

asr-001664
01:38:05.740 --> 01:38:07.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yun pong ah,

asr-001665
01:38:07.240 --> 01:38:09.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: strategy natin sa gold.

asr-001666
01:38:09.240 --> 01:38:12.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi po, hindi po tayo tumataya sa gold.

asr-001667
01:38:12.240 --> 01:38:14.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi namin alam kung tataas o bababa.

asr-001668
01:38:14.740 --> 01:38:16.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang strategy po natin,

asr-001669
01:38:16.740 --> 01:38:19.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: risk management ng portfolio.

asr-001670
01:38:19.240 --> 01:38:22.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang gold kasama sa portfolio

asr-001671
01:38:22.240 --> 01:38:24.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: ng ating reserves.

asr-001672
01:38:24.240 --> 01:38:26.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung portfolio na yun, karamihan nun na,

asr-001673
01:38:26.240 --> 01:38:29.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: tinatawag na fixed income assets.

asr-001674
01:38:29.240 --> 01:38:32.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Mga bonds, mga karamihan dollars,

asr-001675
01:38:32.240 --> 01:38:35.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: 88% ng reserves natin, dollars.

asr-001676
01:38:35.240 --> 01:38:37.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ngayon, gold, hindi kumikita yun eh.

asr-001677
01:38:37.740 --> 01:38:39.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Walang interest ng gold.

asr-001678
01:38:39.740 --> 01:38:43.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Nagbabayad tayo ng custody fee na medyo mahal

asr-001679
01:38:43.740 --> 01:38:47.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: sa London gold bullion market.

asr-001680
01:38:47.240 --> 01:38:48.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: May bayad yun.

asr-001681
01:38:48.240 --> 01:38:50.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, merong tamang ano eh,

asr-001682
01:38:50.240 --> 01:38:53.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: quantity ng gold para sa buong portfolio natin.

asr-001683
01:38:53.240 --> 01:38:55.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Para tama siyang hedge.

asr-001684
01:38:55.240 --> 01:38:57.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kasi may panahon,

asr-001685
01:38:57.240 --> 01:38:59.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: pag tumaas masyadong interest rate,

asr-001686
01:38:59.240 --> 01:39:01.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: yung value ng bonds natin bumababa.

asr-001687
01:39:01.240 --> 01:39:02.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Babagsak.

asr-001688
01:39:02.240 --> 01:39:03.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, doon.

asr-001689
01:39:03.240 --> 01:39:05.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, binabalance lang po ninyo.

asr-001690
01:39:05.240 --> 01:39:06.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: E, labis-labis.

asr-001691
01:39:06.240 --> 01:39:08.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa pakiwaring ninyo, sa tingin ninyo,

asr-001692
01:39:08.240 --> 01:39:11.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: labis-labis na yung ginto na nasa BSP.

asr-001693
01:39:11.240 --> 01:39:14.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Parang ganun, para mabalance yung ating portfolio.

asr-001694
01:39:14.240 --> 01:39:16.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tama po, tama.

asr-001695
01:39:16.240 --> 01:39:18.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh, how much gold did the BSP sell?

asr-001696
01:39:18.240 --> 01:39:20.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And when?

asr-001697
01:39:20.240 --> 01:39:21.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: We have a report.

asr-001698
01:39:21.240 --> 01:39:22.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And what price?

asr-001699
01:39:22.240 --> 01:39:24.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi ang tagal na naming iniintay yan eh.

asr-001700
01:39:24.240 --> 01:39:28.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Naka dalawang taon na yata akong nagtatanong ng same question.

asr-001701
01:39:28.240 --> 01:39:33.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Nagre-report po kami sa World Gold Council, sa IMF Summit.

asr-001702
01:39:33.240 --> 01:39:35.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tumitingin doon sa...

asr-001703
01:39:35.240 --> 01:39:36.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: I see.

asr-001704
01:39:36.240 --> 01:39:40.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero sana mabigyan din yung Senate kasi maraming nagtatanong.

asr-001705
01:39:40.240 --> 01:39:42.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mismo, bago tumaas yung gold,

asr-001706
01:39:42.240 --> 01:39:47.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nagbenta tayo ng malaking halaga.

asr-001707
01:39:47.240 --> 01:39:49.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How much gold did the BSP sell?

asr-001708
01:39:49.240 --> 01:39:50.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: When did we sell it?

asr-001709
01:39:50.240 --> 01:39:53.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How much did we receive in return?

asr-001710
01:39:54.240 --> 01:40:04.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Nung 2026 po, nagbenta tayo ng gold.

asr-001711
01:40:04.240 --> 01:40:06.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang presyo ng gold nung 20...

asr-001712
01:40:06.240 --> 01:40:12.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Nung nagbenta tayo, $4,308 per troy ounce.

asr-001713
01:40:12.240 --> 01:40:16.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ngayon po, ang presyo ng gold...

asr-001714
01:40:16.240 --> 01:40:18.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero hindi po ba tayo nagbenta ng ginto?

asr-001715
01:40:18.240 --> 01:40:19.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sorry to interrupt po.

asr-001716
01:40:19.240 --> 01:40:21.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Didn't we sell gold even before that?

asr-001717
01:40:21.240 --> 01:40:23.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 2024, 2025?

asr-001718
01:40:23.240 --> 01:40:24.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nag...

asr-001719
01:40:24.240 --> 01:40:26.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Umpisa na tayo magbenta nun, di po ba?

asr-001720
01:40:26.240 --> 01:40:28.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Every year po nagbebenta tayo.

asr-001721
01:40:28.240 --> 01:40:29.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Every year nagbebenta?

asr-001722
01:40:29.240 --> 01:40:32.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pag sumobra na doon sa kalkulasyon namin.

asr-001723
01:40:32.240 --> 01:40:39.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero I recall two years ago, there was a big UN cry that you started selling gold.

asr-001724
01:40:39.240 --> 01:40:47.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: When was there a large sell-off of our gold reserve?

asr-001725
01:40:47.240 --> 01:40:48.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: In...

asr-001726
01:40:48.240 --> 01:40:51.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: From January to September 2024,

asr-001727
01:40:51.240 --> 01:41:00.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: we sold at $2,331 per troy ounce.

asr-001728
01:41:00.240 --> 01:41:05.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: 6.25 metric tons.

asr-001729
01:41:05.240 --> 01:41:10.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes. Yun nga yung tinatanong ng marami dahil nung 2024,

asr-001730
01:41:10.240 --> 01:41:19.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: late 2024, doon na bumulusok naman yung presyo ng ginto at umabot ng 4,006 by 2025.

asr-001731
01:41:19.240 --> 01:41:20.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya lahat magtataka.

asr-001732
01:41:20.240 --> 01:41:22.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit yung BSP nag-unload?

asr-001733
01:41:22.240 --> 01:41:27.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh, ang baba ng presyo nasa 2,331.

asr-001734
01:41:27.240 --> 01:41:29.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh, lugi yung Pilipinas.

asr-001735
01:41:29.240 --> 01:41:34.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Halos nangangalahati doon sa highest point nung gold sa 2025.

asr-001736
01:41:34.240 --> 01:41:39.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: May panahon po na lugi tayo. May panahon na kumikita tayo ng malaki.

asr-001737
01:41:39.240 --> 01:41:42.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kaya 2026, malaki ang kinita natin.

asr-001738
01:41:42.240 --> 01:41:45.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero hindi yun ang strategy namin eh.

asr-001739
01:41:45.240 --> 01:41:47.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ang strategy namin, hindi kami tumataya.

asr-001740
01:41:47.240 --> 01:41:48.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: We don't speculate.

asr-001741
01:41:48.240 --> 01:41:49.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Right.

asr-001742
01:41:49.240 --> 01:41:50.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: On the price of gold.

asr-001743
01:41:50.240 --> 01:41:56.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: It's part of the risk management of the whole portfolio.

asr-001744
01:41:56.240 --> 01:42:00.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How did the proceeds get used?

asr-001745
01:42:00.240 --> 01:42:06.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala kaming narinig kung sa napunta yung pagbenta ng ginto.

asr-001746
01:42:06.240 --> 01:42:10.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How much, if any, was remitted to the treasury?

asr-001747
01:42:10.240 --> 01:42:13.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: The entire proceeds.

asr-001748
01:42:13.240 --> 01:42:14.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Was remitted?

asr-001749
01:42:14.240 --> 01:42:17.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: No, they go back to the reserves.

asr-001750
01:42:17.240 --> 01:42:18.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Go back to the reserves.

asr-001751
01:42:18.240 --> 01:42:22.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nothing goes to the treasury. They remain with the BSP?

asr-001752
01:42:22.240 --> 01:42:24.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: They remain with the BSP.

asr-001753
01:42:24.240 --> 01:42:29.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, perhaps we can have a breakdown of what that looks like.

asr-001754
01:42:29.240 --> 01:42:43.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi, kung tutuusin, kung benta tayo ng benta ng ginto, sabi po ninyo, 2026, kumita tayo sa 4,308 na presyo, eh, bagsak naman ang bagsak ang ating reserves.

asr-001755
01:42:43.240 --> 01:42:57.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, ang ibig sabihin, yung 103.3 billion at end July to 97.95 end October, kasama na doon yung gold proceeds.

asr-001756
01:42:57.240 --> 01:42:59.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung proceeds, balik sa reserves.

asr-001757
01:42:59.240 --> 01:43:00.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Kasama na doon.

asr-001758
01:43:00.240 --> 01:43:08.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero in spite of selling gold, bagsak pa rin ang ating reserves na nasa wala pang 98 billion. Tama po ba?

asr-001759
01:43:08.240 --> 01:43:09.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yes.

asr-001760
01:43:09.240 --> 01:43:11.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What drove the decline?

asr-001761
01:43:11.240 --> 01:43:18.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Does the BSP still expect reserves to reach 104? How? Yung tanong ko kanina.

asr-001762
01:43:18.240 --> 01:43:27.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At magbebenta pa ba tayo ng ginto para ma-achieve yung 104 bago matapos ang taon?

asr-001763
01:43:27.240 --> 01:43:33.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, the decline is consistent with what's happening with the exchange rate.

asr-001764
01:43:33.240 --> 01:43:40.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: We increase our reserves whenever we have more exports than imports.

asr-001765
01:43:41.240 --> 01:43:48.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: And so, we just, the difference adds to the reserves.

asr-001766
01:43:48.240 --> 01:44:03.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, do we think, what is our projection po sa BSP? Will the continued grim economic outlook drive down further our reserves to dangerous or insecure levels?

asr-001767
01:44:03.240 --> 01:44:04.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa palagay ninyo?

asr-001768
01:44:04.240 --> 01:44:09.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung outlook na kailangan natin bantayan, yung outlook for the trade deficit.

asr-001769
01:44:09.240 --> 01:44:10.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: For the trade deficit.

asr-001770
01:44:10.240 --> 01:44:14.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: And the outlook for the current account deficit.

asr-001771
01:44:14.240 --> 01:44:27.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, eto nga, maraming natatakot din doon sa sinasabi nga na tuloy-tuloy kayo magtataas pa ng interest rate.

asr-001772
01:44:27.240 --> 01:44:39.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: This hawkish forward stance na pwedeng umabot sa 2027. Pwede pa ba taasan ng interest rate? Napakataas na po?

asr-001773
01:44:39.240 --> 01:44:47.240
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Napakataas na po, pero napakataas din ng inflation eh. So, kung bumaba na ang inflation, hindi na kami magtataas.

asr-001774
01:44:47.240 --> 01:44:56.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pwede pang magbaba. So, the actions that can be taken, kasi yun ang gustong maalaman ng mga senador.

asr-001775
01:44:56.240 --> 01:45:00.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Unang-una, yung interest rate hikes.

asr-001776
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:05.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nasabi nga ninyo, hindi naman pwedeng pataas ng pataas kasi talagang wala nang gagalaw.

asr-001777
01:45:06.160 --> 01:45:09.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Takot na takot na nga yung mga negosyante, hindi na makahiram.

asr-001778
01:45:10.200 --> 01:45:14.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ikalawa, yung foreign exchange market intervention.

asr-001779
01:45:15.460 --> 01:45:20.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung sinasabi nyo na ginagastos natin yung gold kasama ng foreign reserves

asr-001780
01:45:20.480 --> 01:45:29.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: para lang hindi matigil ang GIR decline at saka gold.

asr-001781
01:45:30.000 --> 01:45:41.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung ikatlo, yung forward guidance ninyo na sinasabi ninyo na wala kayong itatanto.

asr-001782
01:45:41.380 --> 01:45:46.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Talagang you will continue to act on the interest rates.

asr-001783
01:45:46.440 --> 01:45:49.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that something that we have to expect?

asr-001784
01:45:51.100 --> 01:45:53.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: This rather hawkish stance.

asr-001785
01:45:53.900 --> 01:45:57.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Well appreciated and merited considering the circumstances po.

asr-001786
01:45:58.860 --> 01:45:59.540
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Unfortunately.

asr-001787
01:46:00.000 --> 01:46:05.020
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: We have to contend with high inflation as you've indicated.

asr-001788
01:46:05.020 --> 01:46:14.340
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: And the most effective tool that any country has to slow inflation down

asr-001789
01:46:14.340 --> 01:46:16.720
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: is really the policy rate, the interest rate.

asr-001790
01:46:18.120 --> 01:46:26.040
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: From experience over 50 years, there's no other more effective tool than the interest rate.

asr-001791
01:46:27.140 --> 01:46:29.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: But are there any other...

asr-001792
01:46:30.000 --> 01:46:34.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are there any other actions that the BSP can take

asr-001793
01:46:34.020 --> 01:46:38.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: aside from the interest rate, foreign exchange intervention, and so on?

asr-001794
01:46:40.480 --> 01:46:42.700
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: There are less effective actions.

asr-001795
01:46:42.980 --> 01:46:46.520
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: In the old days, we used to tighten money supply.

asr-001796
01:46:46.740 --> 01:46:47.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's right.

asr-001797
01:46:47.680 --> 01:46:51.360
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: But that turns out to be equivalent to raising interest rates.

asr-001798
01:46:52.280 --> 01:46:55.080
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: And raising interest rates is more reliable.

asr-001799
01:46:55.740 --> 01:46:56.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-001800
01:46:56.400 --> 01:46:59.200
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: As a way of taming inflation.

asr-001801
01:47:00.000 --> 01:47:04.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, is there anything else we can look forward to po?

asr-001802
01:47:04.460 --> 01:47:07.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Aside from the fiscal monetary measures of the BSP.

asr-001803
01:47:08.320 --> 01:47:14.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You mentioned previously that external supply shocks were the primary reason

asr-001804
01:47:14.400 --> 01:47:18.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: for what has happened and the Middle East oil prices, obviously.

asr-001805
01:47:19.380 --> 01:47:26.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And then we are also assuming there will be tremendous El Nino food cost increases.

asr-001806
01:47:26.480 --> 01:47:29.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, at this point, we are saying it's $10 billion.

asr-001807
01:47:30.000 --> 01:47:30.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, I believe.

asr-001808
01:47:31.500 --> 01:47:37.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: In terms of damages, we are expecting El Nino to continue until next year, 2027.

asr-001809
01:47:38.660 --> 01:47:40.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is there light at the end of the tunnel?

asr-001810
01:47:42.120 --> 01:47:43.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi may El Nino pa eh.

asr-001811
01:47:44.820 --> 01:47:47.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Natatakot din kami ngayon sa El Nino.

asr-001812
01:47:47.720 --> 01:47:49.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung pong external supply shock.

asr-001813
01:47:50.120 --> 01:47:51.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nanginginig na po kami.

asr-001814
01:47:51.440 --> 01:47:53.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang dami-dami natin kinataklutan po.

asr-001815
01:47:53.600 --> 01:47:57.980
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pwede bang explain ko lang yung external supply shock?

asr-001816
01:47:58.220 --> 01:47:59.620
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Dalawa yung effect nun eh.

asr-001817
01:48:00.000 --> 01:48:02.620
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: May effect dun sa presyo ng oil.

asr-001818
01:48:03.580 --> 01:48:04.600
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Wala tayong oil eh.

asr-001819
01:48:04.680 --> 01:48:05.820
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Nag-i-import tayo ng oil.

asr-001820
01:48:06.280 --> 01:48:08.740
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Lahat ng oil natin imported.

asr-001821
01:48:09.580 --> 01:48:10.880
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, malaki tama sa atin.

asr-001822
01:48:11.860 --> 01:48:15.660
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: At saka yung nangyayari din dun, lumalakas ang dollar.

asr-001823
01:48:16.040 --> 01:48:19.960
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Yung tinitingnan kasi natin, exchange rate, peso, dollar.

asr-001824
01:48:20.900 --> 01:48:27.320
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero yung dollar mismo, pag kinuha mo yung exchange rate against six major currencies,

asr-001825
01:48:28.080 --> 01:48:29.400
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: lumalakas talaga siya eh.

asr-001826
01:48:30.000 --> 01:48:31.300
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: So, damay lang tayo dun.

asr-001827
01:48:31.480 --> 01:48:33.560
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi peso lang ang humihina.

asr-001828
01:48:34.860 --> 01:48:37.680
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Lumalakas ang dollar against major currencies.

asr-001829
01:48:37.680 --> 01:48:43.300
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: And that's the number one factor that explains the depreciation of the peso.

asr-001830
01:48:43.480 --> 01:48:46.820
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: It's dollar strength is the number one factor.

asr-001831
01:48:47.440 --> 01:48:51.160
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: That's three times more important than the increase in oil prices.

asr-001832
01:48:51.760 --> 01:48:52.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Opo.

asr-001833
01:48:53.560 --> 01:48:54.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Huli na lang po.

asr-001834
01:48:55.000 --> 01:48:57.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: In the realm of cheap gossip po.

asr-001835
01:48:57.540 --> 01:48:59.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero nasabi po ninyo,

asr-001836
01:49:00.000 --> 01:49:01.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na consumption driven tayo,

asr-001837
01:49:02.600 --> 01:49:04.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: pagkat mayabang yung Pilipino.

asr-001838
01:49:05.060 --> 01:49:06.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Marami pong nasinda.

asr-001839
01:49:06.820 --> 01:49:10.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang sabi nila, hindi mayabang ang Pilipino, kundi mahirap.

asr-001840
01:49:10.800 --> 01:49:12.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala lang pang invest.

asr-001841
01:49:12.360 --> 01:49:14.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ubus na-ubus na sa gasolina, sa kuryente,

asr-001842
01:49:15.360 --> 01:49:16.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: higit sa lahat sa pagkain.

asr-001843
01:49:17.240 --> 01:49:19.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nais ba ninyo ipaliwanag para sa aming lahat?

asr-001844
01:49:20.320 --> 01:49:21.180
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi naman yung,

asr-001845
01:49:21.680 --> 01:49:23.900
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: siyempre yung mahirap, hindi na pwede yung ano yun.

asr-001846
01:49:24.760 --> 01:49:26.040
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Mag-save ka lang, pumain.

asr-001847
01:49:26.040 --> 01:49:28.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya nga, mauunang pagkain.

asr-001848
01:49:28.540 --> 01:49:29.620
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Mauunang pagkain.

asr-001849
01:49:30.000 --> 01:49:31.800
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Pero marami din tayong mayaman.

asr-001850
01:49:32.140 --> 01:49:33.460
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Na hindi po nag-i-invest.

asr-001851
01:49:33.560 --> 01:49:35.160
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi nag-save.

asr-001852
01:49:35.700 --> 01:49:36.720
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi nag-save.

asr-001853
01:49:36.820 --> 01:49:37.860
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Hindi po ilokano yun.

asr-001854
01:49:37.980 --> 01:49:38.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nag-save po kami.

asr-001855
01:49:40.860 --> 01:49:42.140
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: May iba akong kilala po.

asr-001856
01:49:43.180 --> 01:49:44.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Naku po, ayan na.

asr-001857
01:49:44.780 --> 01:49:47.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nag-name-names na si BSP Governor.

asr-001858
01:49:47.640 --> 01:49:49.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maraming salamat po sa inyong pagdalo

asr-001859
01:49:49.840 --> 01:49:52.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: at sa inyong pagbalik.

asr-001860
01:49:52.820 --> 01:49:55.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Alam po ninyo, may ibang may tampu sa inyo rito

asr-001861
01:49:55.840 --> 01:49:57.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: dahil hindi daw kayo sumisipot.

asr-001862
01:49:58.040 --> 01:49:59.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kanino po dapat magsabi?

asr-001863
01:50:00.000 --> 01:50:02.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pagkailangan namin ang abiso ninyo.

asr-001864
01:50:03.140 --> 01:50:05.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kailangan namin sabihin sa office po ninyo.

asr-001865
01:50:05.600 --> 01:50:07.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi minsan, di daw kayo pumupunti.

asr-001866
01:50:08.100 --> 01:50:09.460
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Naabangan na po namin.

asr-001867
01:50:09.720 --> 01:50:11.660
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Ngayon, alam namin, this time of the year,

asr-001868
01:50:12.340 --> 01:50:13.820
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: kailangan nandito kami lahat.

asr-001869
01:50:14.480 --> 01:50:14.980
BSP Governor Eli M. Remolona Jr.: Tama po.

asr-001870
01:50:15.880 --> 01:50:16.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sige.

asr-001871
01:50:16.400 --> 01:50:19.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi pati si SP po, maraming katanungan.

asr-001872
01:50:19.360 --> 01:50:20.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maraming ring suggestion.

asr-001873
01:50:20.940 --> 01:50:23.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maraming salamat at thank you very much

asr-001874
01:50:23.960 --> 01:50:26.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to the Governor of the Central Bank

asr-001875
01:50:26.000 --> 01:50:28.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: for coming back with the full

asr-001876
01:50:28.000 --> 01:50:36.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: presence of his officers, board, and staff.

asr-001877
01:50:36.600 --> 01:50:37.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you very much.

asr-001878
01:50:37.120 --> 01:50:38.700
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Senator Aimee Marcos.

asr-001879
01:50:38.780 --> 01:50:40.240
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We recognize our majority leader,

asr-001880
01:50:40.360 --> 01:50:42.020
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Senator Miguel Zabiri.

asr-001881
01:50:42.340 --> 01:50:43.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you, Governor, for coming

asr-001882
01:50:43.660 --> 01:50:47.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and asking the call to be able to explain

asr-001883
01:50:47.940 --> 01:50:50.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: some of the policy measures that are being done by the BSP.

asr-001884
01:50:51.080 --> 01:50:52.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ano lang po, Mr. President,

asr-001885
01:50:53.020 --> 01:50:53.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: tatanungin ko lang sana.

asr-001886
01:50:56.120 --> 01:50:57.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kasi nakakaabala na po yung slowdown.

asr-001887
01:50:58.000 --> 01:51:00.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: To be honest, Governor,

asr-001888
01:51:00.960 --> 01:51:02.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: in my 30 years of

asr-001889
01:51:02.300 --> 01:51:04.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: political life,

asr-001890
01:51:04.940 --> 01:51:05.880
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: or in 25 years,

asr-001891
01:51:05.940 --> 01:51:08.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: almost elected since 1998,

asr-001892
01:51:08.940 --> 01:51:10.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ito lang pong nakita ko na

asr-001893
01:51:10.160 --> 01:51:11.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: pinakamatamlay na ekonomiya

asr-001894
01:51:11.900 --> 01:51:13.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: at 2%.

asr-001895
01:51:13.000 --> 01:51:16.320
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Even at that time, during the

asr-001896
01:51:16.320 --> 01:51:17.960
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: impeachment of Era Pastrada,

asr-001897
01:51:18.380 --> 01:51:19.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: we were still growing.

asr-001898
01:51:20.760 --> 01:51:22.060
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And during the takeover

asr-001899
01:51:22.060 --> 01:51:24.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: of the Arroyo administration,

asr-001900
01:51:24.620 --> 01:51:25.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: when she, of course,

asr-001901
01:51:25.720 --> 01:51:27.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: was moved up

asr-001902
01:51:27.760 --> 01:51:28.560
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to president,

asr-001903
01:51:28.940 --> 01:51:31.220
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and when she had also her political

asr-001904
01:51:31.220 --> 01:51:32.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: upheavals at the time,

asr-001905
01:51:33.580 --> 01:51:37.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the economy was slowly

asr-001906
01:51:37.540 --> 01:51:38.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: increasing, maybe because of

asr-001907
01:51:38.900 --> 01:51:40.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: strong policy measures at the time

asr-001908
01:51:40.940 --> 01:51:42.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: adopted by her administration.

asr-001909
01:51:43.680 --> 01:51:45.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And then, of course,

asr-001910
01:51:45.800 --> 01:51:47.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: moving forward to

asr-001911
01:51:47.600 --> 01:51:49.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the...

asr-001912
01:51:49.800 --> 01:51:51.480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And in between that, marami pong mga

asr-001913
01:51:51.480 --> 01:51:53.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: political upheavals. She was impeached, I think,

asr-001914
01:51:53.360 --> 01:51:55.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: every year by Senator Aimee

asr-001915
01:51:55.340 --> 01:51:57.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and my colleagues impeached her.

asr-001916
01:51:57.760 --> 01:51:59.320
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: For several years.

