Senator Joel Villanueva: At gusto lang natin ma-put on record kasi po ang PCSMP is a 3.878 billion project led by civil service.

asr-003387
02:49:12.220 --> 02:49:22.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And of course, ang DBM ay co-executing agency financed by US, I mean World Bank Loan.

asr-003388
02:49:22.320 --> 02:49:27.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Financed po ito ng World Bank Loan na nagkakalagang $67.34 million.

asr-003389
