asr-003933
03:10:06.500 --> 03:10:09.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and its attached agencies and corporations.

asr-003934
03:10:10.100 --> 03:10:12.540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: As a journalist myself, I firmly believe

asr-003935
03:10:12.540 --> 03:10:16.900
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: that effective communication is an essential part of good governance.

asr-003936
03:10:16.900 --> 03:10:19.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: In an era where information spreads rapidly

asr-003937
03:10:19.940 --> 03:10:26.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and where misinformation, disinformation, and fake news continue to pose serious challenges,

asr-003938
03:10:26.960 --> 03:10:28.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: the PCO plays a vital role.

asr-003939
03:10:28.280 --> 03:10:35.200
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: In ensuring that our people are timely, accurately, and properly informed of government programs

asr-003940
03:10:35.200 --> 03:10:38.780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and initiatives that directly affect their daily lives.

asr-003941
