Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: People's Television Network.

asr-003965
03:11:47.460 --> 03:11:50.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: 738.378 million.

asr-003966
03:11:50.960 --> 03:11:53.280
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: And Intercontinental Broadcasting Corporation.

asr-003967
03:11:53.960 --> 03:11:54.920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: IBC 13.

asr-003968
03:11:54.920 --> 03:11:58.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: At 259.929 million.

asr-003969
03:11:58.280 --> 03:12:02.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Subtotal 998,307,000.

asr-003970
03:12:02.980 --> 03:12:12.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: The proposed appropriation represents a 26.10% increase from the Fiscal Year 2026 General Appropriations Act.

asr-003971
03:12:12.380 --> 03:12:21.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: This increase is intended to strengthen government communication services and ensure public access to accurate, timely, and reliable information.

asr-003972
03:12:21.140 --> 03:12:27.380
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: For transparency, House Bill No. 10858 introduced additional appropriations.

asr-003973
03:12:27.380 --> 03:12:46.440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Of approximately 673 million, including an additional 25 million for the PCO proper, 12 million for the Philippine Information Agency, 35.986 million for IBC, and 600 million for the operations of PTV.

asr-003974
03:12:46.440 --> 03:12:57.600
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: The Senate Committee on Finance retained these allocations and recommended an additional 223.943 million for IBC-13.

asr-003977
03:12:58.060 --> 03:13:04.220
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Primarily to support the network's maintenance and operating expenses pending its privatization.

asr-003978
03:13:04.220 --> 03:13:19.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: With these considerations, Mr. President, I respectfully submit the proposed Fiscal Year 2027 budget of the Presidential Communications Office and its attached agencies and corporations for the consideration and approval of this August Chamber.

