asr-004011
03:15:43.360 --> 03:15:51.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: I immediately took the floor and said that is not true because meron namang increase.

asr-004012
03:15:51.960 --> 03:15:58.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang problem lang is hindi ganun kalaki yung increase to cover the increase in the unemployment.

asr-004013
03:15:59.480 --> 03:16:09.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, again, that's a communication problem that we still are looking into that needs a lot of improvement.

asr-004014
03:16:09.520 --> 03:16:16.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: And, again, I am happy to see Secretary Lino Cayetano at the top of this department.

asr-004015
03:16:17.600 --> 03:16:21.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat, Ginong Paul, and again, I give my sincerest thanks and gratitude to our

asr-004016
03:16:21.660 --> 03:16:24.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Majority Leader and our Senate President. Thank you. Thank you very much.

asr-004017
03:16:24.960 --> 03:16:26.880
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Thank you, Senator Villanueva.

asr-004018
03:16:28.040 --> 03:16:40.780
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: I'm glad you mentioned that aside from Secretary Cayetano, Lino Cayetano, we also have Jimmy here, Jimmy Policarpio.

asr-004019
03:16:41.500 --> 03:16:48.340
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: And the father of Senator Sonny Angara, Senator Ed Angara and myself,

asr-004020
03:16:48.340 --> 03:16:51.640
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: were together with Ernesto.

asr-004021
03:16:51.660 --> 03:16:54.420
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Ernie Mano, Ernie Maceda.

asr-004022
03:16:54.620 --> 03:16:57.420
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: And the chief of staff was Jimmy Policarpio.

asr-004023
03:16:58.140 --> 03:17:00.920
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: I think he was about 16 years old during that time.

asr-004024
03:17:03.160 --> 03:17:06.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. Presiding Officer, would you know his age?

asr-004025
03:17:07.100 --> 03:17:10.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Yes, they keep asking how old he is.

asr-004026
03:17:10.080 --> 03:17:13.180
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: I think we will be ready to give him his senior card soon.

asr-004027
03:17:14.860 --> 03:17:16.840
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: He's about 58 years old, I think.

asr-004028
03:17:18.580 --> 03:17:19.600
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Do you believe that?

asr-004029
03:17:19.600 --> 03:17:20.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes, Mr. President.

asr-004030
03:17:20.820 --> 03:17:21.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We'd like to recognize...

asr-004031
03:17:21.660 --> 03:17:24.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We'd like to recognize our distinguished colleague, Senator Robin Hood Padilla, to ask a question.

asr-004032
03:17:24.360 --> 03:17:25.980
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Senator Robin Hood Padilla is recognized.

asr-004033
03:17:30.040 --> 03:17:34.240
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maraming salamat po, Ginong Pangulo, at sa ating pinunong mayorya.

asr-004034
03:17:35.260 --> 03:17:43.340
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung mamarapatid po ng ating Ginong sponsor na makapagtanong lang po tayo ng ilang maimportanting katanungan.

asr-004035
03:17:45.160 --> 03:17:50.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Opo, malagot po namin sasagutin ang mga katanungan po ng ating kasamahan.

asr-004036
03:17:50.100 --> 03:17:51.340
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo, unang-una po.

asr-004037
03:17:51.660 --> 03:17:58.880
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: May ko pong batiin ang isang kilalang director ng Pilikulang Pilipino at Telebisyon,

asr-004038
03:17:59.640 --> 03:18:01.660
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: ang ating pumbagong kalihim,

asr-004039
03:18:02.440 --> 03:18:05.580
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sekretary Lino Edgardo Caetano.

asr-004040
03:18:07.280 --> 03:18:08.720
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Congratulations po.

asr-004041
03:18:09.380 --> 03:18:09.640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo.

asr-004042
03:18:10.420 --> 03:18:20.200
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ako po ay ang chairman po ng public information dito sa Senate.

asr-004043
03:18:21.660 --> 03:18:26.020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At matagal ko na pong isinusulong ang freedom of information.

asr-004044
03:18:27.340 --> 03:18:37.620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At madalas ko po hingin sa dating kalihim ng PICO na tulungan ako para maipasa po ito.

asr-004045
03:18:37.620 --> 03:18:49.320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At madalas po ang itinuturo niya ay ang kamara, ang mga kasama po natin sa Congress,

asr-004046
03:18:50.340 --> 03:18:51.480
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: sa mababang kapulungan.

asr-004047
03:18:51.660 --> 03:18:59.440
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang malaking kapulungan na hindi pa po nagbibigay ng kanilang version.

asr-004048
03:19:00.240 --> 03:19:04.140
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At ngayon po na may version na sila, nandun na po kami sa BICAM.

asr-004049
03:19:05.720 --> 03:19:12.000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang malungkot lamang po, hindi pa po sila nagbibigay ng kanilang membro.

asr-004050
03:19:13.340 --> 03:19:21.040
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At alam ko naman po na may kapangyarihan ng PICO upang alam ko naman po na meron kayong representante doon.

asr-004051
03:19:21.660 --> 03:19:28.420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sa Congress, sa kamara, na sana po ay pumasa na ito.

asr-004052
03:19:29.620 --> 03:19:39.860
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sana po, ito po ay kasama po natin dito, ang inyong sponsor, si Senator Erwin Tulfo, kasama po sa nagsusulong nitong FOI.

asr-004053
03:19:41.660 --> 03:19:49.200
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Napakahalaga po nito, mahal naming kalihim, sapagkat dito po talaga malalaman na natin kung sino po talaga yung mga

asr-004054
03:19:49.200 --> 03:19:51.640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: may tagong yama.

asr-004055
03:19:51.660 --> 03:19:53.840
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung ano yung mga ay tinatago nila.

asr-004056
03:19:54.080 --> 03:19:56.480
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Dahil ito nga po ay freedom of information.

asr-004057
03:19:57.300 --> 03:20:06.640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sana po, mahal naming kalihim ay bilang ako po ay kasama ninyo sa pelikula ng matagal, sa industriya natin.

asr-004058
03:20:07.280 --> 03:20:12.020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Hinihingi ko po ang tulong po ninyo na mapwersa.

asr-004059
03:20:12.760 --> 03:20:18.720
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pwersahin na po ninyo sana yung nandyan sa kamara na mag-BICAM na po kami.

asr-004060
03:20:18.720 --> 03:20:20.720
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At kung ano man po yung version ninyo.

asr-004061
03:20:21.660 --> 03:20:27.660
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ay mapag-consolidate po natin at maipasa po natin itong batas na ito.

asr-004062
03:20:28.660 --> 03:20:32.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Una po sa lahat, nagpapasalamat po ang ating kalihim si Secretary Cayetano,

asr-004063
03:20:32.660 --> 03:20:42.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa 10 na kanya mga kasamahan, sa inyong adbukasya at ikanga sa patuloy na pagsulong po ng Freedom of Information Bill.

asr-004064
03:20:43.360 --> 03:20:51.600
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tulad niyo po, tulad ko po, si Secretary Cayetano po ay nagtapos din sa communications at sa media rin po.

asr-004067
03:20:52.020 --> 03:20:55.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kaya po, full support po, di lang po siya kundi ang buong ahensya.

asr-004068
03:20:55.900 --> 03:21:01.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung sinasabi po ninyo kakausapin po, agad-agad po ay hahanap po siya ng koneksyon,

asr-004069
03:21:01.120 --> 03:21:07.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kakausapin po ang miembro ng mababang kapulungan upang makapag-umpisa na po na magkaroon po kayo ng BICAM.

asr-004070
03:21:07.120 --> 03:21:11.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Apo, maraming salamat po, Ginong Pangulo.

asr-004071
03:21:11.120 --> 03:21:16.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sapagkat ito po ay alam niyo po, itong kasaysayan ng bill na ito,

asr-004072
03:21:17.120 --> 03:21:19.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: lagi po itong pumapasa sa Senado,

asr-004073
03:21:19.120 --> 03:21:20.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: lagi po itong pumapasa sa Senado,

asr-004074
03:21:20.120 --> 03:21:24.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: nakaharang po ito lagi sa ano, nata-traffic po.

asr-004075
03:21:24.120 --> 03:21:26.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pagdating po sa Kamara, nata-traffic.

asr-004076
03:21:26.120 --> 03:21:32.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Inihiling po natin sana, insya Allah ay pumasa na po ito.

asr-004077
03:21:32.120 --> 03:21:38.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: May may dadagdag lang po, Ginong Senador, ang ating pong kalihim na siya po,

asr-004078
03:21:38.120 --> 03:21:44.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: pagkatapos po nito ay dadalo sa inyong opisina para makipag-augnayan at kumonsulta sa inyo,

asr-004079
03:21:44.120 --> 03:21:48.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hinggil po dito sa inyong sinusulong po na Freedom of Information Bill

asr-004080
03:21:48.120 --> 03:21:50.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: at kung ano pa ang maaaring maitulong po.

asr-004081
03:21:50.120 --> 03:21:52.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004082
03:21:52.120 --> 03:21:55.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sa pangalawang tanong na lang po,

asr-004083
03:21:55.120 --> 03:22:01.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: meron pong ulat po kasi na nakarating po sa aming tanggapan, Ginong Pangulo,

asr-004084
03:22:01.120 --> 03:22:13.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: na yun daw pong Presidential Communication Office ay binura daw po ang lahat ng material

asr-004085
03:22:13.120 --> 03:22:18.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: ng may kinalaman kay Pangulong Rodrigo Roa Duterte.

asr-004086
03:22:18.120 --> 03:22:19.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Totoo po ba ito?

asr-004087
03:22:20.120 --> 03:22:21.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi.

asr-004088
03:22:33.120 --> 03:22:36.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Immediately after receiving the report,

asr-004089
03:22:38.120 --> 03:22:41.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Distinguished Gentleman from Nueva Vizcaya,

asr-004090
03:22:41.120 --> 03:22:49.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ay kaagad po na inatasaan ng kalihim ang Philippine Information Agency upang i-retrieve ang lahat ng mga file videos

asr-004091
03:22:49.120 --> 03:22:55.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: documentation patungkol po sa dating Pangulong Duterte at sa kanyang administrasyon.

asr-004092
03:22:55.120 --> 03:23:02.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Wala pong binura at patuloy po na ni-re-retrieve ngayon ang ikang lahat ng mga contents,

asr-004093
03:23:02.120 --> 03:23:06.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: lahat po ng mga video interviews patungkol po sa dating Pangulong.

asr-004094
03:23:07.120 --> 03:23:11.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ni-re-retrieve. So nagkaroon po talaga ng pagbura?

asr-004095
03:23:11.120 --> 03:23:24.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Bago po kasi itong administrasyon na ito na down po yung mga websites.

asr-004096
03:23:24.120 --> 03:23:29.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero kaya nga po ngayon ay nare-recover na po lahat po ngayon.

asr-004097
03:23:29.120 --> 03:23:33.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Hindi po sinadya na burahin?

asr-004098
03:23:33.120 --> 03:23:40.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi po sinasadya, Ginong Pangulo, at hindi po papayag ang PCOO

asr-004099
03:23:40.120 --> 03:23:44.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na magkaroon po ng ganyang muli na sitwasyon.

asr-004100
03:23:44.120 --> 03:23:50.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Napakagandang balita po yan sapagkat alam naman po natin na napakahalaga po

asr-004101
03:23:50.120 --> 03:23:55.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: ng bawat naging pamumuno ng kahit na sinong Pangulo po.

asr-004102
03:23:55.120 --> 03:24:03.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kahit na ito po ay umpisa pa lamang ng bayang ito, lahat po ay nakatala na sa ating kasaysayan.

asr-004103
03:24:03.120 --> 03:24:09.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang bawat naging hakbang, naging salita, naging pahayag ng lahat ng Pangulo,

asr-004104
03:24:09.120 --> 03:24:15.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: lalong-lalo na po siguro yung dating administrasyon ni Rodrigo Roa Duterte.

asr-004105
03:24:15.120 --> 03:24:18.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: So maibig pong sabihin, wala po, na-retrieve po lahat.

asr-004106
03:24:18.120 --> 03:24:21.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Opo, at ongoing po, patuloy po.

asr-004107
03:24:21.120 --> 03:24:25.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: At in the process nga po of retrieving.

asr-004108
03:24:25.120 --> 03:24:31.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: At hindi po kailangang burahin po alisin dahil bahagi na po yan ang kasaysayan.

asr-004109
03:24:31.120 --> 03:24:38.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ano pa man po ang pamumuno ng mga dating Pangulo, nasa history na po yan hindi po natin kailangan.

asr-004110
03:24:38.120 --> 03:24:44.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Itago, pagtakpan, at para malaman po ng mga susunod na henerasyon.

asr-004111
03:24:44.120 --> 03:24:49.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo, bali ang nangyari po, nagkaroon lang po ng...

asr-004112
03:24:49.120 --> 03:24:57.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ba't kailangan po i-retrieve? Nagkaroon po ng...

asr-004113
03:24:57.120 --> 03:24:59.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Nag-down lang po ang website.

asr-004114
03:24:59.120 --> 03:25:01.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Nag-down ang website.

asr-004115
03:25:01.120 --> 03:25:07.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kaya nga po, before their time, kaya nga po ngayon ay binabalik na po lahat yan.

asr-004116
03:25:07.120 --> 03:25:09.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kumpleto po lahat po ng files.

asr-004117
03:25:09.120 --> 03:25:11.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo, opo.

asr-004118
03:25:11.120 --> 03:25:18.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ngayon po, bilang panghuling tanong, usap-usapan po yung Super El Niño.

asr-004119
03:25:18.120 --> 03:25:29.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo, meron po bang hakbang ang PICO para ang ating mga taong bayan ay publicly informed sa campaign po ng ating gobyerno?

asr-004120
03:25:29.120 --> 03:25:35.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Opo, gagamitin po ng PCO lahat po ng mga ahensya nasa ilalim po nito.

asr-004121
03:25:35.120 --> 03:25:41.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Nandyan po yung PNA, nandyan po yung PIA, Philippine Broadcast Service sa mga radyo po at telebisyon.

asr-004122
03:25:41.120 --> 03:25:46.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sa buong kapuluhan po na magpalabas po ng mga information, mga do's and don'ts

asr-004123
03:25:46.120 --> 03:25:53.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para po ma-inform po ang lahat hanggang sa mga kasulok-sulokan ng mga barangay,

asr-004124
03:25:53.120 --> 03:26:00.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng mga lib-lib na lugar ng ating bayan para alamin po ang mga programa at ginagawa po at gagawin pa ng gobyerno.

asr-004125
03:26:00.120 --> 03:26:03.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Patungkol po sa pagdating po ng El Niño.

asr-004126
03:26:03.120 --> 03:26:04.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo.

asr-004127
03:26:04.120 --> 03:26:19.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Mga, meron po ba kayong mga, alam naman po natin na napakahalaga ng mga tinatawag po nating medium sa mga ganitong public information?

asr-004128
03:26:19.120 --> 03:26:30.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Meron na po ba kayong mga nakuhang mga halimbawa po, mga endorser, influencers para po mapalaganap ang ganitong klaseng information?

asr-004129
03:26:30.120 --> 03:26:34.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Alam naman po natin ano, na mahalaga po ang medium.

asr-004130
03:26:34.120 --> 03:26:40.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tama po kayo and they agree with you, distinguished gentleman from Norma Vizcaya.

asr-004131
03:26:40.120 --> 03:26:51.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yan po ang susunod na hakbang po nila, ang palalakasin pa at paigtingin ang partnership po sa ikang private media,

asr-004132
03:26:51.120 --> 03:27:02.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ikang mga influencers dahil sa mga panahon po ito talagang malakas po ang social media at kailangan po na makipag-ugnayan po sa kanila

asr-004133
03:27:02.120 --> 03:27:11.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para maiparating po, maipabatid sa mga kababayan natin, lalo na po sa mga malalayong lugar ang mga programa at plano po ng pamahalaan.

asr-004134
03:27:11.120 --> 03:27:31.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo. Alam ko po, kasama ko ang aking pinsan na si Sen. Erwin at ako po, handa po kaming maging parte ng kampanya po na ito sapagkat naniniwala po kami pagdating sa ganitong pagkakataon, walang oposisyon, walang administrasyon.

asr-004135
03:27:31.120 --> 03:27:32.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004136
03:27:32.120 --> 03:27:47.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Gusto lang po ang iparating ng ating kalihim na kaya po siya nais po magtungo sa inyong tanggapan upang makipag-ugnayan po sa inyo upang hinihin po ang inyong mga payo o advice hinggil po sa mga issues na ito.

asr-004137
03:27:47.120 --> 03:27:51.120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maasahan ko po kayo, maasahan niyo po ako. Salamat po.

asr-004138
03:27:51.120 --> 03:27:54.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004139
03:27:54.120 --> 03:27:56.120
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Majority Leader.

asr-004140
03:27:56.120 --> 03:28:01.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I believe our sponsor for the budget, Sen. Erwin.

asr-004141
03:28:01.120 --> 03:28:05.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: JV Ejercito would like to also just ask, I think, one more question.

asr-004142
03:28:05.120 --> 03:28:08.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But if not, are you...

asr-004143
03:28:08.120 --> 03:28:10.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yeah, he'll just ask one question.

