03:45:46.020 --> 03:45:58.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you, Mr. President. I would just like to place on record my, I'd say my delight to have two former colleagues here in the Senate

asr-004360
03:45:58.500 --> 03:46:27.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: who are now secretaries of the departments of the different agencies of government. Of course, I mentioned earlier, Senator Secretary Sonny Angara. And we have also with us here the finance expert of the Senate when he was here. The guru of gurus. Marami po akong natutunan dyan. Yung natutunan niya sa tatay ko ay tinuro niya sa akin. Walang iba [unclear] Senator Secretary Ralph Recto.

asr-004360-split-2
03:46:27.000 --> 03:46:30.860
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Yes, of course. Welcome with open arms

asr-004361
03:46:30.860 --> 03:46:43.270
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: our esteemed colleague. It sounds like a reunion this afternoon. We welcome the Executive Secretary of the Philippines, Senator Ralph Recto.

asr-004361-split-2
03:46:43.270 --> 03:46:49.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Actually, there was a time, Mr. President, that you were the Senate President. He was the

asr-004361-split-3
03:46:49.120 --> 03:46:50.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Senate President Pro Temp.

asr-004361-split-4
03:46:50.160 --> 03:46:58.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: He was Senate President Pro Temp. I was the Majority Floor Leader. This gentleman here was the Chairman of the Finance Committee.

asr-004362
03:46:58.500 --> 03:47:06.690
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And Joel was chairman of like three other committees. Higher education, labor. So small world po.

asr-004362-split-2
03:47:06.690 --> 03:47:12.420
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Yes. Reunion afternoon. So what is the pleasure of the majority?

asr-004362-split-3
03:47:12.420 --> 03:47:21.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President, Undersecretary Alu Dorotan is here. Kasama din po natin sa Senado. Napakatagal yan.

asr-004362-split-4
03:47:21.380 --> 03:47:26.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Si Sec Elaine also. Kasama natin.

asr-004362-split-5
03:47:26.180 --> 03:47:29.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So with that, Mr. President, we'd like to move to...

asr-004363
03:47:29.140 --> 03:47:30.160
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Atty. Elaine is here?

asr-004363-split-2
03:47:30.160 --> 03:47:31.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes, right there.

asr-004363-split-3
03:47:31.720 --> 03:47:32.840
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Oh, yeah, yes.

asr-004363-split-4
03:47:32.840 --> 03:47:46.920
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Atty. Balis, yes. Mr. President, with that, I would like to move to take up the budgets of the Office of the President, all the President's offices, and the Presidential Management Staff.

asr-004363-split-5
03:47:46.920 --> 03:47:51.060
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Alright, any objection? Hearing none, the budget is approved.

asr-004363-split-6
03:47:51.060 --> 03:47:52.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Wala pa, wala pa, boss.

asr-004363-split-7
03:47:52.840 --> 03:47:54.380
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Sorry, sorry, sorry.

asr-004363-split-8
03:47:54.380 --> 03:47:57.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Hingihan lang natin ng konting briefing yung kanilang chairperson.

asr-004363-split-9
03:47:57.820 --> 03:47:59.980
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: I got carried away. Sorry, sorry.

asr-004364
