Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 16 and 18-year-old players, ang galing-galing.

asr-007152
05:59:09.900 --> 05:59:11.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, kinukuha ng mga private

asr-007153
05:59:11.200 --> 05:59:13.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: players, sponsor sila, dinala sila

asr-007154
05:59:13.340 --> 05:59:15.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sa Siargao para makapaglaro.

asr-007155
05:59:16.320 --> 05:59:17.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, mag-a-absent pa

asr-007156
05:59:17.340 --> 05:59:19.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ng isang araw, kasi

asr-007157
05:59:19.260 --> 05:59:21.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: walang man lang direct flight. Alam mo yung ganun?

asr-007158
05:59:21.560 --> 05:59:23.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Parang, pinapahirapan

asr-007159
05:59:23.200 --> 05:59:24.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: natin yung buhay natin. And

asr-007160
05:59:24.460 --> 05:59:27.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we need, Mr. Chairman,

asr-007161
05:59:27.140 --> 05:59:29.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I think we will all agree

asr-007162
05:59:29.080 --> 05:59:30.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that we need to do better.

asr-007163
05:59:32.360 --> 05:59:33.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How can you even

asr-007164
05:59:33.220 --> 05:59:35.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: begin to develop Siargao when you

asr-007165
05:59:35.100 --> 05:59:36.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: can't even get a direct flight?

asr-007166
05:59:37.620 --> 05:59:39.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There's no direct flight from any

asr-007167
05:59:39.040 --> 05:59:40.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: country, so at least from Manila, di ba?

asr-007168
05:59:41.860 --> 05:59:42.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So,

asr-007169
05:59:43.580 --> 05:59:45.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, we can't just keep

asr-007170
05:59:45.200 --> 05:59:47.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: having this conversation. This was already brought

asr-007171
05:59:47.260 --> 05:59:49.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: up in a hearing a year ago.

asr-007172
05:59:50.280 --> 05:59:50.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's not new.

asr-007173
05:59:51.400 --> 05:59:53.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero at that time, may direct flight

asr-007174
05:59:53.200 --> 05:59:53.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na wala pa.

asr-007175
05:59:53.860 --> 05:59:55.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Why is that?

asr-007176
05:59:55.860 --> 05:59:57.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Why is that? I mean,

asr-007177
05:59:58.080 --> 05:59:59.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: apparently, the demand is high to go to

asr-007178
05:59:59.960 --> 06:00:00.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Siargao.

asr-007179
06:00:00.000 --> 06:00:03.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I don't think it's up and coming. I wouldn't even include it in the up and coming.

asr-007180
06:00:04.540 --> 06:00:08.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi nga, we want to build the infrastructure there. We want them to have wide roads.

asr-007181
06:00:09.100 --> 06:00:14.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We want them to have the proper, what do you call this?

asr-007182
06:00:14.600 --> 06:00:31.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We want them to have the proper sewage system.

asr-007183
06:00:31.220 --> 06:00:36.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hindi yung parang kung kailan doon, kailangan sisirain mo yung kalye, saka maglalagay ng mga piping mo.

asr-007184
06:00:37.360 --> 06:00:40.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then if we're going to go solar, malagay na lahat yun, malatag.

asr-007185
06:00:40.780 --> 06:00:42.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kung mag-wind, malatag na.

asr-007186
06:00:42.880 --> 06:00:44.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So hindi pa yan yung up and coming.

asr-007187
06:00:44.340 --> 06:00:49.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Unless you're referring to specific towns outside of the main areas.

asr-007188
06:00:49.500 --> 06:00:55.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So that's really, I think, Mr. President, Mr. Chairman, what we want DOT to present to us, di ba?

asr-007189
06:00:55.520 --> 06:00:56.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung talagang master plan.

asr-007190
06:00:58.360 --> 06:01:03.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi yung nabanggit nyo ng happening na dyan, I don't really know if it's already too late for those areas.

asr-007191
