Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: The problem, Mr. President,

asr-007192
06:01:14.340 --> 06:01:18.840
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Madam Senator, is like yung mga nabanggit po ng mga islands.

asr-007193
06:01:19.500 --> 06:01:27.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: It's like strengthening and upgrading po yung airport to accommodate yung mga jet engine.

asr-007194
06:01:27.660 --> 06:01:30.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kasi pag turbo prop, medyo mahal.

asr-007195
06:01:30.620 --> 06:01:35.200
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Isa pa ho dyan, the problem is mahal na, malayo pa.

asr-007196
06:01:35.320 --> 06:01:39.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: You have to go all the way to Clark in Pampanga to fly.

asr-007197
06:01:39.180 --> 06:01:42.580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: For example, doon po sa Coron, it's only a 45-minute flight.

asr-007198
06:01:43.180 --> 06:01:44.320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero dahil nasa Clark.

asr-007199
06:01:44.340 --> 06:01:47.920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sa Clark na siya ngayon, lahat po ng turbo prop na nagte-takeoff and landing,

asr-007200
06:01:48.520 --> 06:01:51.320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kailangan sa Clark na wala na po sa NIA.

asr-007201
06:01:51.560 --> 06:01:57.640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So bakit ka pa pupunta, two hours papunta ng Clark and then 45 minutes,

asr-007202
06:01:57.700 --> 06:02:01.720
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: that's two hours and 45, unlike before, nandyan lang po siya sa NIA.

asr-007203
06:02:02.300 --> 06:02:06.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Medyo mabilis-bilis po, medyo hindi tinatabad yung mga kababayan natin.

asr-007204
06:02:06.860 --> 06:02:07.760
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: That's one issue.

asr-007205
06:02:08.000 --> 06:02:10.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sorry, Mr. President, before you go to the next issue,

asr-007206
06:02:10.540 --> 06:02:13.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: so on the first one, you're saying na na-move out yun,

asr-007207
06:02:13.480 --> 06:02:16.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and to decongest the air traffic from Manila.

asr-007208
06:02:16.900 --> 06:02:17.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Exactly.

asr-007209
