Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Clearly hindi.

asr-007212
06:02:24.180 --> 06:02:27.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi like me, and maybe my colleagues here,

asr-007213
06:02:28.720 --> 06:02:31.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: magdadalawang flight pa ba tayo to get to Siargao?

asr-007214
06:02:31.400 --> 06:02:32.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hindi na siguro akong makakapunta.

asr-007215
06:02:33.120 --> 06:02:34.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, I understand, I understand.

asr-007216
06:02:34.940 --> 06:02:36.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: At least there's a reason, no?

asr-007217
06:02:36.420 --> 06:02:39.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But is it helping the tourism?

asr-007218
06:02:39.320 --> 06:02:40.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't think so.

asr-007219
06:02:40.120 --> 06:02:41.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But anyway, please go on.

asr-007220
06:02:41.780 --> 06:02:43.420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Well, no, it's not helping, actually.

asr-007221
06:02:43.480 --> 06:02:46.720
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Madam Senator from Taguig.

asr-007222
06:02:47.520 --> 06:02:50.560
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Actually, nabawasan pa po ang tourist arrivals,

asr-007223
06:02:51.040 --> 06:02:53.580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: yung mga local destinations, kasi tinatamad na po.

asr-007224
06:02:53.660 --> 06:02:54.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tama po kayo.

asr-007225
06:02:54.440 --> 06:02:54.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah, ako.

