06:03:23.480 --> 06:03:26.780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng DOT,

asr-007239
06:03:27.220 --> 06:03:30.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: tinanggal mo yung budget ng TIEZA, ng DOT.

asr-007240
