Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: wala ba ka ba mga hospitals, no?

asr-007242
06:03:35.460 --> 06:03:40.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pag may na-jellyfish or na-lunod,

asr-007243
06:03:40.200 --> 06:03:42.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: how will they...

asr-007244
06:03:43.480 --> 06:03:46.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: tulungan yung tourists?

