06:03:51.680 --> 06:03:53.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hinahanap ng mga turista, Wi-Fi.

asr-007248
06:03:53.920 --> 06:03:56.200
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tourist destinations, walang mga Wi-Fi.

asr-007249
06:03:56.400 --> 06:03:58.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, all of these, not a turn-off.

asr-007250
06:03:58.620 --> 06:03:59.840
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Unlike in other countries,

