Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ng direct flight from Manila.

asr-007273
06:04:45.140 --> 06:04:45.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I would say,

asr-007274
06:04:45.860 --> 06:04:47.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: a big chunk of those who would travel

asr-007275
06:04:47.540 --> 06:04:48.280
