asr-007276
06:04:48.280 --> 06:04:49.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi buong luzon na yan.

asr-007277
06:04:49.380 --> 06:04:50.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sa Manila manggagaling yung biyahe.

asr-007278
06:04:51.240 --> 06:04:51.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's ridiculous.

asr-007279
