Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which I've heard him say a number of times.

asr-007284
06:05:01.840 --> 06:05:04.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Why we have, I'm not aware,

asr-007285
06:05:04.380 --> 06:05:06.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pero baka yun naman yung concept

asr-007286
06:05:06.540 --> 06:05:07.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nung nayong Pilipino,

asr-007287
06:05:07.760 --> 06:05:10.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: if those who come from the older generation

asr-007288
06:05:10.660 --> 06:05:11.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: would remember.

asr-007289
06:05:13.480 --> 06:05:15.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Can DOT look into,

asr-007290
06:05:16.000 --> 06:05:17.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and if you already have,

asr-007291
06:05:17.120 --> 06:05:21.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: let us know if there is such a project

asr-007292
06:05:21.060 --> 06:05:23.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: where you, government,

asr-007293
06:05:24.080 --> 06:05:26.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: whether it's LGU or national government,

asr-007294
06:05:27.280 --> 06:05:28.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: initiated the infrastructure.

asr-007295
06:05:29.340 --> 06:05:30.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, kunyari, it's like,

asr-007296
06:05:30.300 --> 06:05:32.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: bisita ka dito sa,

asr-007297
06:05:33.160 --> 06:05:35.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's like a, let's say,

asr-007298
06:05:35.280 --> 06:05:39.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: a Siargao tourism park.

asr-007299
06:05:39.580 --> 06:05:40.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then, pagdating mo doon,

asr-007300
06:05:40.840 --> 06:05:42.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nandun na yung sampung karindirya.

asr-007301
