Senator Pia S. Cayetano: you know, then you choose, you know,

asr-007303
06:05:46.260 --> 06:05:47.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of course, they'll do the bidding,

asr-007304
06:05:47.800 --> 06:05:49.140
