Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, when I did go to Bali also,

asr-007308
06:05:55.220 --> 06:05:56.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: again, for paddle,

asr-007309
06:05:56.940 --> 06:05:58.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ang mura ng pagkain.

asr-007310
06:05:58.480 --> 06:05:59.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ang mura.

asr-007311
06:05:59.780 --> 06:06:00.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Tapos, ang reklamo din,

asr-007312
06:06:01.180 --> 06:06:02.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ang mahal din nung pagkain

asr-007313
06:06:02.420 --> 06:06:04.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sa mga destinations natin.

asr-007314
06:06:04.280 --> 06:06:05.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Tapos, syempre, sasabihin naman nung

asr-007315
06:06:05.460 --> 06:06:07.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nag-nenegosyo,

asr-007316
06:06:07.400 --> 06:06:08.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: dami nilang babayaran,

asr-007317
06:06:08.400 --> 06:06:09.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: mahal ang kuryente,

asr-007318
06:06:09.620 --> 06:06:10.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: mahal ang upa.

asr-007319
06:06:10.780 --> 06:06:12.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, do we have any,

asr-007320
06:06:12.220 --> 06:06:14.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: such projects in these destinations

asr-007321
06:06:14.300 --> 06:06:16.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na pinatayuan ng, let's say,

asr-007322
06:06:17.040 --> 06:06:19.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: benting, similar to like Taguig now,

asr-007323
06:06:19.140 --> 06:06:20.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we have a, they call it,

asr-007324
06:06:21.000 --> 06:06:22.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Paskong Handog ng Taguig,

asr-007325
06:06:22.900 --> 06:06:25.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na inuupahan ng murang-mura lang

asr-007326
06:06:25.140 --> 06:06:26.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung mga stall na nagbebenta ng

asr-007327
06:06:26.860 --> 06:06:29.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kung ano-ano, yung from the

asr-007328
06:06:29.380 --> 06:06:31.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: milk tea to the fish balls,

asr-007329
06:06:31.940 --> 06:06:33.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: whatever. May ganun ho ba?

asr-007330
06:06:34.600 --> 06:06:36.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Actually, Mr. President,

asr-007331
06:06:36.580 --> 06:06:38.540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Madam Senator Pia,

asr-007332
06:06:39.180 --> 06:06:40.900
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: our problem here is that

asr-007333
06:06:40.900 --> 06:06:43.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: wala po tayong ganun

asr-007334
06:06:43.140 --> 06:06:44.800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: compared to other countries.

asr-007335
06:06:44.960 --> 06:06:46.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero, may plano ngayon,

asr-007336
06:06:46.080 --> 06:06:47.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: according to the Secretary,

asr-007337
06:06:47.180 --> 06:06:48.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: to the good Secretary,

asr-007338
06:06:48.720 --> 06:06:49.900
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na dito po sa Clark,

asr-007339
06:06:50.020 --> 06:06:51.960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: magtatayo po tayo sila

asr-007340
06:06:51.960 --> 06:06:54.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng gastronomic facilities

asr-007341
06:06:54.060 --> 06:06:55.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para sa mga food.

asr-007342
06:06:55.980 --> 06:06:57.640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ang napansin ho natin,

asr-007343
06:06:58.500 --> 06:06:59.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: huwag naman ho sana magalit

asr-007344
06:06:59.680 --> 06:07:00.920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa ating local businesses,

asr-007345
06:07:01.380 --> 06:07:03.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: but they are taking advantage kasi

asr-007346
06:07:03.140 --> 06:07:05.280
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: because these are foreign tourists

asr-007347
06:07:05.280 --> 06:07:06.380
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: bringing in dollars.

asr-007348
06:07:06.840 --> 06:07:08.860
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: They believe na maraming pera,

asr-007349
06:07:08.940 --> 06:07:09.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: nakabakasyon,

asr-007350
06:07:10.240 --> 06:07:10.880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: lalabas mo po,

asr-007351
06:07:10.900 --> 06:07:11.820
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: munot sa pitaka,

asr-007352
06:07:11.980 --> 06:07:13.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dollars yung pera,

asr-007353
06:07:13.500 --> 06:07:14.800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: makapal yung wallet.

asr-007354
06:07:15.320 --> 06:07:16.220
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, they take advantage.

asr-007355
06:07:16.600 --> 06:07:18.620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I believe, Mr. President,

asr-007356
06:07:19.120 --> 06:07:20.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dapat po tumulong din

asr-007357
06:07:20.680 --> 06:07:22.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ang local government units,

asr-007358
06:07:22.420 --> 06:07:24.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: tumulong din po ang DTI to check na

asr-007359
06:07:24.460 --> 06:07:26.800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: baka inaabuso na po yung turista.

asr-007360
06:07:27.240 --> 06:07:27.700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, mapano,

asr-007361
06:07:27.900 --> 06:07:30.820
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: isa po ito sa mga bagay

asr-007362
06:07:30.820 --> 06:07:33.440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na driving away tourists

asr-007363
06:07:33.440 --> 06:07:34.500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kasi nakikita po nila.

asr-007364
06:07:34.840 --> 06:07:35.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I'll give you a case in point.

asr-007365
06:07:36.040 --> 06:07:36.920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Dito po sa Intramuros,

asr-007366
06:07:37.020 --> 06:07:38.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: there were reports na

asr-007367
06:07:38.000 --> 06:07:40.880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sobrang mahal yung singil ng kalesa.

asr-007368
06:07:40.900 --> 06:07:43.700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sobrang mahal yung singil ng tricycle

asr-007369
06:07:43.700 --> 06:07:46.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para ka nang sumakay ng aeroplano

asr-007370
06:07:46.000 --> 06:07:47.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa pamahasahay

asr-007371
06:07:47.060 --> 06:07:48.040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dahil sobrang mahal.

asr-007372
06:07:48.400 --> 06:07:49.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi na te-turn off.

asr-007373
06:07:49.720 --> 06:07:50.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kaya kailangan,

asr-007374
06:07:50.440 --> 06:07:51.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kung siguradama ho kayo,

asr-007375
06:07:52.200 --> 06:07:54.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: it should be a whole of government approach.

asr-007376
06:07:54.900 --> 06:07:55.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi lang po DOT

asr-007377
06:07:55.940 --> 06:07:57.040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kasi hindi niya po kaya

asr-007378
06:07:57.040 --> 06:07:57.880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: bantayan yan.

asr-007379
06:07:58.240 --> 06:07:59.780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pagdating po sa mga fare rates,

asr-007380
06:08:00.180 --> 06:08:01.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dapat po yan,

asr-007381
06:08:01.680 --> 06:08:04.280
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ikang LTO, LTFRB.

asr-007382
06:08:04.660 --> 06:08:06.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pagdating po sa mga food,

asr-007383
06:08:06.160 --> 06:08:07.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: yung magkano ang singil,

asr-007384
06:08:07.480 --> 06:08:10.440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dapat DTI po ang in-charge dyan

asr-007385
06:08:10.440 --> 06:08:11.380
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: or LGU

asr-007386
06:08:11.380 --> 06:08:13.700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kung wala man po nga representative ng DTI.

asr-007387
06:08:14.260 --> 06:08:15.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kaya kailangan po talaga

asr-007388
06:08:15.340 --> 06:08:17.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sama-sama para ikang matugunan

asr-007389
06:08:17.520 --> 06:08:19.020
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: matulad po sa sinasabing

asr-007390
06:08:19.020 --> 06:08:20.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: yung explanation sa Bali

asr-007391
06:08:20.160 --> 06:08:22.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na mura po yung pagkain dito sa atin.

asr-007392
06:08:22.600 --> 06:08:22.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi eh.

asr-007393
06:08:23.280 --> 06:08:24.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Taking advantage.

asr-007394
06:08:24.140 --> 06:08:25.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Isa pa po nga sitwasyon

asr-007395
06:08:25.680 --> 06:08:26.960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: dyan sa pagsanhan falls,

asr-007396
06:08:27.020 --> 06:08:27.560
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: yung bangka.

asr-007397
06:08:27.980 --> 06:08:28.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pag magre-rent ka,

asr-007398
06:08:28.800 --> 06:08:29.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sobrang mahal.

asr-007399
06:08:29.620 --> 06:08:30.500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Libo ka agad.

asr-007400
06:08:30.660 --> 06:08:32.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, eh local tourist ka lang nga naman.

asr-007401
06:08:32.820 --> 06:08:33.880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Medyo magre-reklamo ka.

asr-007402
06:08:34.040 --> 06:08:35.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero yung mga foreigners,

asr-007403
06:08:35.660 --> 06:08:36.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hindi nga nararamdaman.

asr-007404
06:08:36.840 --> 06:08:37.400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero yung nga lang,

asr-007405
06:08:37.680 --> 06:08:38.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: it's so expensive.

asr-007406
06:08:38.760 --> 06:08:39.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tama po eh.

asr-007407
06:08:39.960 --> 06:08:40.260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Siyempre,

asr-007408
06:08:40.260 --> 06:08:41.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: yung mga tourist na yan,

asr-007409
06:08:41.840 --> 06:08:42.580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mr. President,

asr-007410
06:08:42.800 --> 06:08:44.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: a gentle lady from Taguig,

asr-007411
06:08:44.220 --> 06:08:45.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: nakapunta rin sa ibang bansa yan.

asr-007412
