Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Iko-compare nila.

asr-007413
06:08:47.300 --> 06:08:48.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Why is Philippines so expensive?

asr-007414
06:08:48.920 --> 06:08:50.720
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, might as well not come back.

asr-007415
06:08:51.340 --> 06:08:51.780
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Brother,

asr-007416
06:08:51.920 --> 06:08:53.400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I'll just go to another place

asr-007417
06:08:53.400 --> 06:08:54.540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na much cheaper.

asr-007418
