Senator Pia S. Cayetano: can ask their regional offices

asr-007426
06:09:10.260 --> 06:09:11.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: to check what LGUs

asr-007427
06:09:11.680 --> 06:09:12.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: have such facilities.

asr-007428
