Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It doesn't have to be fancy.

asr-007429
06:09:14.120 --> 06:09:16.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam mo yung parang kubo-kubo style lang na gano'n.

asr-007430
06:09:16.300 --> 06:09:18.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then, it's supply and demand.

asr-007431
06:09:20.940 --> 06:09:23.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Typical housewife na mahilig magluto,

asr-007432
06:09:23.740 --> 06:09:25.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pwedeng magkarindirya doon.

asr-007433
06:09:25.440 --> 06:09:26.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung nagtitipid,

asr-007434
06:09:26.720 --> 06:09:27.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: doon kakain.

asr-007435
06:09:27.800 --> 06:09:29.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung gustong magbayad ng

asr-007436
06:09:29.260 --> 06:09:31.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: more than 500 per meal,

asr-007437
06:09:31.160 --> 06:09:32.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: bahala siya doon sa gourmet.

asr-007438
06:09:32.680 --> 06:09:34.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There's always a market for both.

asr-007439
06:09:35.140 --> 06:09:36.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero we have to support

asr-007440
06:09:36.460 --> 06:09:37.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and you have to educate

asr-007441
06:09:37.660 --> 06:09:39.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the MSMEs

asr-007442
06:09:40.260 --> 06:09:41.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na merong potential

asr-007443
06:09:41.940 --> 06:09:42.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because

asr-007444
06:09:42.580 --> 06:09:44.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kahit sino namang foreigner,

asr-007445
06:09:44.800 --> 06:09:45.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and I see a lot,

asr-007446
06:09:45.920 --> 06:09:47.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they're making sure

asr-007447
06:09:47.340 --> 06:09:48.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: gawad their home

asr-007448
