Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 6 months,

asr-007450
06:09:50.180 --> 06:09:50.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 1 year.

asr-007451
06:09:51.240 --> 06:09:52.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Tagahanap din ang budget yun.

asr-007452
06:09:52.480 --> 06:09:52.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Then meron,

asr-007453
06:09:53.100 --> 06:09:54.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was so surprised

asr-007454
06:09:54.240 --> 06:09:55.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and baka

asr-007455
06:09:55.420 --> 06:09:57.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: maybe they start out

asr-007456
06:09:57.340 --> 06:09:57.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: as a tourist

asr-007457
06:09:57.820 --> 06:09:58.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but I want to share this.

asr-007458
06:09:59.760 --> 06:10:00.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You know how we read

asr-007459
06:10:00.800 --> 06:10:01.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: about Filipinos

asr-007460
06:10:01.860 --> 06:10:03.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: who leave the country

asr-007461
06:10:03.440 --> 06:10:04.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for greener pastures.

asr-007462
06:10:05.060 --> 06:10:05.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sabi nila,

asr-007463
06:10:05.700 --> 06:10:06.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: better daw ang healthcare,

asr-007464
06:10:07.060 --> 06:10:08.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ang education sa ibang bansa.

asr-007465
06:10:08.220 --> 06:10:09.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mag-Australia sila,

asr-007466
06:10:09.580 --> 06:10:10.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: mag-Europe.

asr-007467
06:10:10.260 --> 06:10:11.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Then I come across

asr-007468
06:10:11.860 --> 06:10:13.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: these blogs,

asr-007469
06:10:13.740 --> 06:10:14.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: vlogs

asr-007470
06:10:14.240 --> 06:10:15.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of foreigners

asr-007471
06:10:15.500 --> 06:10:16.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: who say that

asr-007472
06:10:16.400 --> 06:10:18.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they've moved out of

asr-007473
06:10:18.000 --> 06:10:21.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: very developed countries

asr-007474
06:10:21.360 --> 06:10:23.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: whether it was the US or Europe,

asr-007475
06:10:23.340 --> 06:10:24.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I can't recall at the moment.

asr-007476
06:10:25.180 --> 06:10:26.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Moving to the Philippines,

asr-007477
06:10:26.560 --> 06:10:27.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: probinsya yun,

asr-007478
06:10:27.880 --> 06:10:29.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi meron silang special child

asr-007479
06:10:29.700 --> 06:10:31.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: at yung special child nila

asr-007480
06:10:31.360 --> 06:10:32.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: may access sa ospital

asr-007481
06:10:32.880 --> 06:10:34.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: at may access sa physical therapy.

asr-007482
06:10:35.480 --> 06:10:36.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sabi ko, buti pa to,

asr-007483
06:10:36.580 --> 06:10:37.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na-appreciate niya yung

asr-007484
06:10:37.740 --> 06:10:39.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for us, kulang pa nga yun.

asr-007485
06:10:39.420 --> 06:10:40.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero siguro,

asr-007486
06:10:40.060 --> 06:10:42.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: may spending money pa to eh, no?

asr-007487
06:10:42.540 --> 06:10:43.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, breakdown niya eh

asr-007488
06:10:43.920 --> 06:10:45.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kung makano yung budget niya.

asr-007489
