08:07:43.040 --> 08:07:43.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President,

asr-010108
08:07:43.980 --> 08:07:45.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: next to propound some questions

asr-010109
08:07:45.600 --> 08:07:47.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: is our good friend from Mindanao Center,

asr-010110
08:07:48.560 --> 08:07:49.320
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Christopher Bongo.

asr-010111
08:07:49.560 --> 08:07:51.620
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Recognize the gentleman from Davao City,

asr-010112
08:07:51.800 --> 08:07:52.480
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Senator Bongo.

asr-010113
08:07:52.700 --> 08:07:55.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Thank you, Mr. President, distinguished colleagues,

asr-010114
08:07:56.700 --> 08:07:58.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Secretary Angara,

asr-010115
08:07:59.620 --> 08:08:00.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: aking teammates,

asr-010116
08:08:01.700 --> 08:08:03.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Senate Sentinels,

asr-010117
08:08:03.440 --> 08:08:04.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: back-to-back champion kami

asr-010118
08:08:04.820 --> 08:08:06.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 2023

asr-010119
08:08:06.040 --> 08:08:09.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at 2024.

asr-010120
08:08:10.520 --> 08:08:11.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasama namin si

asr-010121
08:08:11.380 --> 08:08:13.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Senator Joel Villanueva. Pero ngayon,

asr-010122
08:08:13.400 --> 08:08:15.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mas nakita ko na mas magaling ka pala

asr-010123
08:08:15.440 --> 08:08:16.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa tennis, no?

asr-010124
08:08:20.540 --> 08:08:22.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marunong ka mag-pickleball,

asr-010125
08:08:22.560 --> 08:08:23.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Secretary.

asr-010126
08:08:24.380 --> 08:08:24.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Learning.

asr-010127
08:08:25.160 --> 08:08:26.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero may anak ka na,

asr-010128
08:08:26.700 --> 08:08:28.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nagtitraining ng tennis, kaya magaling.

asr-010129
08:08:28.680 --> 08:08:30.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya sabi ko kanina, naalala ko sa

asr-010130
08:08:30.720 --> 08:08:31.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the same school, no?

asr-010131
08:08:32.440 --> 08:08:33.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pinag-aralan nila. So,

asr-010132
08:08:34.540 --> 08:08:36.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: congratulations. Since hindi kayo nanalo

asr-010133
08:08:36.840 --> 08:08:37.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nung Sunday sa

asr-010134
08:08:37.980 --> 08:08:41.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung OP team ninyo,

asr-010135
08:08:41.420 --> 08:08:42.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ano dyan yung coach,

asr-010136
08:08:42.760 --> 08:08:44.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kahit na marami kayong pang-hire ng players

asr-010137
08:08:44.920 --> 08:08:47.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ang DepEd, dahil malawak yung DepEd,

asr-010138
08:08:47.180 --> 08:08:48.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pwede mag-hire ng mga

asr-010139
08:08:48.820 --> 08:08:50.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: director, para

asr-010140
08:08:50.220 --> 08:08:52.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sila lang ang pinapayagan,

asr-010141
08:08:52.860 --> 08:08:54.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pabor-pabor. Kaya galit na galit

asr-010142
08:08:54.860 --> 08:08:56.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: si Senator Joel, kasi

asr-010143
08:08:56.700 --> 08:08:58.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: itong players namin,

asr-010144
08:08:58.800 --> 08:09:00.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: hindi pinalaro for this year,

asr-010145
08:09:00.960 --> 08:09:03.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kaya eliminated po kami.

asr-010146
08:09:03.420 --> 08:09:04.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung core ng team

asr-010147
08:09:04.720 --> 08:09:07.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: noong 2023 at 2024

asr-010148
08:09:07.060 --> 08:09:07.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: tinanggal.

asr-010149
08:09:09.480 --> 08:09:11.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya galit si Senator Joel.

asr-010150
08:09:12.100 --> 08:09:12.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway,

asr-010151
08:09:12.960 --> 08:09:15.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: good evening po sa lahat ng...

asr-010152
08:09:17.300 --> 08:09:47.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. President, gusto ko lang sabihin, gusto ko lang sabihin, hindi ako dun galit. Sa ibang paraan po. Just to, baka ma, baka lang ma-misinterpret. Galit na galit ako. At dahil dun sa mga pangyayari, especially yung mga nababalit natin on game fixing, and we'll raise questions on the budget of the Philippine Sports Commission headed by our chairman.

asr-010217
08:09:47.720 --> 08:09:48.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you,

asr-010218
08:09:48.340 --> 08:09:48.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: thank you,

asr-010219
08:09:48.700 --> 08:09:48.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr.

asr-010220
08:09:48.920 --> 08:09:49.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: President.

asr-010221
08:09:49.380 --> 08:09:49.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Thank you.

asr-010222
08:09:50.280 --> 08:09:50.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway,

asr-010223
08:09:50.980 --> 08:09:51.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to the entire

asr-010224
08:09:51.920 --> 08:09:52.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: DepEd family,

asr-010225
08:09:53.020 --> 08:09:53.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: magandang gabi po

asr-010226
08:09:53.940 --> 08:09:54.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa inyong lahat.

asr-010227
08:09:54.760 --> 08:09:59.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And will the good sponsor, Senator Bam, yield the floor for a few questions?

asr-010228
08:10:00.240 --> 08:10:01.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of course. Of course.

asr-010229
08:10:01.120 --> 08:10:04.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would like to commend, of course, napakaganda po nakikita natin

asr-010230
08:10:04.920 --> 08:10:08.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na pag ginamit po yung pera ng taong bayan sa tama,

asr-010231
08:10:09.240 --> 08:10:11.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mapapakinabangan po ito ng mga teachers natin.

asr-010232
08:10:12.200 --> 08:10:13.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Long overdue na po ito.

asr-010233
08:10:14.080 --> 08:10:18.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kawawa po yung mga teachers natin sa sakripisyo nila para sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-010234
08:10:19.200 --> 08:10:21.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ay dapat po bigyan sila ng mga magagandang equipments,

asr-010235
08:10:21.920 --> 08:10:26.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: equipments katulad ng laptop na magagamit nila sa pagtuturo.

asr-010236
08:10:27.080 --> 08:10:29.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: First of all, as chairperson of the Committee on Youth,

asr-010237
08:10:30.020 --> 08:10:33.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would like to emphasize the importance of the DepEd budget.

asr-010238
08:10:33.880 --> 08:10:36.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At alam po ng ating sekretarya na noon pa man, sabi ko,

asr-010239
08:10:36.840 --> 08:10:39.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kung ano makakatulong po sa DepEd, full support po ako dyan,

asr-010240
08:10:39.940 --> 08:10:45.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and that investing in education is investing in the future of our young people.

asr-010241
08:10:46.380 --> 08:10:50.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We must ensure that every Filipino learner has access to quality education

asr-010242
08:10:50.800 --> 08:10:51.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and safety.

asr-010243
08:10:51.920 --> 08:10:53.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And adequate learning facilities.

asr-010244
08:10:54.520 --> 08:11:00.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At pinag-usapan po natin yung education, Senator Bam, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-010245
08:11:00.900 --> 08:11:04.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na nung kayo po ang chairperson ng higher education,

asr-010246
08:11:04.400 --> 08:11:07.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pinaglaban po natin yung free tertiary education.

asr-010247
08:11:07.860 --> 08:11:11.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam naman natin na ayaw ng mga finance manager noon.

asr-010248
08:11:12.440 --> 08:11:15.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: They objected, but pinaglaban natin.

asr-010249
08:11:15.420 --> 08:11:19.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa rin po ako sa nakipaglaban until last hour na hindi po ma-vito ito

asr-010250
08:11:19.640 --> 08:11:21.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at finally naging batas.

asr-010251
08:11:21.140 --> 08:11:23.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At napapakinabangan po ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-010252
08:11:23.860 --> 08:11:27.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May I say, Mr. President, I know for a fact during that time,

asr-010253
08:11:28.700 --> 08:11:33.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ayaw ng tatlong cabinet secretary ang batas para sa libreng kolehyo.

asr-010254
08:11:33.960 --> 08:11:40.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But I know for a fact that the good senator who was special assistant at that time

asr-010255
08:11:40.340 --> 08:11:44.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: lobbied directly with the president to make sure that this was not vetoed.

asr-010256
08:11:44.500 --> 08:11:48.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So thank you, Senator Goh, for your efforts during that time.

asr-010257
08:11:48.440 --> 08:11:50.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nung panahon pong yun, nakita natin,

asr-010258
08:11:50.180 --> 08:11:53.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nagtulungan yung iba't ibang grupo para mapasay yung free college law

asr-010259
08:11:53.560 --> 08:11:57.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: na ngayon, isa sa mga pinakamagagandang reforma na meron tayo sa ating bansa.

asr-010260
08:11:58.660 --> 08:12:02.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napakahalaga po nito at napapakinabangan po ito ng ating mga kababayan sa ngayon.

asr-010261
08:12:03.600 --> 08:12:07.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nakakatuwa rin po na pumasa na rin po yung Republic Act 12325.

asr-010262
08:12:07.980 --> 08:12:13.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito po yung expanded free tertiary education at napapakinabangan po ito ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-010263
08:12:13.900 --> 08:12:18.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin, napakahalaga po ng edukasyon dahil sila po,

asr-010264
08:12:18.100 --> 08:12:24.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ang mga kabataan po ang kinabukasan ng ating bayan at daladala nila yan hanggang sa kanilang pagtanda.

asr-010265
08:12:25.840 --> 08:12:32.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At balik tayo sa DepEd, that is why we laud the additional budget provided to the DepEd

asr-010266
08:12:32.880 --> 08:12:37.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: under our committee report, particularly in school-based feeding program.

asr-010267
08:12:37.940 --> 08:12:41.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. President, one of the continuing challenges in our basic education system

asr-010268
08:12:41.840 --> 08:12:46.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: is the shortage of classrooms and the need to improve existing school facilities.

asr-010269
08:12:48.100 --> 08:12:52.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So nakakatuwa po na nakikita natin na may laptop po yung mga teachers.

asr-010270
08:12:52.380 --> 08:12:55.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Masayang-masaya po tayo at they deserve it.

asr-010271
08:12:55.520 --> 08:13:00.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngayon, balikan natin ang studyante, yung kanila namang environment.

asr-010272
08:13:01.240 --> 08:13:08.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung sana po magkaroon sila ng maayos na classroom, saan komportable po sila.

asr-010273
08:13:09.240 --> 08:13:14.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi ako po mismo, napuntahan ko yung mga sa GIDA or areas.

asr-010274
08:13:15.840 --> 08:13:17.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Talagang makikita niyo po.

asr-010275
08:13:18.100 --> 08:13:23.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na po ako mismo, doon po ako bumuboto sa malalayong lugar.

asr-010276
08:13:23.720 --> 08:13:26.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Doon nyo po makikita sa mga DepEd officials,

asr-010277
08:13:27.380 --> 08:13:34.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I'm sure yung iba sa inyo hindi po napupuntahan yung ibang classrooms na nasa bundok,

asr-010278
08:13:34.720 --> 08:13:35.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nasa malalayong lugar.

asr-010279
08:13:36.660 --> 08:13:40.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At minsan nga, hindi pa yung mga kababayan natin, o tayo mismo,

asr-010280
08:13:40.420 --> 08:13:42.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: hindi natin napupuntahan yung mga eskwelahan.

asr-010281
08:13:43.580 --> 08:13:45.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: During elections lang natin napupuntahan.

asr-010282
08:13:45.540 --> 08:13:47.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Doon mo makikita.

asr-010283
08:13:48.100 --> 08:13:54.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung ano yung mga upuan, ano yung mga armchairs na ginagamit ng mga studyante.

asr-010284
08:13:54.540 --> 08:13:59.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung pupunta po tayo during voting day, during election time,

asr-010285
08:14:01.140 --> 08:14:04.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kulang talaga yung mga classrooms natin until now.

asr-010286
08:14:04.820 --> 08:14:11.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nakakalungkot po na tayo dito, Mr. Sponsor, sinusuportahan natin yan.

asr-010287
08:14:12.800 --> 08:14:14.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yearly, sinusuportahan natin.

asr-010288
08:14:14.480 --> 08:14:16.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gusto natin mabigay sa kanila.

asr-010289
08:14:16.780 --> 08:14:17.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung inaasam nila.

asr-010290
08:14:18.100 --> 08:14:19.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung inaasam nila na budget.

asr-010291
08:14:19.640 --> 08:14:23.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero until now, bakit yung shortage ng classroom?

asr-010292
08:14:23.540 --> 08:14:24.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And dyan pa rin po.

asr-010293
08:14:24.420 --> 08:14:28.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi mo nga, wala pang isang daan yung naitayo noong 2025

asr-010294
08:14:28.120 --> 08:14:32.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: when you came back as a senator, no?

asr-010295
08:14:32.940 --> 08:14:38.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tapos, yung mga 2025 classrooms ay ngayon pa binibiding.

asr-010296
08:14:38.800 --> 08:14:41.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mag-2027 na po tayo.

asr-010297
08:14:41.180 --> 08:14:45.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung 2026 classrooms, patatapos na yung taon.

asr-010298
08:14:45.700 --> 08:14:48.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Happy-happy po tayo para sa mga teachers.

asr-010299
08:14:48.100 --> 08:14:49.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And they deserve it.

asr-010300
08:14:49.900 --> 08:14:51.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But how about the students?

asr-010301
08:14:51.920 --> 08:14:54.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga bata sa bundok.

asr-010302
08:14:54.520 --> 08:14:55.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga mahirap.

asr-010303
08:14:56.400 --> 08:14:57.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba dyan, walang classroom.

asr-010304
08:14:57.840 --> 08:14:59.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Minsan, nagsishare pa sa classroom.

asr-010305
08:15:00.000 --> 08:15:04.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka pwedeng yun po ang dapat tingnan ng ating gobyerno sa ngayon.

asr-010306
08:15:04.600 --> 08:15:10.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At bago po lumabas ang ating sekretary ng education,

asr-010307
08:15:10.800 --> 08:15:14.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and I'm sure, siguro naman, I'm not 100% sure,

asr-010308
08:15:14.740 --> 08:15:20.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: but most likely by September ay iwanan mo na yung debt.

asr-010309
08:15:22.080 --> 08:15:23.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sorry, sorry.

asr-010310
08:15:25.540 --> 08:15:27.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nauna pa akong nagsalita.

asr-010311
08:15:27.080 --> 08:15:35.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, hibig sabihin, huwag naman sanang maiwanan po ito na nakatiwangwang yung mga ginagawang classrooms.

asr-010312
08:15:35.900 --> 08:15:39.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I'm addressing to all the DepEd officials,

asr-010313
08:15:39.820 --> 08:15:44.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: hindi lang po sa ating minamahal at masipag na sekretary.

asr-010314
08:15:44.540 --> 08:15:46.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung sino man po yung maiwan dyan, please naman po.

asr-010315
08:15:47.060 --> 08:15:53.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako po'y nakikiusap po sa inyong lahat, alang-alang na lang po sa ating mga estudyante,

asr-010316
08:15:53.900 --> 08:15:56.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalong-lalo na po yung mga mahirap nating estudyante.

asr-010317
08:15:56.300 --> 08:15:59.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi naman po nag-aaral yung mga mayayaman dyan sa mga public schools.

asr-010318
08:16:00.160 --> 08:16:04.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang nag-aaral po dyan yung mga mahirap nating kababayan na walang pambayad po.

asr-010319
08:16:05.180 --> 08:16:10.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At ito po yung majority ng Filipino people.

asr-010320
08:16:11.280 --> 08:16:15.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga mayayaman, kaya naman magbayad ng mahal na skwelahan,

asr-010321
08:16:16.000 --> 08:16:19.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kahit million pa yung tuition for one year.

asr-010322
08:16:20.000 --> 08:16:21.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito yung mga mahirap talaga.

asr-010323
08:16:21.040 --> 08:16:24.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sobrang kulang yung classrooms natin.

asr-010324
08:16:26.300 --> 08:16:27.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tingin ma-address po ito.

asr-010325
08:16:30.020 --> 08:16:34.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anong target po natin na ma-address po itong shortage sa classroom?

asr-010326
08:16:34.960 --> 08:16:36.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yearly po tayo nag-uusap dito.

asr-010327
08:16:36.800 --> 08:16:39.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yearly tayong nag-uusap ng budget.

asr-010328
08:16:40.180 --> 08:16:45.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tapos nakita natin na I noticed that the budget of the basic education facilities program

asr-010329
08:16:45.320 --> 08:16:50.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: was reduced by 7 billion under our committee report.

asr-010330
08:16:50.540 --> 08:16:52.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May we know the reason for the reduction?

asr-010331
08:16:52.500 --> 08:16:55.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Imbis na dagdagan, bakit na bawasan?

asr-010332
08:16:55.020 --> 08:16:57.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And paano natin ma-address itong kakulangan?

asr-010333
08:16:57.600 --> 08:17:04.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, so as we had discussed with Senator Aimee earlier,

asr-010334
08:17:05.180 --> 08:17:11.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yung implementation ng ating historic 68 billion peso funding for classrooms this year

asr-010335
08:17:11.820 --> 08:17:15.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: has been delayed, to be very honest.

asr-010336
08:17:16.640 --> 08:17:21.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And yung natayo pa nga po na classroom this year ay 500 pa lang.

asr-010337
08:17:21.080 --> 08:17:25.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So ongoing po yung paggamit ng 68 billion.

asr-010338
08:17:25.020 --> 08:17:26.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For 2026.

asr-010339
08:17:26.560 --> 08:17:30.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And as we know, infrastructure projects have a lifespan of two years.

asr-010340
08:17:31.140 --> 08:17:36.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So gagamitin po nila yung nakalaan na 68 billion for this year for next year.

asr-010341
08:17:37.200 --> 08:17:45.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At yung completion ng ating targets, which is about almost 20,000, 18,000 to 19,000 classrooms.

asr-010342
08:17:45.620 --> 08:17:49.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang target po niyan ay matapos before the end of 2027.

asr-010343
08:17:50.180 --> 08:17:53.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Admittedly, and this is admittedly from our hearings,

asr-010344
08:17:53.280 --> 08:17:54.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi naging...

asr-010345
08:17:55.020 --> 08:17:59.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kasing dali nang naisip natin yung implementation ng pagtayo ng classrooms.

asr-010346
08:17:59.800 --> 08:18:02.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Para po sa inyong representasyon, sa tingin ko po,

asr-010347
08:18:02.560 --> 08:18:07.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas mainam na palawigin natin yung classroom acceleration program

asr-010348
08:18:07.140 --> 08:18:09.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: na direct sa mga LGUs yung pagpapatayo.

asr-010349
08:18:10.280 --> 08:18:12.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And for this year, may pondo rin po yan,

asr-010350
08:18:13.080 --> 08:18:17.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: pero admittedly, binawasan po yan para magkaroon ng espasyo ang DepEd

asr-010351
08:18:17.240 --> 08:18:22.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: na magamit yung nakalaan for 2026 at maubos po nila yan before we fund them again.

asr-010352
08:18:23.440 --> 08:18:24.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung 7 billion po na tinanggal,

asr-010353
08:18:24.980 --> 08:18:31.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nilagay po natin sa feeding program kasi bitin na bitin yung pondo para sa feeding program.

asr-010354
08:18:31.140 --> 08:18:35.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Doon po natin nilagay and we will also try to increase that further

asr-010355
08:18:35.140 --> 08:18:37.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: come the period of amendments, Mr. President.

asr-010356
08:18:38.200 --> 08:18:41.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, to make the long story short,

asr-010357
08:18:41.700 --> 08:18:45.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi po napondohan yung classrooms for this year

asr-010358
08:18:45.400 --> 08:18:50.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: dahil hindi po na-implement completely yung pondo for 2026.

asr-010359
08:18:50.980 --> 08:18:52.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, maganda po, ongoing po ito.

asr-010360
08:18:52.740 --> 08:18:54.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And for the first...

asr-010361
08:18:54.980 --> 08:18:57.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Seven months of the year, of this year,

asr-010362
08:18:58.160 --> 08:19:00.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nagkaroon ng validation ang DepEd,

asr-010363
08:19:00.600 --> 08:19:02.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: inisa-isa yung mga school sites,

asr-010364
08:19:02.680 --> 08:19:03.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung merong buildable space,

asr-010365
08:19:04.040 --> 08:19:05.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung merong mga problema sa titulo,

asr-010366
08:19:06.280 --> 08:19:09.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung ano talaga yung kailangan ng mga particular schools.

asr-010367
08:19:09.540 --> 08:19:11.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And now that that data is ready,

asr-010368
08:19:11.320 --> 08:19:13.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and in fact, they gave us the data yesterday,

asr-010369
08:19:13.980 --> 08:19:16.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: magiging mas mabilis na rin po yung implementation.

asr-010370
08:19:17.180 --> 08:19:19.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, with regard to the gap, Mr. President,

asr-010371
08:19:19.860 --> 08:19:22.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi po ito matatapos ng isang presidente.

asr-010372
08:19:23.280 --> 08:19:24.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This is three administration work,

asr-010373
08:19:24.980 --> 08:19:26.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and this is the fourth of projects.

asr-010374
08:19:26.980 --> 08:19:28.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because ganun po kalaki ang gap natin.

asr-010375
08:19:28.980 --> 08:19:34.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 142,000 na lang ang gap natin.

asr-010376
08:19:34.980 --> 08:19:36.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero even if we do 10,000 a year,

asr-010377
08:19:36.980 --> 08:19:38.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which is already a lot.

asr-010378
08:19:38.980 --> 08:19:42.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In fact, we're gonna try to do 20,000 next year.

asr-010379
08:19:42.980 --> 08:19:44.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ibig sabihin po niyan,

asr-010380
08:19:44.980 --> 08:19:46.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: seven to eight to nine years po yan,

asr-010381
08:19:46.980 --> 08:19:49.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: bago po natin maabot yung gap.

asr-010382
08:19:49.980 --> 08:19:53.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the implementation and the funding need to continue.

asr-010383
08:19:53.980 --> 08:19:55.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And malaking challenge po ito.

asr-010384
08:19:55.980 --> 08:19:57.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero at the end of the day, Mr. President,

asr-010385
08:19:57.980 --> 08:19:58.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nasa atin rin naman yan.

asr-010386
08:19:58.980 --> 08:20:00.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tayo naman po yung nagpo-pondo.

asr-010387
08:20:00.980 --> 08:20:02.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, kung handa tayong pondohan yan,

asr-010388
08:20:02.980 --> 08:20:04.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: within seven to 10 years,

asr-010389
08:20:04.980 --> 08:20:05.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: magagawan po natin ng paraan.

asr-010390
08:20:05.980 --> 08:20:09.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, yung isa rin plano ng DepEd is also the PPP.

asr-010391
08:20:09.980 --> 08:20:10.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: With PCIP.

asr-010392
08:20:10.980 --> 08:20:13.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung Public-Private Partnership.

asr-010393
08:20:13.980 --> 08:20:16.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung saan, 10 gives.

asr-010394
08:20:16.980 --> 08:20:19.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 10 gives dun po sa mga contractor

asr-010395
08:20:19.980 --> 08:20:21.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yung pagpapatuyoy ng classroom.

asr-010396
08:20:21.980 --> 08:20:24.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Unfortunately, hindi po siya natuloy this year.

asr-010397
08:20:24.980 --> 08:20:27.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sinisikap po nila na matuloy yan next year or next-next year.

asr-010398
08:20:27.980 --> 08:20:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But once that is ongoing,

asr-010399
08:20:29.980 --> 08:20:32.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: it will be another modality ng pagpapatuyo po ng classroom.

asr-010400
08:20:32.980 --> 08:20:33.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we're hoping,

asr-010401
08:20:33.980 --> 08:20:36.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: maybe up to 20,000 to 30,000 classrooms or even more

asr-010402
08:20:36.980 --> 08:20:39.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: can be done through the Public-Private Partnerships.

asr-010403
08:20:39.980 --> 08:20:41.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat.

asr-010404
08:20:41.980 --> 08:20:44.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Naalala ko po, Mr. Sponsor, Sen. Bam, na

asr-010405
08:20:44.980 --> 08:20:48.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: it was you who first raised this concern na

asr-010406
08:20:48.980 --> 08:20:50.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nung 2025,

asr-010407
08:20:50.980 --> 08:20:53.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ilang classroom lang po yung napatayo nila?

asr-010408
08:20:53.980 --> 08:20:55.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Parang 22.

asr-010409
08:20:55.980 --> 08:20:56.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 22 pa lang.

asr-010410
08:20:56.980 --> 08:21:01.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So out of 140,000 classroom na shortage.

asr-010411
08:21:01.980 --> 08:21:02.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sorry.

asr-010412
08:21:02.980 --> 08:21:05.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So by the end of the year, 48.

asr-010413
08:21:05.980 --> 08:21:09.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: By the end of?

asr-010415
08:21:11.980 --> 08:21:14.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, so by the end of 2025,

asr-010416
08:21:14.980 --> 08:21:18.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 4,800 daw po yung natapos.

asr-010417
08:21:18.980 --> 08:21:19.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Although at the time of the hearing,

asr-010418
08:21:20.980 --> 08:21:22.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 22 pa lang po yung natapos na.

asr-010419
08:21:22.980 --> 08:21:25.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: It was already August, I think, or September.

asr-010420
08:21:25.980 --> 08:21:28.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So for this year, ano po ang target?

asr-010421
08:21:28.980 --> 08:21:31.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The target for this year is 19,000.

asr-010422
08:21:31.980 --> 08:21:32.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang nabuo po is 500.

asr-010423
08:21:32.980 --> 08:21:35.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And ang mangyayari po, tutuloy po siya till next year.

asr-010424
08:21:35.980 --> 08:21:40.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi hindi po talaga na-delay na mga six months, honestly, no?

asr-010425
08:21:40.980 --> 08:21:43.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung implementation, about six to eight months.

asr-010426
08:21:43.980 --> 08:21:46.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And naka-identify na po.

asr-010427
08:21:46.980 --> 08:21:48.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Naka-identify na yung mga classrooms na ito,

asr-010428
08:21:48.980 --> 08:21:49.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yung mga lugar na ito.

asr-010429
08:21:49.980 --> 08:21:52.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And EDCOM 2 will be publishing this data very soon.

asr-010430
08:21:52.980 --> 08:21:56.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But admittedly, nasa MOA stage yung iba.

asr-010431
08:21:56.980 --> 08:21:58.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nasa first stage pa lang yung iba.

asr-010432
08:21:58.980 --> 08:22:01.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the target is to have this finished by middle of next year.

asr-010433
08:22:01.980 --> 08:22:03.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-010434
08:22:03.980 --> 08:22:09.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So I'm hearing from the Secretary that a construction period for any infra is two years.

asr-010435
08:22:09.980 --> 08:22:14.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So if you look at it from that perspective, next year pa talaga.

asr-010436
08:22:14.980 --> 08:22:19.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But as you and I both know, we had high hopes that a number of this would have been completed.

asr-010437
08:22:19.980 --> 08:22:20.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This year.

asr-010438
08:22:20.980 --> 08:22:25.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But they still have space for next year to finish the targeted 18,000 to 19,000.

asr-010439
08:22:25.980 --> 08:22:34.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So ano ang problema talaga yung funding or yung kakayahan to construct or the processes na napakatagal po?

asr-010440
08:22:34.980 --> 08:22:39.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ako, if you ask me, and this is the subject of our hearings multiple times,

asr-010441
08:22:39.980 --> 08:22:44.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DepEd took about six months to really assess every site and validate.

asr-010442
08:22:44.980 --> 08:22:47.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of course, you can argue.

asr-010443
08:22:47.980 --> 08:22:51.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Shouldn't you have that data ready already?

asr-010444
08:22:51.980 --> 08:22:54.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But they validated again all of the sites.

asr-010445
08:22:54.980 --> 08:22:56.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 50,000 sites, no?

asr-010446
08:22:56.980 --> 08:22:58.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: About 50,000 sites.

asr-010447
08:22:58.980 --> 08:22:59.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And may data na po sila.

asr-010448
08:22:59.980 --> 08:23:02.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung mga skwelahan, may problema ba sa titulo?

asr-010449
08:23:02.980 --> 08:23:05.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ilan yung kailangan i-demolish?

asr-010450
08:23:05.980 --> 08:23:06.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung soil testing?

asr-010451
08:23:06.980 --> 08:23:08.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Buildable space?

asr-010452
08:23:08.980 --> 08:23:14.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And of course, we can argue whether that was the sound methodology or not.

asr-010453
08:23:14.980 --> 08:23:16.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But basically for this year,

asr-010454
08:23:16.980 --> 08:23:20.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the start of many of these school buildings were delayed

asr-010455
08:23:20.980 --> 08:23:24.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because they took the due diligence to really check every site first.

asr-010456
08:23:24.980 --> 08:23:25.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President,

asr-010457
08:23:25.980 --> 08:23:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the pangako naman nila is that ngayon na na-test na yan at alam na yan,

asr-010458
08:23:29.980 --> 08:23:31.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas mabilis na dapat yung implementation.

asr-010459
08:23:31.980 --> 08:23:40.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since nabanggit mo nga kanina na it will take about nine to ten years.

asr-010460
08:23:40.980 --> 08:23:44.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So ibig sabihin yung studyante na grade one,

asr-010461
08:23:44.980 --> 08:23:53.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: maaaring hindi na niya mapakinabangan yung classroom kasi baka nakagraduate na siya bago matapos.

asr-010462
08:23:53.980 --> 08:23:58.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Well, Mr. President, ang priority natin is actually the lower years, no?

asr-010463
08:23:58.980 --> 08:24:02.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So si kinder tsaka si grade one, yun talaga yung priority.

asr-010464
08:24:02.980 --> 08:24:04.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung GAIDA is also a priority.

asr-010465
08:24:04.980 --> 08:24:10.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We passed the GAIDA law recently at nasa budget rin in the BFF, yung GAIDA schools.

asr-010466
08:24:10.980 --> 08:24:13.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So hopefully, Mr. President, yung mga maliliit na bata,

asr-010467
08:24:13.980 --> 08:24:17.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nasa malalayong lugar ang mabibigyan ng suporta kaagad.

asr-010468
08:24:17.980 --> 08:24:26.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The truth is, Mr. President, mas ang nahihirapan talaga tayo yung mga heavily congested schools

asr-010469
08:24:26.980 --> 08:24:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because there's no more land, wala na pong lupa.

asr-010470
08:24:29.980 --> 08:24:38.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And in those areas, kailangan mo ng seven to ten floors na dihamak mas mahal kesa yung mga one to three floors.

asr-010471
08:24:38.980 --> 08:24:42.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mas matagal rin siyang i-construct kasi kailangan mo na ng elevator at may demolition.

asr-010472
08:24:42.980 --> 08:24:43.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Demolition.

asr-010473
08:24:43.980 --> 08:24:49.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So in many of the congested areas, it's a little bit, may konting difficulty.

asr-010474
08:24:49.980 --> 08:24:57.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the areas na nasa malalayong lugar, gaya po na nabanggitin niyo, actually, technically, mas madali siyang gawan kasi mas simple.

asr-010475
08:24:57.980 --> 08:25:01.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But in any case, Mr. President, our committee nakabantay po dito.

asr-010476
08:25:01.980 --> 08:25:06.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In fact, sometimes I feel that they also think masyado na akong makulit.

asr-010477
08:25:06.980 --> 08:25:10.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero we're doing our best, Mr. President, to make sure na on track ito.

asr-010478
08:25:10.980 --> 08:25:12.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And our next goal is to publish.

asr-010479
08:25:12.980 --> 08:25:16.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The 2026 rollout and the 2027 rollout as well, no?

asr-010480
08:25:16.980 --> 08:25:21.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakisilip lang po sa mga gaida areas.

asr-010481
08:25:21.980 --> 08:25:25.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas marami pong lupa doon kesa classroom.

asr-010482
08:25:25.980 --> 08:25:27.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Halos wala kang makitang classroom.

asr-010483
08:25:27.980 --> 08:25:28.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Puro lupa po.

asr-010484
08:25:28.980 --> 08:25:34.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So nasa opposite situation naman po yung mga nasa gaida.

asr-010485
08:25:34.980 --> 08:25:39.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako mismo po, Mr. President, Mr. Sponsor, napuntahan ko talaga to.

asr-010486
08:25:39.980 --> 08:25:41.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Even just last week, nakita ko yung sitwasyon.

asr-010487
08:25:41.980 --> 08:25:42.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakita ko yung sitwasyon nila.

asr-010488
08:25:42.980 --> 08:25:44.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mawawa talaga yung mga estudyante.

asr-010489
08:25:44.980 --> 08:25:46.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming mga lugar.

asr-010490
08:25:46.980 --> 08:25:50.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa bundok o sa pinakamalayong mga probinsya.

asr-010491
08:25:50.980 --> 08:25:52.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi ako mismo, napuntahan ko na po yan.

asr-010492
08:25:52.980 --> 08:25:55.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mula Apare hanggang Hulo.

asr-010493
08:25:55.980 --> 08:26:00.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung narinig natin si Senate President Pro Tempore yun sa Itbulaga.

asr-010494
08:26:00.980 --> 08:26:02.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mula Apare hanggang Hulo.

asr-010495
08:26:02.980 --> 08:26:04.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mula Apare hanggang Hulo.

asr-010496
08:26:04.980 --> 08:26:05.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako napuntahan ko po yan.

asr-010497
08:26:05.980 --> 08:26:06.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang mas malayo pa.

asr-010498
08:26:06.980 --> 08:26:08.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi lang po Apare.

asr-010499
08:26:08.980 --> 08:26:10.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas malayo yung Santa Ana, Batanes.

asr-010500
08:26:10.980 --> 08:26:14.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas dulo pa kesa dito sa Apare.

asr-010501
08:26:14.980 --> 08:26:17.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako mismo, napuntahan ko na yung Apare, Santa Ana, Batanes.

asr-010502
08:26:17.980 --> 08:26:19.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At dito naman po sa Mindanao.

asr-010503
08:26:19.980 --> 08:26:21.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo sa amin, mga taga Mindanao.

asr-010504
08:26:21.980 --> 08:26:23.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Batanggenyo po ako na taga Mindanao.

asr-010505
08:26:23.980 --> 08:26:25.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa mga bundok na lugar.

asr-010506
08:26:25.980 --> 08:26:26.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kulang.

asr-010507
08:26:26.980 --> 08:26:28.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Makikita mo yung mga estudyante naglalakad.

asr-010508
08:26:28.980 --> 08:26:30.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi nila, nagsisharing lang sila sa classroom.

asr-010509
08:26:30.980 --> 08:26:31.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mamaya na naman.

asr-010510
08:26:31.980 --> 08:26:37.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun naman ang gagamit yung ibang mga school.

asr-010511
08:26:37.980 --> 08:26:38.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibang grades.

asr-010512
08:26:38.980 --> 08:26:39.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I mean.

asr-010513
08:26:39.980 --> 08:26:41.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Grade 1 ang gagamit dito ngayon.

asr-010514
08:26:41.980 --> 08:26:45.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mamaya ibang grade level naman ang gagamit.

asr-010515
08:26:45.980 --> 08:26:47.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kawawa talaga yung sitwasyon.

asr-010516
08:26:47.980 --> 08:26:49.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana ma-address po natin ito.

asr-010517
08:26:49.980 --> 08:26:50.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I am sure.

asr-010518
08:26:50.980 --> 08:26:56.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking tulong rin po yung feeding program nyo, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-010519
08:26:56.980 --> 08:27:00.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana ma-address natin itong shortage ng classroom.

asr-010520
08:27:00.980 --> 08:27:03.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: The soonest possible time.

asr-010521
08:27:03.980 --> 08:27:07.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi hindi na po makakaantay yung ating mga estudyante.

asr-010522
08:27:07.980 --> 08:27:08.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gaya ng sinabi ko.

asr-010523
08:27:08.980 --> 08:27:10.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Makaring gagraduate na po yun.

asr-010524
08:27:10.980 --> 08:27:13.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi na nila maging.

asr-010525
08:27:13.980 --> 08:27:15.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit na ginawa nyo ng K-12 nga.

asr-010526
08:27:15.980 --> 08:27:19.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bakit hindi na nila mapapakinabangan itong mga classrooms na ito.

asr-010527
08:27:19.980 --> 08:27:26.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Until we can finally fill in the gaps dito sa shortage.

asr-010528
08:27:26.980 --> 08:27:34.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At how does the department prioritize schools and localities for classroom construction?

asr-010529
08:27:34.980 --> 08:27:36.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Particularly in areas experiencing severe classroom shortage.

asr-010530
08:27:36.980 --> 08:27:40.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And overcrowding.

asr-010531
08:27:40.980 --> 08:27:42.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Paano yung ginagawa po ngayon?

asr-010532
08:27:42.980 --> 08:27:43.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yes.

asr-010533
08:27:43.980 --> 08:27:52.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, the priority is severe classroom shortage, congestion, unsafe classrooms, gaida, or last mile schools, and high enrollment.

asr-010534
08:27:52.980 --> 08:27:58.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then of course, once may listahan na po yan, the projects will be screened further for readiness.

asr-010535
08:27:58.980 --> 08:28:04.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ibig sabihin may buildable space, may titulo, and technically feasible to build there.

asr-010536
08:28:04.980 --> 08:28:10.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then DepEd will also decide kung ito ba'y mapupunta sa LGU, sa mga...

asr-010537
08:28:10.980 --> 08:28:15.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Although wala pa naman yung CSO-NGO, but we did provide it in the GAAA for 2026.

asr-010538
08:28:15.980 --> 08:28:21.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Or even if it will be built by DepEd, which are the learning continuity spaces.

asr-010539
08:28:21.980 --> 08:28:25.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: By February, magsisimula na yung constructing for most of these.

asr-010540
08:28:25.980 --> 08:28:30.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Practically all magsisimula na daw po by February for the CSO and NGOs.

asr-010541
08:28:30.980 --> 08:28:32.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So yun po yung criteria natin.

asr-010542
08:28:32.980 --> 08:28:33.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Napansin natin.

asr-010543
08:28:33.980 --> 08:28:42.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko po, may mga eskwelahan pa rin na hindi maganda yung kondisyon, sira-sira yung bubong, o ang iero pa rin ang bubong.

asr-010544
08:28:42.980 --> 08:28:49.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi maayos ang mga silid-aralan, maruruming palikuran, kahoy na pundasyon, at marami pang iba.

asr-010545
08:28:49.980 --> 08:28:54.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Parati pong hinain ng mga teachers na sana po'y matutukan ito.

asr-010546
08:28:54.980 --> 08:28:58.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sa sino po among our DepEd officials?

asr-010547
08:28:58.980 --> 08:29:01.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I'm sure yung mga RD na napuntahan nila.

asr-010548
08:29:01.980 --> 08:29:10.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Who among the top DepEd officials na mismong nasaksihan o nakita nila yung real situation on the ground?

asr-010549
08:29:10.980 --> 08:29:12.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Who's assigned to the school buildings ba?

asr-010551
08:29:16.980 --> 08:29:20.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So Mr. President, yung leadership ng DepEd, may mga assigned regions sila.

asr-010552
08:29:20.980 --> 08:29:24.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So apart from their duties at Central, umiikot rin po sila sa mga region.

asr-010553
08:29:24.980 --> 08:29:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So all of the leadership from the Secretary, USEC, ASEC,

asr-010554
08:29:29.980 --> 08:29:32.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: umiikot po sila sa mga iba't ibang lugar.

asr-010555
08:29:32.980 --> 08:29:38.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napuntahan rin nila yung, nagkocross lang sa river with?

asr-010557
08:29:40.980 --> 08:29:41.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nagpuntahan rin nila?

asr-010558
08:29:41.980 --> 08:29:44.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Si SEC daw po mismo ang nakadaan po doon.

asr-010559
08:29:44.980 --> 08:29:45.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Saan?

asr-010560
08:29:45.980 --> 08:29:46.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Agusan.

asr-010561
08:29:46.980 --> 08:29:47.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang puntahan mo?

asr-010562
08:29:47.980 --> 08:29:49.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Buena Vista.

asr-010563
08:29:49.980 --> 08:29:51.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa labas. Two hours from. Sa labas na.

asr-010564
08:29:51.980 --> 08:29:57.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Two hours from the borderline po ng Del Norte at Del Sur.

asr-010565
08:29:57.980 --> 08:29:59.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So kaminado naman ang ating Secretary.

asr-010566
08:30:00.000 --> 08:30:05.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o ang departamento na talagang mahirap ang sitwasyon doon sa malalayong lugar,

asr-010567
08:30:05.800 --> 08:30:07.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalo-lalo na po sa bukid.

asr-010568
08:30:08.180 --> 08:30:09.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Doon na po natutulog yung mga teacher.

asr-010569
08:30:09.840 --> 08:30:14.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you remember, sa guide-a-law, hindi lang po siya pagtayo ng classroom sa malalayong lugar.

asr-010570
08:30:15.140 --> 08:30:20.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We even included allowances for the teacher or even building dorms for them

asr-010571
08:30:20.040 --> 08:30:26.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and setting up the site maps na lahat ng mga malalayong lugar.

asr-010572
08:30:26.020 --> 08:30:31.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Every three kilometers, dapat merong skwilahan sa mga barangay o sa mga individual.

asr-010573
08:30:31.560 --> 08:30:34.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we're hoping for the full implementation of this law, Mr. President.

asr-010574
08:30:35.320 --> 08:30:40.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And of course, DepEd supported that law, kaya umaasa po kami ma-implement po siya this year.

asr-010575
08:30:40.640 --> 08:30:41.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Salamat po.

asr-010576
08:30:42.800 --> 08:30:52.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po ang aking pangarap, dream ko po na sana the soonest possible time na ma-address po ito.

asr-010577
08:30:52.020 --> 08:30:56.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi naman natin totally kaagad immediately sa tatlong taon.

asr-010578
08:30:56.020 --> 08:31:03.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But sana po yung magkaroon ng maayos at komportable naman pong silid para lang ang ating mga estudyante.

asr-010579
08:31:04.160 --> 08:31:08.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil sila po yung kinabukasan ng ating bayan, ito mga kabataan.

asr-010580
08:31:08.940 --> 08:31:18.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo-lalo na po yung mga mahirap nating mga kabataan na gusto pong mag-aral at wala pong kakayahang mag-aral sa mga private schools.

asr-010581
08:31:19.560 --> 08:31:25.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. President, another important concern that we must address is the safety and security of our learners inside our public schools.

asr-010582
08:31:26.020 --> 08:31:31.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam naman natin na marami pong shooting incidents na nangyari.

asr-010583
08:31:33.160 --> 08:31:45.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Following the recent incidents of violence in our educational institutions, we must ensure that our schools are adequately equipped and prepared to prevent, detect, and respond to potential security threats.

asr-010584
08:31:45.480 --> 08:31:54.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nabalita naman natin sa South Cotabato, sa Banga, sa Tacloban, at sa Sambuanga.

asr-010585
08:31:56.020 --> 08:32:12.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang nababalitaan natin, nakakalungkot po, habang hindi pa po batas ang Senate Bill 2427 o ito pong Comprehensive School Safety Act na ipinasa dito sa Senado ng sponsor at inyakda ko rin po.

asr-010586
08:32:12.860 --> 08:32:18.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ano po ba ang plano ng DepEd sa ngayon to improve the security sa ating mga paralan?

asr-010587
08:32:19.000 --> 08:32:24.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Does DepEd have a framework for this, prioritization framework?

asr-010588
08:32:25.000 --> 08:32:26.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Which schools have received?

asr-010589
08:32:26.020 --> 08:32:28.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Which schools have received security upgrades first?

asr-010590
08:32:29.180 --> 08:32:38.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil tuwing narinig natin may mga incidenteng ganito, maraming turuan na, kulang sa security, kulang sa ganito, kulang sa CCTV.

asr-010591
08:32:39.740 --> 08:32:43.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ano ba ang ginagawa ng DepEd sa ngayon para ma-address na po ito?

asr-010592
08:32:44.320 --> 08:32:48.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, unang-una, they have done a 100% school safety audit.

asr-010593
08:32:48.440 --> 08:32:50.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, naaral po lahat ng mga eskwelahan.

asr-010594
08:32:51.060 --> 08:32:55.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And now, they will prioritize the deployment of additional security personnel.

asr-010595
08:32:56.020 --> 08:32:58.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In large, extra large, and mega schools.

asr-010596
08:32:58.720 --> 08:33:02.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ito po yung mga eskwelahan na libu-libu yung mga bata.

asr-010597
08:33:03.020 --> 08:33:08.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Meron na po silang Joint Circular with DILG for deployment of barangay tanod to smaller schools.

asr-010598
08:33:09.320 --> 08:33:16.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At meron na rin pong pagpayag na paggamit ng MOE to provide CCTV, metal detectors.

asr-010599
08:33:16.860 --> 08:33:20.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And ang ibang LGU po tumulong rin sa mga safety infrastructure.

asr-010600
08:33:20.860 --> 08:33:25.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasama rin po dito yung training programs para sa mga teachers, student leaders,

asr-010601
08:33:26.020 --> 08:33:28.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa magulang, dun po sa tamang paggamit ng internet.

asr-010602
08:33:29.960 --> 08:33:37.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the audit, lumalabas po na 44% of schools have CCTV, while the rest of course wala po.

asr-010603
08:33:38.720 --> 08:33:42.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Meron rin pong may mga metal detector, about 47%.

asr-010604
08:33:42.180 --> 08:33:47.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then 75% may fences, and may pondo rin po ngayon sa budget for perimeter fencing.

asr-010605
08:33:48.360 --> 08:33:52.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung security guard, watchmen, and the rest, meron rin po silang pag-aaral.

asr-010606
08:33:52.720 --> 08:33:55.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Only 38% have security guards.

asr-010607
08:33:55.040 --> 08:34:00.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At kasama na po dito yung dagdag na pondo at yung pagpayag sa mga tanod na tumulong rin.

asr-010608
08:34:01.720 --> 08:34:03.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And so on and so forth, Mr. President.

asr-010609
08:34:03.660 --> 08:34:09.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, they have been doing their jobs, but as we find in the School Safety Act,

asr-010610
08:34:09.900 --> 08:34:12.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: nilang po ito paramihan ng kagamitan.

asr-010611
08:34:12.860 --> 08:34:17.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kailangan po talaga ng tamang pag-iintindi ng mga magulang, studyante, guro,

asr-010612
08:34:17.680 --> 08:34:24.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung paano talaga maiwasan ang masasamang elemento para hindi po tayo humantong sa karahasan.

asr-010613
08:34:24.140 --> 08:34:25.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it's a big challenge.

asr-010614
08:34:25.020 --> 08:34:31.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's a big challenge, pero naniniwala po tayo na gaya ng nakalagay sa School Safety Act,

asr-010615
08:34:31.360 --> 08:34:35.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung magsasama-sama yung komunidad, merong support for equipment,

asr-010616
08:34:35.400 --> 08:34:37.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: may tamang kaalaman pagating sa paggamit ng internet,

asr-010617
08:34:38.500 --> 08:34:40.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas magkakaroon po tayo ng mga skwilahan na mas ligtas.

asr-010618
08:34:41.080 --> 08:34:44.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we are, ano naman, they are doing what they can,

asr-010619
08:34:44.600 --> 08:34:49.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: but as you have said, Mr. President, kapag napasa yung batas,

asr-010620
08:34:49.480 --> 08:34:53.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas magkakaroon ng lakas para ma-implement yung school safety sa ating bansa.

asr-010621
08:34:53.900 --> 08:34:54.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po.

asr-010622
08:34:55.020 --> 08:35:03.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Sponsor, dito naman tayo sa teachers' welfare on another topic.

asr-010623
08:35:03.800 --> 08:35:11.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. President, I would like to raise a matter concerning the welfare and financial security of our public school teachers.

asr-010624
08:35:12.320 --> 08:35:19.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We must also recognize the need to ensure that they receive fair compensation and adequate benefits

asr-010625
08:35:19.540 --> 08:35:23.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: in recognition of their service and sacrifices.

asr-010626
08:35:23.160 --> 08:35:24.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At maalala ko po.

asr-010627
08:35:25.020 --> 08:35:32.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nung una po ako naging senador, isa po tayo sa author at co-sponsor ng yung SSL,

asr-010628
08:35:32.840 --> 08:35:35.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung Salary Standardization 5.

asr-010629
08:35:35.940 --> 08:35:40.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And after that, wala na pong batas na naipasa tayo rito sa Senado.

asr-010630
08:35:40.640 --> 08:35:42.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Siguro, executive order na lang po noon.

asr-010631
08:35:43.320 --> 08:35:49.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At ano bang, alam ko, yun rin po ang hinain ng mga teachers.

asr-010632
08:35:49.220 --> 08:35:50.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kami naman, kami naman.

asr-010633
08:35:50.900 --> 08:35:53.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salin nyo naman po kami sa...

asr-010634
08:35:55.020 --> 08:35:57.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: increase ng sweldo sa gobyerno.

asr-010635
08:35:58.080 --> 08:36:01.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa ngayon po ba, for the past five years,

asr-010636
08:36:02.000 --> 08:36:05.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ano na hong mga increases, salary increases?

asr-010637
08:36:06.360 --> 08:36:10.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At meron bang plano para sa mga teachers natin in the near future?

asr-010638
08:36:16.400 --> 08:36:19.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil sa sobrang taas po ng bilihin ngayon,

asr-010639
08:36:19.780 --> 08:36:24.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: baka kulang pa yung increase na matatanggap ng ating...

asr-010640
08:36:24.860 --> 08:36:26.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ng ating mga teachers,

asr-010641
08:36:27.600 --> 08:36:32.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kulang pa yung pamasahin nila papunta po sa mga skwelahan.

asr-010642
08:36:34.880 --> 08:36:39.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, the DEPED has implemented the usual step increase.

