asr-012042
09:38:45.600 --> 09:38:49.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and I just want to mention that si FRNI,

asr-012043
09:38:50.120 --> 09:38:53.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's under DOST, is in charge of the studies, no?

asr-012044
09:38:53.320 --> 09:38:56.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And their studies confirm that masama talaga ang vaping.

asr-012045
09:38:57.000 --> 09:39:01.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi at the time that that was brought up here in the Senate,

asr-012046
09:39:01.840 --> 09:39:05.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: meron pang sinasite ng mga studies na safer than smoking, gano'n.

asr-012047
09:39:06.040 --> 09:39:10.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I just want to put it on record again para strong din ang approach

asr-012048
09:39:10.400 --> 09:39:13.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and whole of government yung approach natin dito.

asr-012049
09:39:13.300 --> 09:39:14.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't need a long answer.

asr-012050
09:39:14.460 --> 09:39:20.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Actually, I just need you to nod your head and confirm that the studies that we have,

asr-012051
09:39:20.120 --> 09:39:25.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: state that it is bad and that I think sa kanila din nang galing yung number of,

asr-012052
09:39:26.260 --> 09:39:30.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung uptake natin na sinabing as young as 10 years old, regular na nagde-vape.

asr-012053
09:39:30.720 --> 09:39:36.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So we're just very concerned and we're happy that we have an independent agency conducting these studies.

asr-012054
09:39:38.340 --> 09:39:40.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, they already have the data.

asr-012055
09:39:41.020 --> 09:39:47.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They're finalizing the studies and the correlation of vaping and its correlation to health.

asr-012056
09:39:47.280 --> 09:39:49.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And they will be finished by...

asr-012057
09:39:50.120 --> 09:39:53.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: By the end of next year, Mr. President.

asr-012058
09:39:53.820 --> 09:40:01.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the statistics are already available and they're part of the National Nutrition Survey, Mr. President.

asr-012059
09:40:01.620 --> 09:40:04.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Well, ako na lang maglalagay on record what the...

asr-012060
09:40:04.560 --> 09:40:07.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm happy that they have a more updated one, but the one I have,

asr-012061
09:40:07.760 --> 09:40:11.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which comes from Food and Nutrition Research Institute, FNRI,

asr-012062
09:40:11.920 --> 09:40:15.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in 2015, the uptake on e-cigarettes is 0.8%.

asr-012063
09:40:15.940 --> 09:40:19.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In 2018, umakit ng konti, 3%.

asr-012064
09:40:19.180 --> 09:40:19.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In 2021...

asr-012065
09:40:20.120 --> 09:40:21.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In 2021, 7.5%.

asr-012066
09:40:21.780 --> 09:40:26.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Dear colleagues, in 2023, 39.9%.

asr-012067
09:40:26.200 --> 09:40:30.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And this is the age group of 10 to 19.

asr-012068
09:40:30.540 --> 09:40:32.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's why it's so bothersome.

asr-012069
09:40:33.080 --> 09:40:37.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, um, continue na lang to give us this data

asr-012070
09:40:37.040 --> 09:40:41.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because it's very important that from the parents to the educators,

asr-012071
09:40:41.980 --> 09:40:49.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the local government, aware sila sa health risk nito.

asr-012072
09:40:50.120 --> 09:40:52.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you.

asr-012073
