Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, um, I know the question was regarding health, di ba,

asr-012074
09:40:56.000 --> 09:40:58.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung mabuti ba ito o masama sa ating kalusugan.

asr-012075
