Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the director here mentioned that this will be part of the study

asr-012076
09:41:02.580 --> 09:41:05.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which will be available by the end of 2027.

asr-012077
09:41:05.620 --> 09:41:10.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, not just usage, but also correlation to health by next year.

asr-012078
09:41:10.380 --> 09:41:10.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-012079
09:41:11.000 --> 09:41:15.480
