asr-012080
09:41:15.580 --> 09:41:16.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that it's really dangerous.

asr-012081
09:41:16.780 --> 09:41:18.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And they call it...

asr-012082
09:41:18.120 --> 09:41:19.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ano pang iinakamatay?

asr-012083
09:41:20.120 --> 09:41:27.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There's this term, uh, concocted called EVALI, yung death by vaping.

asr-012084
09:41:27.640 --> 09:41:28.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: EVALI?

asr-012085
09:41:28.720 --> 09:41:29.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: EVALI.

asr-012086
09:41:29.620 --> 09:41:30.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: EVALI.

asr-012087
09:41:30.220 --> 09:41:31.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is that an acronym, Mr. President?

asr-012088
09:41:31.320 --> 09:41:37.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah, it's an acronym for basically complications that lead to death that result from vaping.

asr-012089
09:41:37.200 --> 09:41:38.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, I'll leave it at that.

asr-012090
09:41:38.420 --> 09:41:40.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Talagang marami pang, mahaba pa yung gabi natin.

asr-012091
09:41:41.220 --> 09:41:46.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung second question ko lang naman is about our, um, virology law.

asr-012092
09:41:46.760 --> 09:41:49.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam ni Secretary yan na I wanted assurance

asr-012093
09:41:49.260 --> 09:41:57.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that when we roll this out, hindi rin mahahamper ang iba-ibang agencies natin involved in research,

asr-012094
09:41:57.400 --> 09:41:58.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: including the RITM.

asr-012095
09:41:59.400 --> 09:42:04.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I, again, again, uh, I will harp on whole of government approach.

asr-012096
09:42:05.080 --> 09:42:06.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam ko, these are independent agencies.

asr-012097
09:42:07.120 --> 09:42:08.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: RITM is under DOH.

asr-012098
09:42:09.380 --> 09:42:14.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Um, but I just need that assurance na tulong-tulong tayo to support each other.

asr-012099
09:42:14.560 --> 09:42:19.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And question ko lang is on the rules na, um, we heard.

asr-012100
09:42:19.260 --> 09:42:21.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Natapos na, but we didn't see the publication.

asr-012101
09:42:21.760 --> 09:42:22.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, just a quick update.

asr-012102
09:42:22.880 --> 09:42:24.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Where are we with virology?

asr-012103
09:42:24.720 --> 09:42:25.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Uh, yes, Mr. President.

asr-012104
09:42:26.000 --> 09:42:30.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Uh, so, DOST is part of the board of RITM and they will, ano?

asr-012106
09:42:32.120 --> 09:42:32.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, sorry.

asr-012107
09:42:33.020 --> 09:42:39.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: RITM is the part of the board of, of the virology and vaccine institute, no?

asr-012108
09:42:40.060 --> 09:42:45.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And, um, uh, the update here, Mr. President, is that the IRR has been signed and published.

asr-012109
09:42:45.300 --> 09:42:45.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-012110
09:42:46.000 --> 09:42:46.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Uh, published.

asr-012111
09:42:46.800 --> 09:42:47.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, so.

asr-012112
09:42:47.340 --> 09:42:48.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The board is composed.

asr-012113
09:42:49.260 --> 09:42:54.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And that there is now a transition team, uh, to establish its, um, implementation.

asr-012114
09:42:57.240 --> 09:42:59.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sige, we, we're not aware of, of the publication.

asr-012115
09:43:00.160 --> 09:43:00.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, can we see na lang?

asr-012116
09:43:01.080 --> 09:43:01.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi.

asr-012117
09:43:01.420 --> 09:43:03.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Um, it was published, uh, April.

asr-012118
09:43:03.840 --> 09:43:08.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the IRR was signed April 28, 2026 and published May 19.

asr-012119
09:43:10.120 --> 09:43:11.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, no, no, sorry.

asr-012120
09:43:11.500 --> 09:43:13.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The IRR was signed April 28, 2026.

asr-012121
09:43:13.920 --> 09:43:15.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The law was published in 2025.

asr-012122
09:43:16.320 --> 09:43:17.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But the IRR?

asr-012123
09:43:17.380 --> 09:43:18.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It, uh.

asr-012124
09:43:19.260 --> 09:43:20.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: May 19.

asr-012125
09:43:20.920 --> 09:43:21.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, sorry.

asr-012126
09:43:21.560 --> 09:43:23.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It, uh, the IRR was signed.

asr-012127
09:43:24.960 --> 09:43:25.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No.

asr-012128
09:43:25.720 --> 09:43:26.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sorry.

asr-012136
09:43:34.360 --> 09:43:34.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sorry.

asr-012137
09:43:34.560 --> 09:43:35.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There's a typo.

asr-012138
09:43:35.600 --> 09:43:37.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May typo po yung kanilang kodigo dito.

asr-012139
09:43:37.960 --> 09:43:43.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the IRR was signed on April 28, 2026 and published on May 19, 2026.

asr-012140
09:43:44.520 --> 09:43:46.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we can provide a copy today.

asr-012141
09:43:46.360 --> 09:43:46.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We can just get a copy.

asr-012142
09:43:46.680 --> 09:43:47.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you so much.

asr-012143
09:43:47.380 --> 09:43:47.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's all.

asr-012144
09:43:47.800 --> 09:43:48.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's all I have.

asr-012145
09:43:48.440 --> 09:43:48.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-012146
09:43:48.980 --> 09:43:49.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you.

asr-012147
09:43:49.300 --> 09:43:49.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-012148
09:43:49.940 --> 09:43:52.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we will be providing you a copy of the IRR.

asr-012149
09:43:52.300 --> 09:43:52.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-012150
09:43:52.960 --> 09:43:54.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Please, uh, submit na lang.

asr-012151
09:43:55.760 --> 09:44:00.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Um, may we recognize Senator Marcos for her interjection?

asr-012152
09:44:01.720 --> 09:44:04.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, uh, the majority floor leader is pointing.

asr-012153
09:44:05.040 --> 09:44:06.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, go ahead, Senator Marcos.

asr-012154
09:44:07.440 --> 09:44:08.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay, thank you.

asr-012155
09:44:08.440 --> 09:44:15.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Uh, Senator Goh also manifested that he wanted to ask, but, uh, since I'm standing here, let's go.

asr-012156
09:44:15.040 --> 09:44:15.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012157
09:44:16.460 --> 09:44:18.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Um, the, uh.

asr-012158
09:44:19.260 --> 09:44:30.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Probably the only encouraging economic number that came out was, uh, the 26% increase in the export of electronics products.

asr-012159
09:44:30.300 --> 09:44:44.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And following reports of the DOST and the Semiconductor and Electronics Industries of the Philippines are exploring the establishment of a wafer fabrication facility estimated at 10 million U.S. dollars at first.

asr-012160
09:44:45.700 --> 09:44:49.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thereafter, rejected by the DOST.

asr-012161
09:44:49.220 --> 09:44:54.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And now, it is tagged at 30 million dollars.

asr-012162
09:44:55.100 --> 09:44:59.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What is the precise status of the feasibility study and discussion?

asr-012163
09:45:00.000 --> 09:45:07.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I'm totally perplexed by this constant postponement of the wafer fabrication facility

asr-012164
09:45:07.940 --> 09:45:11.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: because it is such a low-lying fruit.

asr-012165
09:45:12.080 --> 09:45:15.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 62% of our exports is in electronics.

asr-012166
09:45:16.500 --> 09:45:19.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At hindi man lamang natin matulungan yung electronics.

asr-012167
09:45:20.220 --> 09:45:26.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Siguro nasa 6 na taon na, na humihingi sila ng wafer fabrication facility.

asr-012168
09:45:26.940 --> 09:45:29.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nag-umpisa sa 10 million US na reject.

asr-012169
09:45:30.420 --> 09:45:36.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya nagtataka ako, kung gusto natin mag-improve yung trade imbalance,

asr-012170
09:45:36.620 --> 09:45:44.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang unang tutulungan natin itong electronics at naunahan na rin tayo ng Japan, ng Malaysia at ng Thailand.

asr-012171
09:45:45.680 --> 09:45:49.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala ba tayong balak gawan na ng paraan ito?

asr-012172
09:45:49.940 --> 09:45:53.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 30 million dollars is not the biggest amount in our budget

asr-012173
09:45:53.080 --> 09:45:56.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and certainly, given the performance,

asr-012174
09:45:56.940 --> 09:45:59.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of the electronics industry, they deserve our support.

asr-012175
09:45:59.920 --> 09:46:02.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, Mr. President, I got an update from the Secretary

asr-012176
09:46:02.520 --> 09:46:07.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that US Trade is undergoing the feasibility study.

asr-012177
09:46:08.220 --> 09:46:08.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: With?

asr-012178
09:46:10.000 --> 09:46:10.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Naku po!

asr-012179
09:46:11.740 --> 09:46:12.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: USTDA.

asr-012180
09:46:12.620 --> 09:46:16.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So USTDA is doing the feasibility study

asr-012181
09:46:16.240 --> 09:46:20.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and pending the output of that study,

asr-012182
09:46:20.480 --> 09:46:22.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we will know if it will push through or not.

asr-012183
09:46:22.700 --> 09:46:24.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Whether this project will push through or not.

asr-012184
09:46:24.440 --> 09:46:26.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is there a time frame involved?

asr-012185
09:46:26.420 --> 09:46:26.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Given that...

asr-012186
09:46:27.800 --> 09:46:30.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We are in intense competition

asr-012187
09:46:30.400 --> 09:46:32.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and we've already lost our rivals.

asr-012188
09:46:33.800 --> 09:46:34.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang tagal na nito eh.

asr-012189
09:46:35.600 --> 09:46:37.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We've been at the assembly level,

asr-012190
09:46:38.240 --> 09:46:40.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: assembly and kitting level since the 1970s.

asr-012191
09:46:41.260 --> 09:46:43.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi na tayo nag-move on sa electronics industry.

asr-012192
09:46:44.360 --> 09:46:50.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil ang ating pamahalaan ay hindi nag-i-invest dito nga sa higher level.

asr-012193
09:46:50.900 --> 09:46:52.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mag-level up tayo.

asr-012194
09:46:52.240 --> 09:46:56.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, I've been informed that the feasibility study,

asr-012195
09:46:56.940 --> 09:46:59.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: will be finished by next year.

asr-012196
09:46:59.640 --> 09:47:01.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, it is only next year that we will find out

asr-012197
09:47:01.940 --> 09:47:03.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: whether this project will push through or not.

asr-012198
09:47:03.960 --> 09:47:07.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nalulungkot nga ako kasi hindi ko nakikita sa ating budget.

asr-012199
09:47:10.000 --> 09:47:12.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What's the government's financial commitment?

asr-012200
09:47:12.380 --> 09:47:15.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is this going to be charged against the GIA, the Grants in Aid?

asr-012201
09:47:16.160 --> 09:47:16.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-012202
09:47:17.020 --> 09:47:23.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And have we begun to identify potential industrial partners and off-takers

asr-012203
09:47:23.260 --> 09:47:26.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to guarantee the long term?

asr-012204
09:47:26.940 --> 09:47:30.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And what's the viability of this entire project?

asr-012205
09:47:31.540 --> 09:47:33.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Marami kasing bibili niyan, di ba?

asr-012206
09:47:33.220 --> 09:47:35.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Patok na patok ang AI, data centers.

asr-012207
09:47:35.940 --> 09:47:37.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The demand is burgeoning.

asr-012208
09:47:38.300 --> 09:47:41.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And it's really a very, very easy sell.

asr-012209
09:47:43.320 --> 09:47:47.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the research itself, the proponent is an academic institution.

asr-012210
09:47:48.800 --> 09:47:52.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We will know the output of that next year.

asr-012211
09:47:52.300 --> 09:47:56.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then, next year, we will determine whether we will push through or not.

asr-012212
09:47:57.460 --> 09:47:59.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sana maituloy na yan. Napakatagal na yan eh.

asr-012213
09:48:01.540 --> 09:48:04.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the funding, sorry, just to complete,

asr-012214
09:48:04.180 --> 09:48:06.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the funding for the project will be in the Grants in Aid.

asr-012215
09:48:07.320 --> 09:48:07.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the?

asr-012216
09:48:08.380 --> 09:48:09.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the GIA.

asr-012217
09:48:09.920 --> 09:48:10.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: GIA.

asr-012218
09:48:10.480 --> 09:48:15.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the process, Mr. President, is that feasibility studies are ongoing.

asr-012219
09:48:15.340 --> 09:48:16.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They'll finish the feasibility study.

asr-012220
09:48:17.100 --> 09:48:18.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Go or no go based on the feasibility study.

asr-012221
09:48:19.100 --> 09:48:21.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If it's a go, it will be charged to the GIA.

asr-012222
09:48:21.080 --> 09:48:26.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: In terms of marketing, has any firms already committed to using the lab?

asr-012223
09:48:26.740 --> 09:48:26.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Or should they?

asr-012224
09:48:26.940 --> 09:48:27.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Or sharing its cost?

asr-012225
09:48:27.960 --> 09:48:28.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, no, Mr. President.

asr-012226
09:48:29.320 --> 09:48:30.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, I'm a little bit...

asr-012227
09:48:30.160 --> 09:48:32.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They're at an earlier stage, which is the feasibility study.

asr-012228
09:48:32.360 --> 09:48:38.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, but having said that, even in the most important part of the feasibility study is the marketing, certainly.

asr-012229
09:48:40.660 --> 09:48:44.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sayang lang yung FS kung wala pa kayong mga partners.

asr-012230
09:48:45.020 --> 09:48:51.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi alam na alam natin sa mga electronics company, marami dyan are willing to share the cost of putting up the lab.

asr-012231
09:48:51.820 --> 09:48:52.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The company is willing to partner...

asr-012233
09:48:56.940 --> 09:48:59.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: SEIPI is willing to partner on this project.

asr-012234
09:48:59.640 --> 09:48:59.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's correct.

asr-012235
09:49:00.040 --> 09:49:08.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And many of the factories that belong to the Saipi Association are perfectly happy to share cost and guarantee X amount of export.

asr-012236
09:49:09.320 --> 09:49:14.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, sana magawa ng paraan niyan na bilisan kasi ang tagal-tagal na ninihingi niyan sa totoo lang.

asr-012237
09:49:15.040 --> 09:49:15.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakakatawa na.

asr-012238
09:49:16.160 --> 09:49:20.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The Philippines slipped from 50 to 52.

asr-012239
09:49:21.120 --> 09:49:24.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bumagsak pa sa 2026 Global Innovation Index.

asr-012240
09:49:24.620 --> 09:49:26.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the DST has acknowledged

asr-012241
09:49:26.940 --> 09:49:33.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: weaknesses in R&amp;D, the number of STEM students, and the country's researcher base.

asr-012242
09:49:34.420 --> 09:49:41.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What concrete interventions are very clear in your 2027 budget?

asr-012243
09:49:41.640 --> 09:49:46.280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi parang business as usual lang, samantalang tayo'y nahuhuli.

asr-012244
09:49:46.600 --> 09:49:51.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We are lagging behind, and yet the budget looks like business as usual.

asr-012246
09:49:56.940 --> 09:50:01.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, in terms...

asr-012247
09:50:01.080 --> 09:50:03.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And this is from the Secretary, Mr. President.

asr-012248
09:50:03.720 --> 09:50:13.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In terms of the input, admittedly it is low, but they're committed to really increase the output based on the innovations that the agency is doing.

asr-012249
09:50:13.800 --> 09:50:23.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, it may seem low, and it is low in many respects, but they commit that the output will be worth the decrease that we had,

asr-012250
09:50:23.420 --> 09:50:26.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and to arrest any decrease that we've had in the world rankings.

asr-012251
09:50:26.480 --> 09:50:26.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-012252
09:50:26.940 --> 09:50:28.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Because it's quite alarming.

asr-012253
09:50:28.720 --> 09:50:32.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Lahat ng Southeast Asia halos umaakyat dun sa global innovation.

asr-012254
09:50:33.460 --> 09:50:34.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tayo, pababa.

asr-012255
09:50:34.640 --> 09:50:35.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakaka-nervous yun.

asr-012256
09:50:35.600 --> 09:50:42.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kahit sabihin natin na two places lang yan, yung tangent na pabagsak, e hindi maganda.

asr-012257
09:50:42.800 --> 09:50:53.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Have we set some targets in terms of number of patent applications, number of technology exports, private sector investment?

asr-012258
09:50:54.500 --> 09:50:56.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: May targets na ba tayo for research exports?

asr-012259
09:50:56.940 --> 09:50:57.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Or expenditure?

asr-012260
09:50:57.920 --> 09:51:00.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi parang pareho lang nun, nakalipas.

asr-012261
09:51:01.900 --> 09:51:04.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, I've been informed.

asr-012262
09:51:05.580 --> 09:51:08.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the ranking is composed of different indicators.

asr-012263
09:51:09.400 --> 09:51:09.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Right.

asr-012264
09:51:10.080 --> 09:51:13.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For most indicators, we're actually improving, or we have improved.

asr-012265
09:51:13.320 --> 09:51:19.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The one where we fail is really the budget input, which is exactly what we're talking about right now.

asr-012266
09:51:19.880 --> 09:51:23.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, yung pagbaba po natin ng two ranks is because we're under-investing.

asr-012267
09:51:24.320 --> 09:51:26.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the others have increased their investment.

asr-012268
09:51:26.940 --> 09:51:31.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But in terms of the other indicators, we're actually doing better or improving.

asr-012269
09:51:32.000 --> 09:51:34.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we can give you the breakdown, Mr. President.

asr-012270
09:51:34.480 --> 09:51:43.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: But that's called comfort in this very aggressive push towards technology, AI, robotics, data centers, and so on.

asr-012271
09:51:43.480 --> 09:51:53.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, I think we need to take a hard look at that and devote more to R&amp;D, given that we're clearly falling behind.

asr-012272
09:51:53.580 --> 09:51:56.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Also, there's been some strange...

asr-012273
09:51:56.940 --> 09:52:10.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: There's some strange news coming out of the DOSD, and I refer to the possible rocket launch in April 2027, and the space station in Cagayan.

asr-012274
09:52:12.140 --> 09:52:13.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What's going on?

asr-012275
09:52:15.760 --> 09:52:19.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, we'll be tackling the Philippine Space Agency separately.

asr-012276
09:52:19.880 --> 09:52:22.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But, yeah, it will be taken separately.

asr-012277
09:52:22.880 --> 09:52:23.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tonight?

asr-012278
09:52:23.940 --> 09:52:24.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tonight also.

asr-012279
09:52:25.640 --> 09:52:26.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And...

asr-012280
09:52:26.160 --> 09:52:26.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Oh, okay.

asr-012281
09:52:26.940 --> 09:52:28.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I stand up again for the space agency.

asr-012282
09:52:28.880 --> 09:52:29.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that correct?

asr-012283
09:52:30.540 --> 09:52:31.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-012284
09:52:32.480 --> 09:52:33.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-012285
09:52:33.120 --> 09:52:35.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because it's a separate agency, not under DOSD.

asr-012286
09:52:35.820 --> 09:52:36.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Oh, okay.

asr-012287
09:52:36.700 --> 09:52:37.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: All right.

asr-012288
09:52:37.140 --> 09:52:38.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, it's not under you.

asr-012289
09:52:38.520 --> 09:52:46.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Because they also refer to the space agency as part of the DOSD talk.

asr-012290
09:52:46.200 --> 09:52:48.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, it's under other executive offices.

asr-012291
09:52:48.900 --> 09:52:50.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's not an attached agency.

asr-012292
09:52:50.080 --> 09:52:50.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Under the OP.

asr-012293
09:52:50.980 --> 09:52:52.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's under the OP, Mr. President.

asr-012294
09:52:52.840 --> 09:52:54.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, if that is the...

asr-012295
09:52:54.700 --> 09:52:55.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's OP, then.

asr-012296
09:52:55.860 --> 09:52:56.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Philippine Space Agency.

asr-012297
09:52:56.940 --> 09:53:04.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And you are also not privy to the talks with SpaceX and the one or two islands to be taken

asr-012298
09:53:04.460 --> 09:53:05.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: over by Elon Musk.

asr-012299
09:53:05.860 --> 09:53:07.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, Mr. President.

asr-012300
09:53:07.320 --> 09:53:08.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This is not the proper agency.

asr-012301
09:53:09.180 --> 09:53:11.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the Philippine Space Agency is on deck also tonight.

asr-012302
09:53:12.840 --> 09:53:13.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-012303
09:53:13.380 --> 09:53:14.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, that's later pa.

asr-012304
09:53:15.880 --> 09:53:16.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012305
09:53:16.940 --> 09:53:17.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And you...

asr-012306
09:53:18.640 --> 09:53:20.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We can schedule them right after DTI.

asr-012307
09:53:21.120 --> 09:53:21.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I see.

asr-012308
09:53:21.500 --> 09:53:26.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And how many more students can DOSD support with the additional 10 million for scholarships?

asr-012309
09:53:26.940 --> 09:53:32.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The Senate Committee report adds 5 million each for graduate and undergraduate science and technology.

asr-012310
09:53:32.820 --> 09:53:38.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How many additional scholars can SEI support at each level?

asr-012311
09:53:38.220 --> 09:53:40.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Another additional 4,000 students.

asr-012312
09:53:40.780 --> 09:53:41.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012313
09:53:41.600 --> 09:53:44.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At which level?

asr-012314
09:53:44.180 --> 09:53:44.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Which fields?

asr-012315
09:53:45.460 --> 09:53:49.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And when will the students receive their stipends?

asr-012316
09:53:49.380 --> 09:53:50.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Because many are waiting.

asr-012317
09:53:51.240 --> 09:53:51.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-012318
09:53:51.460 --> 09:53:53.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Undergraduate level, Mr. President.

asr-012319
09:53:54.200 --> 09:53:56.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And what quarter?

asr-012320
09:53:56.040 --> 09:53:57.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What fields?

asr-012321
09:53:57.420 --> 09:53:58.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Right away.

asr-012322
09:53:58.320 --> 09:54:01.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, as soon as they have the money, they will distribute right away.

asr-012323
09:54:02.520 --> 09:54:05.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And these are 4,000 undergraduate students, Mr. President.

asr-012324
09:54:05.580 --> 09:54:05.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012325
09:54:05.820 --> 09:54:12.280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What fields specifically since it fell under the generic heading of STEM and SEI?

asr-012326
09:54:12.340 --> 09:54:22.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Biology, education, science education, physics, natural science, and pure and applied sciences.

asr-012327
09:54:23.540 --> 09:54:23.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012328
09:54:23.820 --> 09:54:23.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012329
09:54:24.060 --> 09:54:26.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, perhaps you can provide us with a list.

asr-012330
09:54:26.040 --> 09:54:27.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: A listing of those.

asr-012331
09:54:28.800 --> 09:54:31.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The last time I saw Secretary, nasa ABRA po tayo.

asr-012332
09:54:31.980 --> 09:54:36.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos, ginagarantian ninyo na matapos yung earthquake, wala nang aftershock.

asr-012333
09:54:36.580 --> 09:54:41.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa awa ng DOSD, umabot ng anim na buwan, naninginig pa rin kami.

asr-012334
09:54:41.860 --> 09:54:42.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-012335
09:54:43.580 --> 09:54:46.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ganun pa man, I think I'll wait for the Space Agency then.

asr-012336
09:54:46.980 --> 09:54:47.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-012337
09:54:47.400 --> 09:54:47.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you.

asr-012338
09:54:47.760 --> 09:54:53.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: For the explanation on all sorts of news we're deriving from them.

asr-012339
09:54:53.460 --> 09:54:55.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

asr-012340
09:54:56.040 --> 09:55:00.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

asr-012341
09:55:00.420 --> 09:55:07.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: May we recognize last but not the least, our distinguished, ah, okay, second to the last, Senator Christopher Bongo.

asr-012342
09:55:07.880 --> 09:55:09.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat, Mr. President.

asr-012343
09:55:09.980 --> 09:55:17.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: As promised to our good sponsor, Senator Baum, ano lang ito, friendly questions lang po ito.

asr-012344
09:55:17.920 --> 09:55:22.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa lang at supporta naman tayo para makauwi na rin po tayo ngayong gabi, no.

asr-012345
09:55:22.240 --> 09:55:26.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, bilang principal author po ng Republic Act,

asr-012346
09:55:26.040 --> 09:55:32.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 12290, ito po yung Virology and Vaccine Institute of the Philippines Act.

asr-012347
09:55:33.040 --> 09:55:38.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I note that for the implementation of the programs, projects, and activities of Virology Institute,

asr-012348
09:55:38.860 --> 09:55:44.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 971 million was provided in fiscal years 2023 to 2025,

asr-012349
09:55:45.100 --> 09:55:55.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: while a total of 450 million was also provided for the establishment of the infrastructure of VIP from 2021 to 2023.

asr-012350
09:55:55.080 --> 09:55:56.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At alam natin,

asr-012351
09:55:56.020 --> 09:55:58.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At alam nyo naman po, lessons learned tayo sa pandemia.

asr-012352
09:55:58.540 --> 09:56:07.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi natin akalain na tatamaan tayo ng pandemia at hirap na hirap tayo nung 18th Congress dito sa pag-iisip ng mga tulong sa mga kababayan natin.

asr-012353
09:56:09.400 --> 09:56:21.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yun, in fact, masaya tayo no na finally, after four years na bayaran po yung health emergency allowances ng mga health workers natin,

asr-012354
09:56:21.680 --> 09:56:25.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na ipinasarin natin ang batas dito, dahil services rendered po nila yun.

asr-012355
09:56:26.020 --> 09:56:26.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Naghirapan nila.

asr-012356
09:56:26.860 --> 09:56:31.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Finally, 2025, after five years, marami tayong natutunan sa pandemia.

asr-012357
09:56:32.400 --> 09:56:41.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At napakahalaga po nitong Virology Institute, Virology and Vaccine Institute of the Philippines Act.

asr-012358
09:56:42.700 --> 09:56:46.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May we know the status of the VIP building and infrastructure?

asr-012359
09:56:47.300 --> 09:56:52.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: What are the projects implemented related, relative to the allocated budget?

asr-012360
09:56:52.680 --> 09:56:55.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May budget po ba sa susunod na taon tungkol dito?

asr-012361
09:56:56.020 --> 09:57:03.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, wala pong budget for, in the 2025 budget or the 2026 budget, was this granted?

asr-012362
09:57:04.300 --> 09:57:05.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I mean, 2027.

asr-012363
09:57:05.120 --> 09:57:11.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There was a proposed budget of 680 million for 2027, but also not granted, Mr. President.

asr-012364
09:57:14.340 --> 09:57:14.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bakit?

asr-012365
09:57:14.960 --> 09:57:19.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since batas na po ito, hindi na aprobahan sa NEP?

asr-012366
09:57:19.340 --> 09:57:19.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No.

asr-012367
09:57:19.540 --> 09:57:24.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, anong plano ng DOST dito?

asr-012368
09:57:26.020 --> 09:57:26.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Batas na po ito eh.

asr-012369
09:57:27.100 --> 09:57:30.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Humihingi po sa inyo, Mr. President, yun po yung plano po nila.

asr-012370
09:57:30.620 --> 09:57:32.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Humihingi po ng tulong po sa ating lahat.

asr-012371
09:57:32.760 --> 09:57:35.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But in the NEP, it was not granted, Mr. President.

asr-012372
09:57:35.420 --> 09:57:37.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, three years na po siyang not granted.

asr-012373
09:57:38.440 --> 09:57:41.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po matulungan ito. Lessons learned tayo dito.

asr-012374
09:57:41.960 --> 09:57:47.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Huwag naman yung mag-antay pa tayo na meron pong mangyari bago tayo magkandarapa.

asr-012375
09:57:47.660 --> 09:57:52.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam niyo po, gusto ko lang i-share sa inyo, Mr. Sponsor, Mr. President.

asr-012376
09:57:53.080 --> 09:57:55.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Noong 2019,

asr-012377
09:57:56.020 --> 09:58:00.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ako po ang sponsor ng Committee on Health dito.

asr-012378
09:58:00.960 --> 09:58:06.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yung RITM.

asr-012379
09:58:07.100 --> 09:58:10.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: During the budget deliberation dito,

asr-012380
09:58:11.100 --> 09:58:16.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: from NEP, binawasan ng ilang milyon.

asr-012381
09:58:17.180 --> 09:58:21.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At who would expect na magkakaroon ng pandemia?

asr-012382
09:58:21.520 --> 09:58:25.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung deliberation dito, that was October, ganito rin po, November.

asr-012383
09:58:26.020 --> 09:58:34.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi natin akalain na ang RITM pa ang magiging pinaka-importanting hospital noon.

asr-012384
09:58:34.240 --> 09:58:36.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil sila lang po ang makakapag-test.

asr-012385
09:58:37.220 --> 09:58:45.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Diba na pinapadala pa nila sa Australia noon yung PCR test na kinakandak dito.

asr-012386
09:58:46.120 --> 09:58:51.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, ibig po sabihin dito, since may batas na tayo, may Virology and Vaccine Institute of the Philippines Act na tayo,

asr-012387
09:58:52.100 --> 09:58:55.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ba't hindi na po ito bigyan ng prioridad at mapondohan?

asr-012388
09:58:56.020 --> 09:58:58.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Antayin po ba natin na may mangyaring pandemia?

asr-012389
09:58:58.220 --> 09:59:00.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lessons learned na po sa atin yung pandemia.

asr-012390
09:59:01.520 --> 09:59:03.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Including nga yung RITM.

asr-012391
09:59:03.200 --> 09:59:05.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kwento ko na lang po sa inyo, tinanggalan nila ng budget.

asr-012392
09:59:06.120 --> 09:59:08.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ni-restore po natin sa Committee on Health.

asr-012393
09:59:08.320 --> 09:59:09.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dinagdagan pa natin.

asr-012394
09:59:09.900 --> 09:59:12.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: That was November of 2019.

asr-012395
09:59:12.680 --> 09:59:16.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And who would expect March 7 of 2020,

asr-012396
09:59:17.020 --> 09:59:23.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nagkaroon po tayo ng State of Health Emergency?

asr-012397
09:59:24.220 --> 09:59:25.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, the Secretary,

asr-012398
09:59:26.020 --> 09:59:30.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is clarifying that yung infra, yung wala akong pondo.

asr-012399
09:59:30.180 --> 09:59:34.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the programs are funded under grant in aid.

asr-012400
09:59:34.400 --> 09:59:37.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, may 205 million pesos for 2026,

asr-012401
09:59:37.580 --> 09:59:43.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and may 65 million plus for 2027.

asr-012402
09:59:43.800 --> 09:59:48.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, these are 112 projects at 1.8 billion over the past 6 years.

asr-012403
09:59:49.360 --> 09:59:52.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But correct po kayo, Mr. President, yung infra,

asr-012404
09:59:52.320 --> 09:59:55.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: na they're hoping mabuo rin, ay hindi po napopondohan.

asr-012405
09:59:55.520 --> 09:59:59.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po, Mr. Secretary, I'm addressing it to you.

asr-012406
09:59:59.000 --> 10:00:00.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: During...

asr-012407
10:00:00.000 --> 10:00:01.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: budget, I'm sure

asr-012408
10:00:01.800 --> 10:00:03.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nag-uusap naman kayo with your

asr-012409
10:00:03.840 --> 10:00:04.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: fellow

asr-012410
10:00:04.300 --> 10:00:07.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: cabinet secretaries,

asr-012411
10:00:07.720 --> 10:00:10.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nag-uusap naman kayo with your finance managers.

asr-012412
10:00:10.140 --> 10:00:12.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana mabigyan po ito ng importansya.

asr-012413
10:00:12.500 --> 10:00:13.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kumbaga sa

asr-012414
10:00:13.180 --> 10:00:15.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pie ng cake sa

asr-012415
10:00:15.660 --> 10:00:17.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: budget ng Pilipinas, wala pang icing

asr-012416
10:00:17.880 --> 10:00:18.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ito eh.

asr-012417
10:00:19.980 --> 10:00:21.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kesa naman nasasayang sa

asr-012418
10:00:21.680 --> 10:00:23.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: corruption, sa flood control,

asr-012419
10:00:23.860 --> 10:00:25.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sana ginamit na lang dyan sa mga infrastructure.

