Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it is ongoing already.

asr-013511
10:50:10.440 --> 10:50:11.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ginagawa na po siya.

asr-013512
10:50:11.620 --> 10:50:15.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And right now, hinahanap po nila yung total sales ng halal products

asr-013513
10:50:15.360 --> 10:50:18.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because of this initiative way back in 2025.

asr-013514
10:50:19.880 --> 10:50:24.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, certified na po over 200 MSMEs sa halal.

asr-013515
10:50:24.240 --> 10:50:26.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Halal certified po over 200 MSMEs.

asr-013516
10:50:26.360 --> 10:50:28.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And that's thanks to one of your initiatives.

asr-013517
10:50:28.960 --> 10:50:29.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-013518
10:50:30.840 --> 10:50:37.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And tuloy-tuloy po yung kanilang pag-promote

asr-013519
10:50:37.580 --> 10:50:41.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: at pag-certify ng mga negosyo na halal po yung mga products po nila.

asr-013520
10:50:44.400 --> 10:50:50.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Meron rin pong pag-update sa Philippine Halal Industry Development Plan.

asr-013521
10:50:51.000 --> 10:50:52.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There's a midterm review next year.

asr-013522
10:50:54.420 --> 10:50:56.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There's a midterm review next year.

asr-013523
10:50:56.280 --> 10:50:58.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The plan is 2024 to 2028.

asr-013524
10:50:58.580 --> 10:51:04.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, magkakaroon po ng midterm review dun sa plano para sa halal industry.

asr-013525
