Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kailan po kaya yan?

asr-013527
10:51:06.980 --> 10:51:08.260
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Para maimbitahan po ako.

asr-013528
10:51:08.600 --> 10:51:09.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, yes.

