asr-013533
10:51:30.660 --> 10:51:34.620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ayun, so may pondo po ngayong taon na to para sa halal industry?

asr-013534
10:51:34.720 --> 10:51:37.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, 81 million ang pondo, Mr. President.

asr-013535
10:51:38.140 --> 10:51:38.400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Apo.

asr-013536
10:51:39.100 --> 10:51:42.220
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang sunod ko pong, bibilisan ko na lang po ah, kasi ano,

asr-013537
