11:05:37.140 --> 11:05:42.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Is China the gold standard for healthcare when it comes to their...

asr-013758
11:05:42.300 --> 11:05:42.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Our country?

asr-013759
11:05:43.120 --> 11:05:44.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ...counterpart in the FDA?

asr-013760
11:05:54.460 --> 11:06:03.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, and again, this is according to our friends from DTI, these laboratories test based on the global standard.

asr-013761
11:06:04.040 --> 11:06:08.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, kung ang tanong po ay standard, iisa lang naman daw po yung standard sa mundo.

asr-013762
11:06:09.180 --> 11:06:12.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, if the question is, do these laboratories test it well or not?

asr-013763
11:06:12.400 --> 11:06:13.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I guess.

asr-013764
11:06:13.120 --> 11:06:14.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's a separate question, no?

asr-013765
11:06:15.140 --> 11:06:15.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So...

asr-013766
11:06:15.500 --> 11:06:19.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the standard itself is set as a global standard.

asr-013767
11:06:20.420 --> 11:06:20.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-013768
11:06:20.720 --> 11:06:26.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And China is also the source of contaminated milk products, no?

asr-013769
11:06:26.760 --> 11:06:28.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And not that it doesn't happen all over the world.

asr-013770
11:06:28.820 --> 11:06:30.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ko ako galit sa China, to be clear.

asr-013771
11:06:30.880 --> 11:06:31.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ko ako...

asr-013772
11:06:31.660 --> 11:06:33.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Baka may ibang galit ako, di ko ako galit sa China.

asr-013773
11:06:33.780 --> 11:06:35.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But there are gold standards.

asr-013774
11:06:35.840 --> 11:06:42.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You can ask any FDA official, and they will tell you that the gold standards are...

asr-013775
11:06:42.960 --> 11:06:47.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The US, some of the European countries, Japan...

asr-013776
11:06:47.460 --> 11:06:50.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May I inquire, Mr. President, why these are the laboratories?

asr-013777
11:06:50.640 --> 11:06:51.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you can give me a second.

asr-013778
11:06:51.580 --> 11:06:51.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, please.

asr-013779
11:06:51.880 --> 11:06:52.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Why these are the laboratories?

asr-013780
11:06:56.120 --> 11:07:01.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: These are the only three in the world.

asr-013781
11:07:02.900 --> 11:07:04.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But it is China-based.

asr-013782
11:07:04.100 --> 11:07:12.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the products here are usually tested globally.

asr-013783
11:07:12.960 --> 11:07:20.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, if I may share the history of this.

asr-013784
11:07:21.280 --> 11:07:24.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, initially, we didn't have any testing centers here.

asr-013785
11:07:25.100 --> 11:07:25.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, we did not.

asr-013786
11:07:25.900 --> 11:07:27.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The last update I had, wala.

asr-013787
11:07:27.880 --> 11:07:32.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, what the companies would use is this Shenzhen element testing.

asr-013788
11:07:32.420 --> 11:07:39.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But now that there are two centers here, most of the products are actually tested locally

asr-013789
11:07:39.960 --> 11:07:42.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: in the centers in Cavite and Quezon.

asr-013790
11:07:42.960 --> 11:07:47.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Who is it who's giving us the response, Mr. Chairman?

asr-013791
11:07:48.200 --> 11:07:48.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The position.

asr-013792
11:07:51.340 --> 11:07:58.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This is Asec Valdez, who is the Asec in charge of tobacco?

asr-013793
11:07:59.620 --> 11:08:00.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of vape, in particular.

asr-013794
11:08:01.640 --> 11:08:04.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, he is the Asec in charge of vape, Mr. President.

asr-013795
11:08:04.880 --> 11:08:05.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-013796
11:08:05.260 --> 11:08:07.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How long has he been with DTI and in charge of vapes?

asr-013797
11:08:07.880 --> 11:08:07.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-013798
11:08:07.920 --> 11:08:16.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DTI, 2021, and assigned to vape, 2024.

asr-013799
11:08:17.140 --> 11:08:17.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-013800
11:08:17.500 --> 11:08:22.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya ako lang tinatanong kasi I'm not sure if Secretary was already the Secretary when

asr-013801
11:08:22.180 --> 11:08:23.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I had asked that question.

asr-013802
11:08:23.560 --> 11:08:26.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I already raised this issue of gold standard.

asr-013803
11:08:26.700 --> 11:08:29.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kung gusto talaga ng gold standard, may ibang gold standard.

asr-013804
11:08:29.140 --> 11:08:33.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Uulitin ko, and I'm sure, Secretary, you've heard me say this, that in the FBA,

asr-013805
11:08:37.920 --> 11:08:43.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: before I get that, because I'm having them check the number,

asr-013806
11:08:45.040 --> 11:08:47.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sabi nyo, there are now two testing facilities.

asr-013807
11:08:47.280 --> 11:08:49.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Technically, there's only one, because the two that you mentioned,

asr-013808
11:08:50.000 --> 11:08:53.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: one is on the gadget, not on the liquid.

asr-013809
11:08:53.500 --> 11:08:54.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, isa lang yung sa liquid.

asr-013810
11:08:54.840 --> 11:08:57.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: La Primera Testing Center in Quezon City.

asr-013811
11:08:57.460 --> 11:08:57.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In QC.

asr-013812
11:08:57.960 --> 11:08:58.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Isa lang yung sa liquid.

asr-013813
11:08:58.960 --> 11:09:03.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero sabi nyo naman, this is approved by Tobacco Lab Network

asr-013814
11:09:03.280 --> 11:09:05.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that I have no personal knowledge of.

asr-013815
11:09:05.080 --> 11:09:07.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, accredited or recommended.

asr-013816
11:09:07.920 --> 11:09:08.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: By DOH, right?

asr-013817
11:09:09.280 --> 11:09:10.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I'll take that.

asr-013818
11:09:10.360 --> 11:09:13.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, sure tayo dyan, kasi tatanungin ko sa DOH yan bukas.

asr-013819
11:09:14.540 --> 11:09:15.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O kung kailan man si DOH.

asr-013820
11:09:23.400 --> 11:09:23.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-013821
11:09:27.660 --> 11:09:33.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, during the Blue Ribbon hearing that you led, Senator Pia,

asr-013822
11:09:35.040 --> 11:09:37.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DOH said that we have to follow the TOB.

asr-013823
11:09:37.920 --> 11:09:39.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: TOB LabNet.

asr-013824
11:09:39.940 --> 11:09:41.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: TOB LabNet standard.

asr-013825
11:09:41.960 --> 11:09:42.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-013826
11:09:42.760 --> 11:09:47.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then, from there, the Shenzhen was the first,

asr-013827
11:09:47.600 --> 11:09:50.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and then itong La Primera are accredited by DTI.

asr-013828
11:09:51.200 --> 11:09:54.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, to be clear, it's DTI that accredits these laboratories,

asr-013829
11:09:54.880 --> 11:10:00.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because these are the laboratories that can check based on the TOB LabNet standards.

asr-013830
11:10:00.380 --> 11:10:01.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: To be clear, Mr. President.

asr-013831
11:10:01.740 --> 11:10:01.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-013832
11:10:02.080 --> 11:10:04.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I will just counter-check that with DOH,

asr-013833
11:10:04.820 --> 11:10:06.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but thank you for the explanation.

asr-013834
11:10:06.500 --> 11:10:07.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And as long as we will...

asr-013835
11:10:07.920 --> 11:10:12.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because I have a difficulty holding you accountable for a task

asr-013836
11:10:12.500 --> 11:10:15.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that you have no, absolutely no training on.

asr-013837
11:10:16.220 --> 11:10:16.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-013838
11:10:16.460 --> 11:10:19.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, if I ask you na, ano yung standards na yun, sir,

asr-013839
11:10:19.640 --> 11:10:21.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mr. Valdez, no?

asr-013840
11:10:21.280 --> 11:10:22.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Asek Valdez, tama ba?

asr-013841
11:10:22.340 --> 11:10:22.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Valdez?

asr-013842
11:10:23.040 --> 11:10:23.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-013843
11:10:23.840 --> 11:10:25.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala ka namang science background, o meron naman po?

asr-013844
11:10:27.740 --> 11:10:28.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O, yun na nga, diba?

asr-013845
11:10:28.920 --> 11:10:30.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, normally, when I talk to the FDA,

asr-013846
11:10:30.980 --> 11:10:33.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: doktor yun, or public health expert.

asr-013847
11:10:33.040 --> 11:10:37.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, you understand why, if I had to interrogate you as a witness,

asr-013848
11:10:37.920 --> 11:10:41.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I will have a hard time recognizing you as an expert witness

asr-013849
11:10:41.900 --> 11:10:45.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: when it comes to the safety of e-cigarettes and ano.

asr-013850
11:10:45.620 --> 11:10:46.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You understand, Secretary, no?

asr-013851
11:10:47.420 --> 11:10:48.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We've had this discussion.

asr-013852
11:10:49.020 --> 11:10:50.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you nodding?

asr-013853
11:10:51.440 --> 11:10:51.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-013854
11:10:52.480 --> 11:10:55.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you understand my difficulty in attributing,

asr-013855
11:10:57.360 --> 11:10:59.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: accepting that may expertise ang DTI?

asr-013856
11:11:01.840 --> 11:11:04.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In terms of testing, they are not experts, Mr. President.

asr-013857
11:11:04.700 --> 11:11:05.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya nga eh.

asr-013858
11:11:05.640 --> 11:11:06.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya nga eh.

asr-013859
11:11:06.260 --> 11:11:07.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, the waste of time,

asr-013860
11:11:07.680 --> 11:11:12.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I have to go through because I have to call DOH and FDI to make sure

asr-013861
11:11:12.180 --> 11:11:13.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because how can you account for it?

asr-013862
11:11:13.960 --> 11:11:14.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You don't have the means.

asr-013863
11:11:15.180 --> 11:11:16.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You don't have the expertise.

asr-013864
11:11:17.680 --> 11:11:19.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Even the chairman agrees with me.

asr-013865
11:11:19.160 --> 11:11:20.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Is that correct, Mr. Chairman?

asr-013866
11:11:20.700 --> 11:11:21.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun lang.

asr-013867
11:11:21.360 --> 11:11:27.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, no judgment on anything else except your lack of expertise in this area.

asr-013868
11:11:28.520 --> 11:11:31.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If I tell you na when you go to that facility, what are you looking for?

asr-013869
11:11:31.320 --> 11:11:32.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you know what to look for, Mr. Valdez?

asr-013870
11:11:33.860 --> 11:11:35.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What kind of equipment you're looking for?

asr-013871
11:11:35.760 --> 11:11:37.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How to know if that equipment,

asr-013872
11:11:37.680 --> 11:11:37.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that is,

asr-013873
11:11:38.380 --> 11:11:39.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: can really do,

asr-013874
11:11:39.540 --> 11:11:40.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: can really...

asr-013875
11:11:40.480 --> 11:11:41.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President,

asr-013876
11:11:41.500 --> 11:11:43.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa TOB LabNet standard,

asr-013877
11:11:43.360 --> 11:11:48.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: meron pong list of tests and machines that they counter-check with these centers.

asr-013878
11:11:48.760 --> 11:11:49.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's why they're accredited.

asr-013879
11:11:50.240 --> 11:11:50.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Correct.

asr-013880
11:11:50.700 --> 11:11:53.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's the same way that you and I, Mr. Chairman, will do that.

asr-013881
11:11:53.360 --> 11:11:54.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Babasahin lang natin.

asr-013882
11:11:54.500 --> 11:11:54.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-013883
11:11:54.740 --> 11:11:55.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun na nga.

asr-013884
11:11:55.200 --> 11:11:56.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, wala tayong expertise.

asr-013885
11:11:56.720 --> 11:11:57.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Aminin na natin.

asr-013886
11:11:57.880 --> 11:12:03.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't know how hard it is to elicit that admission.

asr-013887
11:12:04.980 --> 11:12:05.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you have the expertise?

asr-013888
11:12:05.800 --> 11:12:06.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you health experts?

asr-013889
11:12:06.780 --> 11:12:09.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They're not health experts, Mr. President.

asr-013890
11:12:09.680 --> 11:12:12.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But they seem to have a hard time accepting that.

asr-013891
11:12:12.620 --> 11:12:16.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For you, Mr. Chairman, without batting an eye, you say it.

asr-013892
11:12:16.140 --> 11:12:17.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But sila, I don't know.

asr-013893
11:12:17.620 --> 11:12:20.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, if I may add to this discussion,

asr-013894
11:12:20.800 --> 11:12:22.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: although I'm not sure if I should,

asr-013895
11:12:22.660 --> 11:12:26.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: but I think what we need to clarify talaga is

asr-013896
11:12:26.920 --> 11:12:31.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: they're treating vape like any other product, I think.

asr-013897
11:12:32.140 --> 11:12:34.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the way that you see it, and I agree with you,

asr-013898
11:12:34.440 --> 11:12:36.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is that there are health implications to this product.

asr-013899
11:12:36.780 --> 11:12:37.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Exactly.

asr-013900
11:12:37.460 --> 11:12:39.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, that's it, eh.

asr-013901
11:12:39.500 --> 11:12:40.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kaya tayo nag-iingat, diba?

asr-013902
11:12:40.640 --> 11:12:41.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya tayo nag-iingat.

asr-013903
11:12:41.380 --> 11:12:42.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And kayo din naman po yung…

asr-013904
11:12:42.920 --> 11:12:43.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And it's not unfounded.

asr-013905
11:12:43.900 --> 11:12:47.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There are reports all over the world of, honestly, youth

asr-013906
11:12:47.760 --> 11:12:49.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that are having problems with vape.

asr-013907
11:12:50.600 --> 11:12:53.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And ano yan, Mr. President?

asr-013908
11:12:54.200 --> 11:12:56.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kunyari, kasi kung gamot yan, FDA yan.

asr-013909
11:12:57.360 --> 11:12:57.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Diba?

asr-013910
11:12:58.060 --> 11:13:00.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung pagkain yan, FDA yan.

asr-013911
11:13:01.180 --> 11:13:01.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Right?

asr-013912
11:13:01.540 --> 11:13:02.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi Food and Drug Administration.

asr-013913
11:13:03.580 --> 11:13:06.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kapag mga gadgets yan, DTI yan.

asr-013914
11:13:06.780 --> 11:13:08.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the question really is…

asr-013915
11:13:08.560 --> 11:13:10.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Before you proceed, Mr. President,

asr-013916
11:13:10.560 --> 11:13:11.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'll add to your examples.

asr-013917
11:13:12.040 --> 11:13:13.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung pinapahid sa muka, FDA.

asr-013918
11:13:14.280 --> 11:13:16.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung pinapahid sa kamay, FDA.

asr-013919
11:13:16.260 --> 11:13:18.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung pinapahid sa paa, FDA.

asr-013920
11:13:18.920 --> 11:13:21.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung hindi man lang pinapahid, yung pabangong ganyan, FDA.

asr-013921
11:13:21.940 --> 11:13:23.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, paano nilalaklak na…

asr-013922
11:13:23.720 --> 11:13:24.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Exactly.

asr-013923
11:13:24.180 --> 11:13:26.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you ingest it, it should be with FDA

asr-013924
11:13:26.400 --> 11:13:30.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and not just, you know, other…

asr-013925
