Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And you are probably smuggled.

asr-014100
11:21:33.900 --> 11:21:35.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, are they closing them down?

asr-014101
11:21:35.360 --> 11:21:36.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What are your operations?

asr-014102
11:21:36.940 --> 11:21:38.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you closing down the shops?

asr-014103-split-2
11:21:50.853 --> 11:21:54.548
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ah, kayo mismo magpapasara or papasara niyo sa pulis?

asr-014103-split-3
11:21:54.548 --> 11:21:56.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, yes, they have.

asr-014104
11:21:56.100 --> 11:22:00.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They have the power to close down, yes, they have the power to close down the shops.

asr-014105
11:22:00.600 --> 11:22:09.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And there are already a number where they've filed a notice of, notice of violation and formal charges as well, Mr. President.

asr-014106
11:22:09.740 --> 11:22:10.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah, okay.

asr-014107
11:22:10.300 --> 11:22:11.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I think we should, we can do more, no?

asr-014108
11:22:11.760 --> 11:22:18.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imagine 39, Secretary, 39% aged 10 to 19 are into vapes.

asr-014109
11:22:18.700 --> 11:22:20.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And there's no proven health benefit here.

asr-014110
11:22:21.340 --> 11:22:24.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I'll end with this.

asr-014111
11:22:24.160 --> 11:22:25.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: This is exactly.

asr-014112
11:22:26.100 --> 11:22:30.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The basis for the U.S. FDA rejection of the 1 million flavors.

asr-014113
11:22:31.600 --> 11:22:42.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: They failed to prove that the flavors helped adult smokers quit enough to outweigh the high risk of attracting the youth.

asr-014114
11:22:43.160 --> 11:22:43.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Galing, ano?

asr-014115
11:22:44.120 --> 11:22:47.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If a company fails to prove na itong flavor na to,

asr-014116
11:22:47.480 --> 11:22:51.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: e nakakatulong sobra-sobra-sobra sa mga matatanda.

asr-014117
11:22:51.960 --> 11:22:53.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi yun ang dinadahilan eh.

asr-014118
11:22:53.400 --> 11:22:55.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung mga smokers, makakatulong kayo dito.

asr-014119
11:22:55.500 --> 11:22:56.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And there's a lot of.

asr-014120
11:22:56.080 --> 11:22:57.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There's a lot of anecdotal evidence, ha?

asr-014121
11:22:57.860 --> 11:23:03.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Even Secretary Recto himself said na nakatulong yun to help him stop.

asr-014122
11:23:04.040 --> 11:23:05.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay, I believe you.

asr-014123
11:23:06.340 --> 11:23:08.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But anecdotal is different from scientific.

asr-014124
11:23:08.820 --> 11:23:09.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You ask anyone.

asr-014125
11:23:09.780 --> 11:23:11.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anecdotal is okay noted.

asr-014126
11:23:12.260 --> 11:23:16.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's not enough that it helps adult smokers quit.

asr-014127
11:23:17.120 --> 11:23:20.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It must seriously outweigh the risk of attracting the youth.

asr-014128
11:23:21.120 --> 11:23:22.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Can you apply that standard?

asr-014129
11:23:23.620 --> 11:23:24.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's my question.

asr-014130
11:23:24.660 --> 11:23:26.530
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I end there, Mr. President.

asr-014132
11:23:33.520 --> 11:23:36.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero may lumalabas na gan... So may mga na-reject na kayo dito sa flavor.

asr-014132-split-2
11:23:36.840 --> 11:23:46.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, the ASEC has said that they can reject flavors that are marketed to the youth.

asr-014133
11:23:47.780 --> 11:23:49.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That are attractive to minors.

asr-014134
11:23:49.720 --> 11:23:50.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, I know that.

asr-014135
11:23:50.280 --> 11:23:50.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's in the law.

asr-014136
11:23:51.020 --> 11:23:51.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-014137
11:23:51.540 --> 11:23:52.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's your law.

asr-014138
11:23:52.240 --> 11:23:52.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-014139
11:23:52.860 --> 11:23:53.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's in the law.

asr-014140
11:23:53.520 --> 11:23:54.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's the wording of the law.

asr-014141
11:23:54.380 --> 11:23:55.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, they have done it.

asr-014142
11:23:55.200 --> 11:23:55.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They have done it.

asr-014143
11:23:55.660 --> 11:23:55.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Correct.

asr-014144
11:23:55.860 --> 11:23:55.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-014145
11:23:56.080 --> 11:24:00.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero yung tanong ko nga is, can you implement what I said?

asr-014146
11:24:01.860 --> 11:24:09.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Na i-reject nyo lahat kung wala namang mapapakita na yung risk of attracting the youth is not there.

asr-014147
11:24:10.140 --> 11:24:17.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So sabi nyo nga, sabi sa batas, kasi ang nakalagay sa batas natin, again to be clear Mr. Chairman,

asr-014148
11:24:17.280 --> 11:24:26.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the original wording of the syntax law is that we only allow unflavored or tobacco flavored.

asr-014149
11:24:26.240 --> 11:24:28.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi yun yung nicotine eh, parang ganon.

asr-014150
11:24:28.660 --> 11:24:31.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then menthol, nakipakiusap na bigyan daw ng menthol.

asr-014151
11:24:31.720 --> 11:24:32.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun lang yung nasa bata.

asr-014152
11:24:32.600 --> 11:24:36.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So sabi ko, madali nang mamonitor yan at ma-regulate kasi yun lang eh.

asr-014153
11:24:38.100 --> 11:24:43.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Tapos nung inamend yan, ayun na, may mga bawal, sabi nga yung bawal sa bata,

asr-014154
11:24:43.740 --> 11:24:46.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pero ang dami ng everything else, pwede.

asr-014155
11:24:46.020 --> 11:24:47.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So ano yung pwede?

asr-014156
11:24:49.300 --> 11:24:50.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's then very vague.

asr-014157
11:24:51.540 --> 11:24:53.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So yun lang ang problema natin.

asr-014158
11:24:53.260 --> 11:24:55.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I understand because I know what the law says.

asr-014159
11:24:55.560 --> 11:24:55.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-014160
11:24:55.740 --> 11:25:03.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero, I mean, one million flavors rejected in the U.S.

asr-014161
11:25:03.860 --> 11:25:04.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And tayo, ilan?

asr-014162
11:25:04.980 --> 11:25:06.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Twenty, diba?

asr-014163
11:25:06.460 --> 11:25:08.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So thank you so much, Mr. Chairman, for your patience.

asr-014164
11:25:09.660 --> 11:25:10.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you, DTI.

asr-014165
11:25:10.800 --> 11:25:13.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You do a good job in so many consumer complaints.

asr-014166
11:25:14.920 --> 11:25:18.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But on this one, hindi ko talaga ito titigilan kasi ang daming namamatay

asr-014167
11:25:18.860 --> 11:25:22.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: at yung konting baon ng bata ay nauubos pa sa e-cigarette.

asr-014168
11:25:22.700 --> 11:25:24.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So thank you then for your patience.

asr-014169
11:25:24.800 --> 11:25:25.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Asek, thank you.

asr-014170
11:25:25.740 --> 11:25:26.920
