Senator Imee R. Marcos: ambition have we accomplished

asr-014484
11:38:37.300 --> 11:38:38.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: so far?

asr-014485
11:38:41.380 --> 11:38:42.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, there will be

asr-014486
11:38:42.480 --> 11:38:43.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: a new satellite launch

asr-014487
11:38:43.560 --> 11:38:44.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: next year, Mr. President,

asr-014488
11:38:44.720 --> 11:38:45.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: apart from the February launch.

asr-014489
11:38:45.980 --> 11:38:47.280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And that will give us

asr-014490
11:38:47.280 --> 11:38:50.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: greater capability

asr-014491
11:38:50.640 --> 11:38:51.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to see what?

asr-014492
11:38:52.240 --> 11:38:52.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The weather?

asr-014493
11:38:53.560 --> 11:38:56.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The agricultural needs?

asr-014494
11:38:57.360 --> 11:38:58.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The weather?

asr-014495
11:38:58.200 --> 11:38:59.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I think those are,

asr-014496
11:38:59.020 --> 11:39:00.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: they're apparent on the ground.

asr-014497
11:39:00.440 --> 11:39:00.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: There's no need

asr-014498
11:39:00.980 --> 11:39:02.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to go into outer space.

asr-014499
11:39:02.940 --> 11:39:03.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mr. President,

asr-014500
11:39:03.900 --> 11:39:05.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You see the agricultural problem.

asr-014501
11:39:05.460 --> 11:39:06.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, Mr. President,

asr-014502
11:39:06.340 --> 11:39:07.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: having that

asr-014503
11:39:07.000 --> 11:39:09.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi lang bird's eye view,

asr-014504
11:39:09.180 --> 11:39:10.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: but space view,

asr-014505
11:39:10.560 --> 11:39:11.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: actually can,

asr-014506
11:39:11.840 --> 11:39:13.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that data can be beneficial

asr-014507
11:39:13.360 --> 11:39:14.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for our farmers,

asr-014508
11:39:14.820 --> 11:39:15.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for our agencies.

asr-014509
11:39:16.200 --> 11:39:16.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President,

asr-014510
11:39:16.980 --> 11:39:17.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: to be specific,

asr-014511
11:39:18.380 --> 11:39:19.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: meron siyang applications

asr-014512
11:39:19.320 --> 11:39:19.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa agriculture,

asr-014513
11:39:20.300 --> 11:39:21.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: environmental protection

asr-014514
11:39:21.220 --> 11:39:21.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and monitoring,

asr-014515
11:39:22.260 --> 11:39:24.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: natural resource management,

asr-014516
11:39:24.520 --> 11:39:25.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: disaster risk reduction,

asr-014517
11:39:26.140 --> 11:39:26.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: national security,

asr-014518
11:39:27.100 --> 11:39:28.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: among others,

asr-014519
11:39:28.160 --> 11:39:28.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-014520
11:39:29.020 --> 11:39:30.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, hiwalay po ito

asr-014521
11:39:30.620 --> 11:39:31.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: itong rocket launch

asr-014522
11:39:31.700 --> 11:39:32.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na sinasabi.

asr-014523
11:39:32.600 --> 11:39:33.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's not April,

asr-014524
11:39:33.920 --> 11:39:34.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: as announced,

asr-014525
11:39:35.000 --> 11:39:35.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: it's in February.

asr-014526
11:39:35.900 --> 11:39:36.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-014527
11:39:36.220 --> 11:39:37.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And it's a continuation

asr-014528
11:39:37.180 --> 11:39:39.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of ongoing programs.

asr-014529
11:39:39.200 --> 11:39:39.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that correct?

asr-014530
11:39:39.840 --> 11:39:40.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, Mr. President.

asr-014531
11:39:40.300 --> 11:39:41.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And this has nothing to do either

asr-014532
11:39:41.840 --> 11:39:43.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: with the intended space station,

asr-014533
11:39:44.680 --> 11:39:45.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: space port,

asr-014534
11:39:46.020 --> 11:39:46.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: in Kagayan?

asr-014535
11:39:46.820 --> 11:39:48.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It does, Mr. President,

asr-014536
11:39:48.400 --> 11:39:50.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because the February launch

asr-014537
11:39:50.480 --> 11:39:51.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: will,

asr-014538
11:39:51.860 --> 11:39:53.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: it's like a first phase

asr-014539
11:39:53.480 --> 11:39:54.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: of the space port.

asr-014540
11:39:54.840 --> 11:39:55.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It will eventually build up

asr-014541
11:39:55.920 --> 11:39:56.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: to the space port.

asr-014542
11:39:57.520 --> 11:39:57.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-014543
11:39:57.800 --> 11:39:59.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What about the news,

asr-014544
11:39:59.020 --> 11:40:01.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: regarding Philippine Carabao

asr-014545
11:40:01.020 --> 11:40:03.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mangos for Space Missions?

asr-014546
11:40:03.280 --> 11:40:05.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We're all completely befuddled

asr-014547
11:40:05.480 --> 11:40:06.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: by these programs

asr-014548
11:40:06.760 --> 11:40:09.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of the Philippine Space Agency.

asr-014549
11:40:09.600 --> 11:40:11.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, this is space food research,

asr-014550
11:40:12.080 --> 11:40:13.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-014551
11:40:14.200 --> 11:40:15.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, experiments po ito

asr-014552
11:40:15.520 --> 11:40:17.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: to check if these kinds of food,

asr-014553
11:40:17.880 --> 11:40:18.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which are, of course,

asr-014554
11:40:18.460 --> 11:40:19.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: endemic to the Philippines,

asr-014555
11:40:19.820 --> 11:40:23.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: can be used by other nationalities

asr-014556
11:40:23.760 --> 11:40:24.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: when they have their own

asr-014557
11:40:24.700 --> 11:40:26.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: space food abroad.

asr-014558
11:40:29.020 --> 11:40:30.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The latest news, of course,

asr-014559
11:40:30.520 --> 11:40:31.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: involves Elon Musk

asr-014560
11:40:31.780 --> 11:40:33.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and early talks with SpaceX

asr-014561
11:40:33.320 --> 11:40:34.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to host our own

asr-014562
11:40:34.860 --> 11:40:36.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: commercial rocket launch sites.

asr-014563
11:40:37.500 --> 11:40:39.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And there's been news

asr-014564
11:40:39.660 --> 11:40:41.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of one or two islands

asr-014565
11:40:41.480 --> 11:40:44.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: that will be taken over

asr-014566
11:40:44.220 --> 11:40:45.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: on behalf of the

asr-014567
11:40:45.140 --> 11:40:46.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Philippine Space Agency.

asr-014568
11:40:47.820 --> 11:40:48.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that true?

asr-014569
11:40:48.660 --> 11:40:49.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I mean, obviously,

asr-014570
11:40:50.840 --> 11:40:54.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: this is at its very infant stage.

asr-014571
11:40:54.980 --> 11:40:56.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President,

asr-014572
11:40:56.020 --> 11:40:58.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the Philsa actually,

asr-014573
11:40:58.060 --> 11:41:00.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: welcomes that opportunity

asr-014574
11:41:00.320 --> 11:41:03.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: to actually engage

asr-014575
11:41:03.920 --> 11:41:05.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: with these other companies.

asr-014576
11:41:05.400 --> 11:41:06.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They're currently in discussions

asr-014577
11:41:06.640 --> 11:41:08.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: with SpaceX and Rocket Labs,

asr-014578
11:41:08.560 --> 11:41:09.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: it's another company,

asr-014579
11:41:09.880 --> 11:41:11.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: to explore the possibility

asr-014580
11:41:11.220 --> 11:41:13.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: of having a Philippine launch platform.

asr-014581
11:41:14.940 --> 11:41:16.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And why the Philippines?

asr-014582
11:41:17.180 --> 11:41:18.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We're at the western edge

asr-014583
11:41:18.420 --> 11:41:19.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of the Pacific,

asr-014584
11:41:20.260 --> 11:41:21.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: according to them.

asr-014585
11:41:21.600 --> 11:41:23.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Our proximity to the equator,

asr-014586
11:41:23.580 --> 11:41:26.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I can name dozens of other countries

asr-014587
11:41:26.420 --> 11:41:27.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: that are smack on the equator.

asr-014588
11:41:28.060 --> 11:41:30.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And don't have our issues.

asr-014589
11:41:30.720 --> 11:41:33.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is this an American defense effort?

asr-014590
11:41:34.560 --> 11:41:35.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: This guy,

asr-014591
11:41:35.180 --> 11:41:36.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: is this a commercial effort?

asr-014592
11:41:37.420 --> 11:41:38.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's a civilian effort,

asr-014593
11:41:38.820 --> 11:41:39.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-014594
11:41:39.500 --> 11:41:40.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Well, apparently it is.

asr-014595
11:41:41.020 --> 11:41:41.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: But we're not certain.

asr-014596
11:41:42.060 --> 11:41:43.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's just rather strange

asr-014597
11:41:43.620 --> 11:41:44.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: that they choose the Philippines.

asr-014598
11:41:45.520 --> 11:41:46.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the grounds are because

asr-014599
11:41:46.540 --> 11:41:47.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: we're close to the equator.

asr-014600
11:41:48.060 --> 11:41:50.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: There's so many other countries

asr-014601
11:41:50.220 --> 11:41:51.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: right on the equator

asr-014602
11:41:51.740 --> 11:41:53.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: if the equator was so interesting.

asr-014603
11:41:53.620 --> 11:41:54.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President,

asr-014604
11:41:54.400 --> 11:41:56.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm informed by the agency

asr-014605
11:41:56.180 --> 11:41:57.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that it's also our

asr-014606
11:41:58.060 --> 11:42:00.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: geographical relationship

asr-014607
11:42:00.560 --> 11:42:01.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: with the Pacific Ocean.

asr-014608
11:42:02.740 --> 11:42:03.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the fact that...

asr-014609
11:42:03.720 --> 11:42:04.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We're at the western edge

asr-014610
11:42:04.980 --> 11:42:05.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of the Pacific

asr-014611
11:42:05.640 --> 11:42:07.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: is what the press release said.

asr-014612
11:42:07.920 --> 11:42:08.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah, so that's one.

asr-014613
11:42:09.180 --> 11:42:10.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then the other one

asr-014614
11:42:10.060 --> 11:42:10.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is that CESA...

asr-014615
11:42:10.920 --> 11:42:11.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Why is the western edge

asr-014616
11:42:11.800 --> 11:42:13.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: of the Pacific so important?

asr-014617
11:42:16.240 --> 11:42:16.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So...

asr-014618
11:42:16.720 --> 11:42:21.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So launches go to the east.

asr-014619
11:42:21.640 --> 11:42:22.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm also learning this today,

asr-014620
11:42:22.880 --> 11:42:23.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-014621
11:42:23.860 --> 11:42:24.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So they go to the east.

asr-014622
11:42:24.780 --> 11:42:25.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I don't understand the word.

asr-014623
11:42:25.400 --> 11:42:25.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's okay.

asr-014624
11:42:25.880 --> 11:42:26.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And therefore,

asr-014625
11:42:27.140 --> 11:42:28.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: having that launch platform,

asr-014626
11:42:28.060 --> 11:42:29.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that large body of water

asr-014627
11:42:29.140 --> 11:42:31.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is safer, no?

asr-014628
11:42:32.440 --> 11:42:33.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So...

asr-014629
11:42:33.000 --> 11:42:35.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: If it goes to the east,

asr-014630
11:42:36.200 --> 11:42:37.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: they have Guam

asr-014631
11:42:37.480 --> 11:42:39.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and the Hawaiian Islands.

asr-014632
11:42:39.980 --> 11:42:41.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Well, Mr. President,

asr-014633
11:42:41.620 --> 11:42:42.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: another fact here.

asr-014634
11:42:43.900 --> 11:42:45.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Natatawa rin ako, Mr. President,

asr-014635
11:42:45.600 --> 11:42:46.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa usapan natin.

asr-014636
11:42:47.460 --> 11:42:48.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The other one here

asr-014637
11:42:48.380 --> 11:42:49.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is that CESA

asr-014638
11:42:49.380 --> 11:42:52.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: has the right infrastructure.

asr-014639
11:42:53.520 --> 11:42:54.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I guess this is

asr-014640
11:42:54.160 --> 11:42:55.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the topography of the area.

asr-014641
11:42:58.060 --> 11:42:59.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, because there's an airport,

asr-014642
11:42:59.820 --> 11:43:00.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: a seaport,

asr-014643
11:43:00.560 --> 11:43:02.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: so CESA seems to be

asr-014644
11:43:02.520 --> 11:43:04.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: an ideal site

asr-014645
11:43:04.800 --> 11:43:05.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for a rocket launch,

asr-014646
11:43:05.860 --> 11:43:06.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President.

asr-014647
11:43:06.860 --> 11:43:08.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Coming from our friends

asr-014648
11:43:08.300 --> 11:43:08.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: from Philsa.

asr-014649
11:43:09.100 --> 11:43:10.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi pa nga nabubuo

asr-014650
11:43:10.460 --> 11:43:11.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: yung kanilang airport,

asr-014651
11:43:11.940 --> 11:43:13.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: magra-rocketport pa kayo.

asr-014652
11:43:14.600 --> 11:43:16.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang takal-takal na nalang yun.

asr-014653
11:43:16.160 --> 11:43:16.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: May I ask a question,

asr-014654
11:43:16.940 --> 11:43:17.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mr. President?

asr-014655
11:43:17.420 --> 11:43:18.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: They're paying us, right?

asr-014656
11:43:19.320 --> 11:43:20.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya natatawa po kami

asr-014657
11:43:20.600 --> 11:43:22.280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: dahil yung kagayan airport

asr-014658
11:43:22.280 --> 11:43:23.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: doon sa lalo,

asr-014659
11:43:23.600 --> 11:43:25.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: hindi pa nga makapag-takeoff

asr-014660
11:43:25.360 --> 11:43:26.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: miski aeroplano.

asr-014661
11:43:26.460 --> 11:43:28.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh, biglang magkakaroon

asr-014662
11:43:28.620 --> 11:43:29.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ng rocket launch,

asr-014663
11:43:29.540 --> 11:43:31.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: magkakamot kami lahat ng ulo.

asr-014664
11:43:31.200 --> 11:43:32.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Paano kaya yun?

asr-014665
11:43:32.120 --> 11:43:32.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President,

asr-014666
